msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Entry Source`: Defines how :doc:`work entries <../"
"work_entries>` are generated for payroll during the specified pay period. "
"The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fuente de entrada de trabajo`: define cómo se generan "
"las :doc:`entradas de trabajo <../work_entries>` para la nómina durante el "
"período de pago especificado. Las opciones son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/australia.rst:308
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:144
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:140
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:126
