#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:563
msgid "Special case: employees hired before 2014"
msgstr "Caso especial: empleados contratados antes de 2014"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:565
msgid ""
"For employees who started before January 1, 2014, the notice period "
"calculation is divided into two parts:"
msgstr ""
"Para empleados que comenzaron antes del 1 de enero de 2014, el cálculo del "
"período de preaviso se divide en dos partes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:569
msgid "Part 1: Seniority acquired before December 31, 2013"
msgstr "Parte 1: Antigüedad adquirida antes del 31 de diciembre de 2013"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:571
msgid ""
"**Lower-level employees** (annual gross salary ≤ €32,254): The notice period "
"is 3 months for the first 5 years of seniority, increasing by 1.5 months per "
"additional year."
msgstr ""
"**Empleados de nivel inferior** (salario bruto anual ≤ 32.254 €): El período "
"de preaviso es de 3 meses para los primeros 5 años de antigüedad, aumentando "
"1,5 meses por cada año adicional."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:573
msgid ""
"**Higher-level employees** (annual gross salary > €32,254): The notice "
"period is 1 month per started year of seniority, with a minimum of 3 months."
msgstr ""
"**Empleados de nivel superior** (salario bruto anual > 32.254 €): El período "
"de preaviso es de 1 mes por año comenzado de antigüedad, con un mínimo de 3 "
"meses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:577
msgid "Part 2: Seniority acquired from January 1, 2014 onwards"
msgstr "Parte 2: Antigüedad adquirida a partir del 1 de enero de 2014"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:579
msgid ""
"The standard notice period rules from 2014 apply to seniority acquired after "
"this date."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas estándar del período de preaviso de 2014 se aplican a la "
"antigüedad adquirida después de esta fecha."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:581
msgid ""
"The total notice period is the sum of both periods calculated separately."
msgstr ""
"El período total de preaviso es la suma de ambos períodos calculados por "
"separado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:584
msgid "Severance pay calculation"
msgstr "Cálculo de la indemnización por despido"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:586
msgid ""
"If an employee does not serve their notice period, severance pay is "
"calculated based on:"
msgstr ""
"Si un empleado no cumple su período de preaviso, la indemnización por "
"despido se calcula en función de:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:588
msgid "The remaining notice duration."
msgstr "La duración restante del preaviso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:589
msgid "The employee's last salary."
msgstr "El último salario del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:590
msgid ""
"Additional compensation such as bonuses, stock options, and insurance "
"contributions."
msgstr ""
"Compensación adicional como bonificaciones, opciones sobre acciones y "
"contribuciones de seguros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:592
msgid "The severance pay consists of:"
msgstr "La indemnización por despido consiste en:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:594
msgid ""
"The current salary, which corresponds either to the full notice period that "
"should normally be observed or the remaining part of it."
msgstr ""
"El salario actual, que corresponde al período completo de preaviso que "
"normalmente debería observarse o la parte restante del mismo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:596
msgid ""
"Benefits acquired during the contract (e.g., meal vouchers, company car, "
"mobile phone usage)."
msgstr ""
"Beneficios adquiridos durante el contrato (por ejemplo, vales de comida, "
"coche de empresa, uso de teléfono móvil)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:598
msgid "The current salary is determined as follows:"
msgstr "El salario actual se determina de la siguiente manera:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:600
msgid "The employee's gross monthly salary at the time of dismissal."
msgstr "El salario mensual bruto del empleado en el momento del despido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:601
msgid ""
"All recurring bonuses, except for one-time bonuses (e.g., team work bonus, "
"seniority bonus)."
msgstr ""
"Todas las bonificaciones recurrentes, excepto las bonificaciones únicas (por "
"ejemplo, bonificación por trabajo en equipo, bonificación por antigüedad)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:602
msgid "Additional compensation for overtime hours worked over a longer period."
msgstr ""
"Compensación adicional por horas extraordinarias trabajadas durante un "
"período más largo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:603
msgid "Variable salary (average over the last twelve months)."
msgstr "Salario variable (promedio de los últimos doce meses)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:605
msgid ""
"The system automatically generates a termination payslip including these "
"calculations, ensuring compliance with Belgian labor laws."
msgstr ""
"El sistema genera automáticamente una nómina de terminación que incluye "
"estos cálculos, garantizando el cumplimiento de las leyes laborales belgas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:611
msgid ""
"In Odoo, to access the departure process, go to the employee form view and "
"click on :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Action)` then :guilabel:`Departure: "
"Notice Period and payslip` or navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll --> "
"Reporting --> Departure: Notice Period`."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, para acceder al proceso de salida, ve al formulario del empleado y "
"haz clic en :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acción` y luego en :guilabel:`Salida: "
"Período de preaviso y nómina` o navega a :menuselection:`Nómina --> Informes "
"--> Salida: Período de preaviso`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:615
msgid ""
"In the wizard that appears, select the reason for departure, provide a "
"description of the departure, and specify the dismissal date. The employee's "
"seniority is calculated based on their contract history, and the notice "
"period is determined accordingly. You can also indicate whether the employee "
"will be working during the notice period."
msgstr ""
"En el asistente que aparece, selecciona el motivo de la salida, proporciona "
"una descripción de la salida y especifica la fecha de despido. La antigüedad "
"del empleado se calcula en función de su historial de contrato y el período "
"de preaviso se determina en consecuencia. También puedes indicar si el "
"empleado trabajará durante el período de preaviso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:620
msgid "Departure Notice Wizard."
msgstr "Asistente de aviso de salida."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:623
msgid ""
"If the employee is working during the notice period, there are no "
"termination fees to calculate, and the notice period will be recorded on the "
"employee's form. Click the :guilabel:`Validate` button."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado está trabajando durante el período de preaviso, no hay "
"tarifas de terminación que calcular y el período de preaviso se registrará "
"en el formulario del empleado. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Validar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:627
msgid ""
"If the employee is working partially or not at all, the wizard will generate "
"and calculate a termination fees payslip. Click the :guilabel:`Validate & "
"Compute termination fees` button."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado trabaja parcialmente o no trabaja en absoluto, el asistente "
"generará y calculará una nómina de tarifas de terminación. Haz clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Validar y calcular tarifas de terminación`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:630
msgid ""
"The payslip takes into account all the salaries and benefits the employee "
"would have received over the course of a year to calculate a virtual annual "
"remuneration. This amount is then prorated based on the notice period to "
"convert it into a gross salary."
msgstr ""
"La nómina toma en cuenta todos los salarios y beneficios que el empleado "
"habría recibido durante el curso de un año para calcular una remuneración "
"anual virtual. Esta cantidad se prorratea luego en función del período de "
"preaviso para convertirla en un salario bruto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:634
msgid "A detailed summary is provided on the payslip."
msgstr "Se proporciona un resumen detallado en la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:637
msgid "Departure Notice: Termination Fees Payslip 1."
msgstr "Aviso de salida: Nómina de tarifas de terminación 1."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:640
msgid "Departure Notice: Termination Fees Payslip 2."
msgstr "Aviso de salida: Nómina de tarifas de terminación 2."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:644
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1354
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2118
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:2253
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "Conclusión"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:646
msgid ""
"This module simplifies the departure process by providing clear and "
"automatic calculations for the notice period and severance pay. It helps HR "
"teams ensure compliance and streamline the exit process for employees."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo simplifica el proceso de salida proporcionando cálculos claros y "
"automáticos para el período de preaviso y la indemnización por despido. "
"Ayuda a los equipos de RRHH a garantizar el cumplimiento y agilizar el "
"proceso de salida de los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:653
msgid "DIMONA"
msgstr "DIMONA"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:656
msgid "What is the Dimona?"
msgstr "¿Qué es el Dimona?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:659
msgid "Obligation"
msgstr "Obligación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:661
msgid ""
"All employers, both in the public and private sectors, are required to "
"electronically communicate the entry and exit of their personnel to the "
"National Social Security Office (Royal Decree of November 5, 2002)."
msgstr ""
"Todos los empleadores, tanto del sector público como privado, están "
"obligados a comunicar electrónicamente la entrada y salida de su personal a "
"la Oficina Nacional de Seguridad Social (Real Decreto del 5 de noviembre de "
"2002)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:665
msgid ""
"This involves the immediate declaration of employment, also known as DIMONA "
"(Déclaration Immédiate - Onmiddellijke Aangifte). Its purpose is to "
"immediately notify social security institutions of the beginning and end of "
"an employment relationship between the worker and the employer."
msgstr ""
"Esto implica la declaración inmediata de empleo, también conocida como "
"DIMONA (Déclaration Immédiate - Onmiddellijke Aangifte). Su propósito es "
"notificar inmediatamente a las instituciones de seguridad social sobre el "
"inicio y fin de una relación laboral entre el trabajador y el empleador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:669
msgid ""
"The declarations submitted by the employer and immediately checked by the "
"NSSO feed into a database called the *personnel file*. The employer can "
"access it in a secure environment. There are numerous search criteria: they "
"can be based on characteristics and combinations of characteristics."
msgstr ""
"Las declaraciones presentadas por el empleador e inmediatamente verificadas "
"por la ONSS se incorporan a una base de datos llamada *archivo de personal*. "
"El empleador puede acceder a ella en un entorno seguro. Existen numerosos "
"criterios de búsqueda: pueden basarse en características y combinaciones de "
"características."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:673
msgid ""
"Failure to comply with this reporting obligation may result in criminal "
"penalties as provided for in Article 181 of the Social Penal Code."
msgstr ""
"El incumplimiento de esta obligación de declaración puede resultar en "
"sanciones penales según lo dispuesto en el Artículo 181 del Código Penal "
"Social."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:676
msgid ""
"Furthermore, in case of omission of declaration, the employer will owe the "
"NSSO a solidarity contribution."
msgstr ""
"Además, en caso de omisión de declaración, el empleador deberá a la ONSS una "
"contribución solidaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:680
msgid "Concept and terminology"
msgstr "Concepto y terminología"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:683
msgid "Employer-worker relationship"
msgstr "Relación empleador-trabajador"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:685
msgid ""
"The relationship between the \"employer\" and the \"worker\" couple. This "
"relationship includes stable data (employer identification number, worker's "
"national identification social security number (NISS), start date of the "
"relationship, and optionally end date), which will be maintained even in "
"case of creation, closure, modification, or cancellation of a period. This "
"relationship begins with the worker's first engagement and ends at the end "
"of their last occupation. In the personnel file, \"employer-worker\" "
"relationships constitute the first level of consultation. The second level "
"encompasses all Dimona periods;"
msgstr ""
"La relación entre el par \"empleador\" y \"trabajador\". Esta relación "
"incluye datos estables (número de identificación del empleador, número de "
"seguridad social de identificación nacional del trabajador (NISS), fecha de "
"inicio de la relación y opcionalmente fecha de finalización), que se "
"mantendrán incluso en caso de creación, cierre, modificación o cancelación "
"de un período. Esta relación comienza con el primer compromiso del "
"trabajador y finaliza al término de su última ocupación. En el archivo de "
"personal, las relaciones \"empleador-trabajador\" constituyen el primer "
"nivel de consulta. El segundo nivel abarca todos los períodos Dimona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:694
msgid "Dimona period"
msgstr "Período Dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:696
msgid ""
"A period is created with each IN declaration, thus at the beginning of each "
"new occupation. It is closed by an exit date at the end of each occupation. "
"The employer-worker relationship, on the other hand, is maintained until the "
"end of the last occupation. Several Dimona periods may or may not succeed "
"each other within the same employer-worker relationship."
msgstr ""
"Se crea un período con cada declaración IN, es decir, al comienzo de cada "
"nueva ocupación. Se cierra mediante una fecha de salida al final de cada "
"ocupación. La relación empleador-trabajador, por otro lado, se mantiene "
"hasta el final de la última ocupación. Varios períodos Dimona pueden o no "
"sucederse dentro de la misma relación empleador-trabajador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:701
msgid ""
"Any changes generated by an OUT declaration, a modification (UPDATE), or a "
"cancellation (CANCEL) occur at this second level."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier cambio generado por una declaración OUT, una modificación (UPDATE) "
"o una cancelación (CANCEL) se produce en este segundo nivel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:704
msgid ""
"This Dimona period is identified by a \"period identification number\". It "
"is assigned to each IN declaration and constitutes the unique identification "
"key of a period for submitting OUT, modification, or cancellation "
"declarations."
msgstr ""
"Este periodo Dimona se identifica mediante un \"número de identificación de "
"periodo\". Se asigna a cada declaración IN y constituye la clave de "
"identificación única de un periodo para presentar declaraciones OUT, de "
"modificación o de cancelación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:709
msgid "Dimona number"
msgstr "Número Dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:711
msgid ""
"A unique number assigned by the NSSO to each Dimona declaration (IN, OUT, "
"UPDATE, CANCEL,...). For an IN declaration, it is the period identification "
"number. When declarations are submitted via file transfer, multiple Dimona "
"numbers are created: one number per employment relationship included in the "
"structured message;"
msgstr ""
"Número único asignado por la NSSO a cada declaración Dimona (IN, OUT, "
"UPDATE, CANCEL,...). Para una declaración IN, es el número de identificación "
"de periodo. Cuando las declaraciones se presentan mediante transferencia de "
"archivos, se crean múltiples números Dimona: un número por relación laboral "
"incluida en el mensaje estructurado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:717
msgid "Dimona characteristics"
msgstr "Características Dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:719
msgid ""
"Mandatory data of a Dimona declaration. There are four: the industry sector "
"number, worker type, sub-entity (reserved for certain public sector "
"employers), and user (for temporary workers). Characteristics are always "
"linked to a period. In case of different characteristics, multiple periods "
"can coexist;"
msgstr ""
"Datos obligatorios de una declaración Dimona. Son cuatro: el número de "
"sector industrial, tipo de trabajador, subentidad (reservada para ciertos "
"empleadores del sector público) y usuario (para trabajadores temporales). "
"Las características siempre están vinculadas a un periodo. En caso de "
"características diferentes, pueden coexistir múltiples periodos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:725
msgid "Receipt confirmation"
msgstr "Confirmación de recepción"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:727
msgid ""
"Confirms for web users that the declaration has been received (appears "
"immediately on the screen);"
msgstr ""
"Confirma a los usuarios web que se ha recibido la declaración (aparece "
"inmediatamente en la pantalla)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:730
msgid "Receipt acknowledgment"
msgstr "Acuse de recibo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:732
msgid ""
"Electronic message for batch senders indicating whether the file is usable "
"for the NSSO. This \"receipt acknowledgment\" contains the ticket number "
"(:dfn:`file identification number`) and the file status: accepted or "
"rejected depending on whether the file is readable or not;"
msgstr ""
"Mensaje electrónico para los remitentes por lotes que indica si el archivo "
"es utilizable para la NSSO. Este \"acuse de recibo\" contiene el número de "
"ticket (:dfn:`número de identificación de archivo`) y el estado del archivo: "
"aceptado o rechazado según si el archivo es legible o no."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:737
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "Notificación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:739
msgid ""
"Electronic message with feedback on the processing of the declaration. The "
"notification is the immediate result of form and content checks. It can be "
"of three types: positive (Dimona accepted), negative (Dimona rejected), or "
"provisional (only in case of problems with worker identification). The "
"provisional notification will always be followed by a positive or negative "
"notification."
msgstr ""
"Mensaje electrónico con información sobre el procesamiento de la "
"declaración. La notificación es el resultado inmediato de las comprobaciones "
"de forma y contenido. Puede ser de tres tipos: positiva (Dimona aceptada), "
"negativa (Dimona rechazada) o provisional (solo en caso de problemas con la "
"identificación del trabajador). La notificación provisional siempre será "
"seguida de una notificación positiva o negativa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:744
msgid ""
"For the declaration of students under a student contract (STU), the "
"notification will also contain a warning if the student is declared for more "
"than 475 hours. If the declaration was made via a secure channel, the exact "
"number of days of excess will be communicated."
msgstr ""
"Para la declaración de estudiantes bajo contrato de estudiante (STU), la "
"notificación también contendrá una advertencia si el estudiante se declara "
"por más de 475 horas. Si la declaración se realizó mediante un canal seguro, "
"se comunicará el número exacto de días de exceso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:748
msgid ""
"For the daily declaration of occasional workers in the hospitality industry, "
"the notification will also contain a warning if the worker is declared for "
"more than 50 days and/or for the employer quota, if more than 100 days of "
"occasional work have been declared."
msgstr ""
"Para la declaración diaria de trabajadores ocasionales en la industria de la "
"hostelería, la notificación también contendrá una advertencia si el "
"trabajador se declara por más de 50 días y/o para la cuota del empleador, si "
"se han declarado más de 100 días de trabajo ocasional."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:752
msgid ""
"Once you have received this notification, you have five working days to "
"contest the accuracy of the data mentioned therein. At the end of this "
"period, these data will be considered final. For any disputes, you must "
"contact the Eranova Contact Center (tel: 02 511 51 51, email: "
"contactcenter@eranova.fgov.be)."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que hayas recibido esta notificación, tienes cinco días hábiles para "
"impugnar la exactitud de los datos mencionados en ella. Al final de este "
"periodo, estos datos se considerarán definitivos. Para cualquier disputa, "
"debes contactar al Centro de Contacto Eranova (tel: 02 511 51 51, email: "
"contactcenter@eranova.fgov.be)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:757
msgid ""
"Note that if the employer is affiliated with an approved social secretariat "
"or a full-service secretariat, they may not receive any notification. In "
"this case, notifications are electronically transmitted to the social "
"secretariat or full-service secretariat, even for declarations that the "
"employer has submitted personally. However, the employer has access to the "
"personnel file, where they can view all data."
msgstr ""
"Ten en cuenta que si el empleador está afiliado a una secretaría social "
"aprobada o a una secretaría de servicio completo, es posible que no reciba "
"ninguna notificación. En este caso, las notificaciones se transmiten "
"electrónicamente a la secretaría social o secretaría de servicio completo, "
"incluso para las declaraciones que el empleador ha presentado personalmente. "
"Sin embargo, el empleador tiene acceso al archivo de personal, donde puede "
"ver todos los datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:764
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Canales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:766
msgid ""
"The Dimona declaration must be submitted in the form of an electronic "
"message via one of the following channels:"
msgstr ""
"La declaración Dimona debe presentarse en forma de mensaje electrónico a "
"través de uno de los siguientes canales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:769
msgid "web"
msgstr "web"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:770
msgid "personnel file"
msgstr "archivo de personal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:771
msgid "file transfer"
msgstr "transferencia de archivos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:772
msgid "web service (REST)"
msgstr "servicio web (REST)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:773
msgid "Dimona Mobile"
msgstr "Dimona Mobile"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:775
msgid ""
"The choice of one channel over another has no impact on the declaration. "
"Therefore, you can freely choose the channel you will use."
msgstr ""
"La elección de un canal sobre otro no tiene impacto en la declaración. Por "
"lo tanto, puedes elegir libremente el canal que utilizarás."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:778
msgid ""
"Any declaration modifications can also be made through any of these four "
"channels. The channel through which the original declaration was submitted "
"plays no role."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier modificación de la declaración también se puede realizar a través "
"de cualquiera de estos cuatro canales. El canal a través del cual se "
"presentó la declaración original no tiene ningún papel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:781
msgid "A Dimona declaration cannot be submitted via SMS."
msgstr "Una declaración Dimona no se puede presentar por SMS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:784
msgid "Dimona in Odoo"
msgstr "Dimona en Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:787
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Manual"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:789
msgid ""
"In Odoo, when you have the Belgian Payroll Localization installed, as soon "
"as you have a contract set to the running stage, it creates an activity for "
"the HR responsible that they need to introduce the Dimona for today with the "
"correct link to the Dimona Platform (the web channel mentioned in the "
"Channels section of this article)."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, cuando tienes instalada la Localización de Nómina Belga, tan pronto "
"como tienes un contrato configurado en la etapa en ejecución, se crea una "
"actividad para el responsable de RRHH indicando que necesita introducir la "
"Dimona para hoy con el enlace correcto a la Plataforma Dimona (el canal web "
"mencionado en la sección Canales de este artículo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:794
msgid "Dimona Activity."
msgstr "Actividad Dimona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:798
msgid "Automated"
msgstr "Automatizado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:800
msgid ""
"In Odoo, when you have the Belgian Payroll Localization installed, it is "
"also possible to install the module Belgium - Payroll - Dimona. This module "
"will allow you to perform the 4 main actions needed in the Dimona (as seen "
"in Section 1 of this article):"
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, cuando tienes instalada la Localización de Nómina Belga, también es "
"posible instalar el módulo Bélgica - Nómina - Dimona. Este módulo te "
"permitirá realizar las 4 acciones principales necesarias en la Dimona (como "
"se vio en la Sección 1 de este artículo):"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:804
msgid "Open the dimona"
msgstr "Abrir la dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:805
msgid "Update the dimona"
msgstr "Actualizar la dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:806
msgid "Close the dimona"
msgstr "Cerrar la dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:807
msgid "Cancel the Dimona"
msgstr "Cancelar la Dimona"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:809
msgid "These actions answer the different use case explained in Section 1."
msgstr ""
"Estas acciones responden a los diferentes casos de uso explicados en la "
"Sección 1."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:812
msgid "Contract and employee data"
msgstr "Datos del contrato y del empleado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:814
msgid ""
"Basically, it checks the contract and employee data needed to create, "
"update, close or cancel."
msgstr ""
"Básicamente, verifica los datos del contrato y del empleado necesarios para "
"crear, actualizar, cerrar o cancelar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:817
msgid "Error handling"
msgstr "Gestión de errores"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:819
msgid ""
"If some information is missing or wrongly configured, the system will return "
"errors and you can take corrective action in order to make sure your Dimona "
"is correctly sent, updated, closed or canceled."
msgstr ""
"Si falta información o está mal configurada, el sistema devolverá errores y "
"podrás tomar medidas correctivas para asegurarte de que tu Dimona se envíe, "
"actualice, cierre o cancele correctamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:824
msgid "Synchronization status"
msgstr "Estado de sincronización"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:826
msgid "The status of sync and errors are shown in the chatter of the contract."
msgstr ""
"El estado de sincronización y los errores se muestran en el chatter del "
"contrato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:829
msgid "Scheduled action"
msgstr "Acción programada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:831
msgid ""
"Finally, the cron checks every day, for all contracts that have the status "
"dimona waiting and triggers the necessary actions to update the dimona "
"status accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, el cron verifica todos los días todos los contratos que tienen "
"el estado dimona en espera y activa las acciones necesarias para actualizar "
"el estado de la dimona en consecuencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:835
msgid "Technical configuration (outside Odoo)"
msgstr "Configuración técnica (fuera de Odoo)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:837
msgid ""
"Regarding the technical configuration, everything is described in the module "
"information with all the technical prerequisites. If your customer or "
"partner need further assistance with that, they need to contact their IT "
"department or representatives as this is not part of Odoo configuration."
msgstr ""
"En cuanto a la configuración técnica, todo está descrito en la información "
"del módulo con todos los requisitos técnicos previos. Si tu cliente o socio "
"necesita más ayuda con eso, debe contactar a su departamento de TI o "
"representantes, ya que esto no forma parte de la configuración de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:842
msgid "Functional configuration (within Odoo)"
msgstr "Configuración funcional (dentro de Odoo)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:844
msgid ""
"From the Odoo configuration point of view, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Settings` and in "
"the :guilabel:`Belgian Localization` section for :guilabel:`ONSS`, configure "
"the following:"
msgstr ""
"Desde el punto de vista de la configuración de Odoo, navega "
"a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Ajustes` y en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Localización belga` para :guilabel:`ONSS`, configura lo "
"siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:848
msgid ":guilabel:`ONSS Company ID`: VAT Number of the Company"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ID de empresa ONSS`: número de IVA de la empresa"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:849
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registration Number`: 9 digits code received from the NSSO (ONSS "
"- RSZ)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de registro`: código de 9 dígitos recibido del NSSO (ONSS "
"- RSZ)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:850
msgid ""
":guilabel:`DMFA Employer Class`: 3 digits code received from the NSSO (ONSS "
"- RSZ)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Clase de empleador DMFA`: código de 3 dígitos recibido del NSSO "
"(ONSS - RSZ)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:851
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expeditor Number ONSS`: Not Mandatory (see technical "
"documentation of the module for more information)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de expedidor ONSS`: no obligatorio (consulta la "
"documentación técnica del módulo para obtener más información)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:853
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PEM Certificate`, :guilabel:`PEM Passphare`, :guilabel:`KEY "
"file`: check the module information for explanation"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Certificado PEM`, :guilabel:`Frase de contraseña "
"PEM`, :guilabel:`Archivo KEY`: consulta la información del módulo para "
"obtener una explicación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:859
msgid "DmfA - Multifunctional Declaration"
msgstr "DmfA - Declaración multifuncional"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:864
msgid ""
"DmfA stands for \"Déclaration Multifonctionnelle\" or \"Multifunctionele "
"Aangifte.\" It has replaced the quarterly ONSS declaration since the first "
"quarter of 2003. Through this declaration, employers submit salary and "
"working time data for their employees."
msgstr ""
"DmfA significa «Déclaration Multifonctionnelle» o «Multifunctionele "
"Aangifte». Ha reemplazado la declaración trimestral ONSS desde el primer "
"trimestre de 2003. A través de esta declaración, los empleadores envían "
"datos de salario y tiempo de trabajo de sus empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:868
msgid ""
"These data are processed in a way that allows all social security "
"institutions to work with the same information. The declaration is called "
"\"multifunctional\" because it is used not only for social security "
"contribution calculations and reductions but also as a data source for "
"institutions managing social security rights and benefits."
msgstr ""
"Estos datos se procesan de manera que permiten a todas las instituciones de "
"seguridad social trabajar con la misma información. La declaración se llama "
"«multifuncional» porque se utiliza no solo para cálculos de contribuciones a "
"la seguridad social y reducciones, sino también como fuente de datos para "
"instituciones que gestionan derechos y beneficios de seguridad social."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:873
msgid "Sectors utilizing DmfA data include:"
msgstr "Los sectores que utilizan datos de DmfA incluyen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:875
msgid "Health insurance"
msgstr "Seguro de salud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:876
msgid "Unemployment benefits"
msgstr "Prestaciones de desempleo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:877
msgid "Pensions"
msgstr "Pensiones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:878
msgid "Occupational risks (Fedris)"
msgstr "Riesgos laborales (Fedris)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:879
msgid "Family allowances"
msgstr "Asignaciones familiares"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:880
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/egypt.rst:89
msgid "Annual leave"
msgstr "Vacaciones anuales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:882
msgid "All employers registered with ONSS must submit a DmfA declaration."
msgstr ""
"Todos los empleadores registrados con ONSS deben presentar una declaración "
"DmfA."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:885
msgid "Relationship with Dimona and DRS"
msgstr "Relación con Dimona y DRS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:887
msgid "DmfA is closely linked to two other mandatory declarations:"
msgstr ""
"DmfA está estrechamente vinculado a otras dos declaraciones obligatorias:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:890
msgid "Dimona (immediate declaration)"
msgstr "Dimona (declaración inmediata)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:892
msgid ""
"Dimona records the start and end of an employment relationship with an "
"employee."
msgstr ""
"Dimona registra el inicio y el final de una relación laboral con un empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:895
msgid "DRS (social risks declaration)"
msgstr "DRS (declaración de riesgos sociales)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:897
msgid ""
"During an employment relationship, various social risks may arise, such as "
"termination, workplace accidents, or long-term illness. When a social risk "
"occurs, social security institutions require additional information beyond "
"that provided by DmfA and Dimona."
msgstr ""
"Durante una relación laboral, pueden surgir diversos riesgos sociales, como "
"terminación, accidentes laborales o enfermedades de larga duración. Cuando "
"ocurre un riesgo social, las instituciones de seguridad social requieren "
"información adicional más allá de la proporcionada por DmfA y Dimona."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:901
msgid ""
"DRS is now primarily an electronic declaration, though paper submissions "
"remain possible."
msgstr ""
"DRS es ahora principalmente una declaración electrónica, aunque las "
"presentaciones en papel siguen siendo posibles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:904
msgid "Who submits the DmfA declaration?"
msgstr "¿Quién presenta la declaración DmfA?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:907
msgid "Self-declaration options"
msgstr "Opciones de autodeclaración"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:909
msgid "Employers can submit their DmfA declaration themselves via:"
msgstr ""
"Los empleadores pueden presentar su declaración DmfA ellos mismos a través "
"de:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:911
msgid ""
"**Web Submission:** Suitable for employers with a small workforce. "
"Declarations are entered directly through the social security portal."
msgstr ""
"**Presentación web:** Adecuada para empleadores con una pequeña plantilla. "
"Las declaraciones se introducen directamente a través del portal de "
"seguridad social."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:913
msgid ""
"**Batch Submission:** Designed for large employers or organizations handling "
"multiple declarations (e.g., social secretariats, payroll software "
"providers). Declarations are submitted via file transfer (FTP, SFTP, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"**Presentación por lotes:** Diseñada para grandes empleadores u "
"organizaciones que gestionan múltiples declaraciones (p. ej., secretarías "
"sociales, proveedores de software de nómina). Las declaraciones se envían "
"mediante transferencia de archivos (FTP, SFTP, etc.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:918
msgid "Advantages of web submission"
msgstr "Ventajas de la presentación web"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:920
msgid ""
"**Automatic access to the company's employee list**: Based on Dimona data. "
"If an employee is missing, they must first be declared via Dimona. After 24 "
"hours, the employee list is updated, allowing for an accurate DmfA "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"**Acceso automático a la lista de empleados de la empresa**: Basado en datos "
"de Dimona. Si falta un empleado, primero debe declararse a través de Dimona. "
"Después de 24 horas, la lista de empleados se actualiza, permitiendo una "
"presentación DmfA precisa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:923
msgid ""
"**Automatic calculation of net payable amount**: Once all required data is "
"entered, the system calculates the total payable amount."
msgstr ""
"**Cálculo automático del importe neto a pagar**: Una vez introducidos todos "
"los datos requeridos, el sistema calcula el importe total a pagar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:925
msgid ""
"**Reduction calculations**: The system calculates applicable reductions, "
"except for reductions under code \"0001\" (personal contribution reductions "
"for low-income workers). Employers need to check the relevant boxes and, if "
"necessary, provide additional details."
msgstr ""
"**Cálculos de reducciones**: El sistema calcula las reducciones aplicables, "
"excepto las reducciones bajo el código \"0001\" (reducciones de "
"contribuciones personales para trabajadores de bajos ingresos). Los "
"empleadores deben marcar las casillas correspondientes y, si es necesario, "
"proporcionar detalles adicionales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:930
msgid "Advantages of batch submission"
msgstr "Ventajas de la presentación por lotes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:932
msgid ""
"**Submission of large volumes of declarations**: Ideal for organizations "
"managing multiple payrolls."
msgstr ""
"**Presentación de grandes volúmenes de declaraciones**: Ideal para "
"organizaciones que gestionan múltiples nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:934
msgid ""
"**Quick response on acceptance status**: Employers receive immediate "
"feedback on whether their declaration has been accepted."
msgstr ""
"**Respuesta rápida sobre el estado de aceptación**: Los empleadores reciben "
"información inmediata sobre si su declaración ha sido aceptada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:936
msgid ""
"**Error reporting**: The system generates a report on detected anomalies, "
"regardless of acceptance status."
msgstr ""
"**Informe de errores**: El sistema genera un informe sobre las anomalías "
"detectadas, independientemente del estado de aceptación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:938
msgid ""
"**Automatic correction of calculation errors**: When possible, errors are "
"corrected automatically, and employers are notified of adjustments."
msgstr ""
"**Corrección automática de errores de cálculo**: Cuando es posible, los "
"errores se corrigen automáticamente y se notifica a los empleadores sobre "
"los ajustes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:942
msgid "Third-Party submission options"
msgstr "Opciones de presentación de terceros"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:944
msgid ""
"Employers who do not wish to submit the DmfA themselves can delegate the "
"task to:"
msgstr ""
"Los empleadores que no deseen presentar el DmfA ellos mismos pueden delegar "
"la tarea a:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:946
msgid ""
"**Accredited Social Secretariats**: These organizations handle payroll and "
"declaration tasks on behalf of employers."
msgstr ""
"**Secretarías sociales acreditadas**: Estas organizaciones gestionan las "
"tareas de nómina y declaración en nombre de los empleadores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:948
msgid ""
"**Service Providers**: These may be companies or individuals with whom the "
"employer has a contractual agreement to manage payroll declarations securely."
msgstr ""
"**Proveedores de servicios**: Pueden ser empresas o individuos con quienes "
"el empleador tiene un acuerdo contractual para gestionar las declaraciones "
"de nómina de forma segura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:951
msgid ""
"For more information on accredited social secretariats or service providers, "
"please refer to the relevant `official DmfA documentation <https://"
"www.socialsecurity.be/site_fr/employer/applics/dmfa/index.htm>`_."
msgstr ""
"Para más información sobre secretarías sociales acreditadas o proveedores de "
"servicios, consulta la `documentación oficial del DmfA <https://"
"www.socialsecurity.be/site_fr/employer/applics/dmfa/index.htm>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:958
msgid ""
"The declaration is generated under :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting "
"--> Belgium --> DmfA` as is supposed to work properly after several required "
"configuration steps."
msgstr ""
"La declaración se genera en :menuselection:`Aplicación de Nómina --> "
"Informes --> Bélgica --> DmfA` y se supone que funciona correctamente "
"después de varios pasos de configuración obligatorios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:962
msgid "Company"
msgstr "Compañía"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:964
