msgstr ":guilabel:`Tipo de empleador FFE` (Fonds de Fermeture d'Entreprise)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:979
msgid ""
"Additionally, each employee must be assigned to a valid working address, "
