#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1218
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1538
msgid ""
"A withholding tax exemption is granted when the normal annual gross income "
"does not exceed a specific threshold, which is determined based on the "
"number of dependent children [2]."
msgstr ""
"Se concede una exención de retención fiscal cuando los ingresos brutos "
"anuales normales no superan un umbral específico, que se determina según el "
"número de hijos dependientes [2]."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1221
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1541
msgid "A disabled dependent child counts as two."
msgstr "Un hijo dependiente con discapacidad cuenta como dos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1223
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1543
msgid "The method involves referring to a two-column table:"
msgstr "El método consiste en consultar una tabla de dos columnas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1225
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1545
msgid "**Column 1**: Indicates the number of dependent children."
msgstr "**Columna 1**: Indica el número de hijos dependientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1226
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1546
msgid ""
"**Column 2**: Specifies the maximum allowable normal annual gross income, "
"based on the number of dependent children listed in Column 1, which must not "
"be exceeded to qualify for full or partial exemption from withholding tax."
msgstr ""
"**Columna 2**: Especifica los ingresos brutos anuales normales máximos "
"permitidos, según el número de hijos dependientes indicado en la Columna 1, "
"que no deben superarse para poder optar a una exención total o parcial de la "
"retención fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1230
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1550
msgid "After determining the annual gross income, two scenarios may arise:"
msgstr ""
"Tras determinar los ingresos brutos anuales, pueden darse dos escenarios:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1232
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1552
msgid "If the annual income exceeds the threshold, no exemption is granted."
msgstr ""
"Si los ingresos anuales superan el umbral, no se concede ninguna exención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1233
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1553
msgid ""
"If the annual income does not exceed the threshold, an exemption will be "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"Si los ingresos anuales no superan el umbral, se aplicará una exención."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1235
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1555
msgid ""
"The amount of this exemption corresponds to the difference between the "
"annual gross income and the threshold amount."
msgstr ""
"El importe de esta exención corresponde a la diferencia entre los ingresos "
"brutos anuales y el importe del umbral."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1238
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1558
msgid ""
"Of course, if this difference exceeds the base withholding tax amount, no "
"withholding tax will be due."
msgstr ""
"Por supuesto, si esta diferencia supera el importe base de la retención "
"fiscal, no se deberá ninguna retención fiscal."

