"N)** are eligible for up to **250€** in eco vouchers, which are granted at "
"the beginning of **July**."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados que hayan trabajado durante el **período de referencia (01/06/"
"N-1 - 31/05/N)** son elegibles para hasta **250€** en vales ecológicos, que "
"se otorgan a principios de **julio**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1378
msgid ""
"For 2025, employees must have worked between **01/06/2024 and 31/05/2025** "
"to qualify."
msgstr ""
"Para 2025, los empleados deben haber trabajado entre el **01/06/2024 y el "
"31/05/2025** para calificar."

