#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:52
msgid "How does the API work?"
msgstr "¿Cómo funciona la API?"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:54
msgid ""
"The API syncs the journal entries from Employment Hero to Odoo and leaves "
"them in draft mode. The reference includes the Employment Hero payslip entry "
"ID in brackets for the user to easily retrieve the same record in Employment "
"Hero and Odoo."
msgstr ""
"La API sincroniza los asientos de diario de Employment Hero con Odoo y los "
"deja en modo borrador. La referencia incluye el ID de entrada de la nómina "
"de Employment Hero entre paréntesis para que el usuario pueda recuperar "
"fácilmente el mismo registro en Employment Hero y Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:58
msgid ""
"Example of a Employment Hero Journal Entry in Odoo Accounting (Australia)"
msgstr ""
"Ejemplo de un asiento contable de Employment Hero en la aplicación "
"Contabilidad de Odoo (Australia)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:61
msgid ""
"By default, the synchronisation happens once per week. The records can be "
"fetched manually by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --"
"> Settings` and, in the :guilabel:`Enable Employment Hero Integration` "
"option, click on :guilabel:`Fetch Payruns Manually`."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, la sincronización ocurre una vez por semana. Los registros "
"pueden obtenerse manualmente yendo a :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes` y, en la opción :guilabel:`Habilitar integración "
"con Employment Hero`, haz clic en :guilabel:`Obtener nóminas manualmente`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:65
msgid ""
"Employment Hero payslip entries also work based on double-entry bookkeeping."
msgstr ""
"Los asientos de nóminas de Employment Hero también se basan en la "
"contabilidad por partida doble."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:67
msgid ""
"The accounts used by Employment Hero are defined in the "
"section :guilabel:`Payroll settings`."
msgstr ""
"Las cuentas utilizadas por Employment Hero se definen en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Ajustes de la nómina`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:69
msgid "Chart of Accounts menu in Employment Hero"
msgstr "Menú del plan de cuentas en Employment Hero"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/employment_hero.rst:72
msgid ""
"For the API to work, create the same accounts as the default accounts of the "
"Employment Hero business (**same name and same code**) in Odoo. The correct "
"account types must be chosen in Odoo to generate accurate financial reports."
msgstr ""
"Para que la API funcione, crea las mismas cuentas que las cuentas "
"predeterminadas del negocio de Employment Hero (**mismo nombre y mismo "
"código**) en Odoo. Deben elegirse los tipos de cuenta correctos en Odoo para "
"generar informes financieros precisos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:10
msgid ""
"The Hong Kong payroll localization ensures all salary computations strictly "
"comply with the `Employment Ordinance (Cap. 57) <https://www.labour.gov.hk/"
"eng/legislat/content2.htm>`_ and `Inland Revenue Department (IRD) <https://"
"www.ird.gov.hk/eng/ese/erc.htm>`_ requirements. This includes automated "
"calculations for |MPF| contributions, the generation of IR56 reports, and "
"the processing of leave payments such as Payment in Lieu of Notice, "
"Severance Payments (SP), and Long Service Payments (LSP)—fully updated for "
"the 2025 |MPF| offsetting transition rules."
msgstr ""
"La localización de nómina de Hong Kong garantiza que todos los cálculos "
"salariales cumplan estrictamente con los requisitos de la `Ordenanza de "
"Empleo (Cap. 57) <https://www.labour.gov.hk/eng/legislat/content2.htm>`_ y "
"del `Departamento de Rentas Internas (IRD) <https://www.ird.gov.hk/eng/ese/"
"erc.htm>`_. Esto incluye cálculos automatizados para las contribuciones |"
"MPF|, la generación de informes IR56 y el procesamiento de pagos por "
"licencias como el Pago en Lugar de Preaviso, Pagos por Despido (SP) y Pagos "
"por Servicio Prolongado (LSP), completamente actualizados para las reglas de "
"transición de compensación |MPF| 2025."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:18
msgid ""
"Before configuring the Hong Kong localization, refer to the "
"general :doc:`payroll <../../payroll>` documentation. It covers foundational "
"information applicable to all localizations, including universal settings, "
"salary structures, and global payroll fields."
msgstr ""
"Antes de configurar la localización de Hong Kong, consulta la documentación "
"general de :doc:`nómina <../../payroll>`. Cubre información fundamental "
"aplicable a todas las localizaciones, incluidas las configuraciones "
"universales, estructuras salariales y campos de nómina globales."

