#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:62
msgid ""
"Odoo supports multicompany management. First, the company must be "
"configured. Navigate to :menuselection:`Settings app --> Users & Companies --"
"> Companies`. Create a new company or select an existing one, and configure "
"the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo admite la gestión multiempresa. Primero, debes configurar la empresa. "
