"siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, `HKD` is selected. If not, select `HKD` "
"from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moneda`: Por defecto, se selecciona `HKD`. Si no, selecciona "
"`HKD` del menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:74
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company Name` entered here automatically populates as the "
"Employer's Name on reports for |IRD| reporting. Only `HKD` is supported for "
"compliant Hong Kong localization payroll calculations."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`Nombre de la Empresa` introducido aquí se rellena "
"automáticamente como el Nombre del Empleador en los informes para informes |"
"IRD|. Solo se admite `HKD` para cálculos de nómina de localización de Hong "
"Kong conformes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:83
