"Several sections in the configuration menu (Settings, Salary Structures & "
"Rules, Work Entry Types, Working Schedule, |MPF| Scheme) define specific "
"localization rules for Hong Kong."
msgstr ""
"Varias secciones en el menú de configuración (Ajustes, Estructuras y Reglas "
"Salariales, Tipos de Entrada de Trabajo, Horario de Trabajo, Esquema |MPF|) "
"definen reglas de localización específicas para Hong Kong."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:90
msgid "Hong Kong localization"
msgstr "Localización de Hong Kong"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:92
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Settings` to "
"configure the company's information in the Hong Kong Localization section:"
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Ajustes` para "
"configurar la información de la empresa en la sección Localización de Hong "
"Kong:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employer's Name shown on reports`: Auto-populated from company "
"settings. Employers can edit this specifically for IRD reports if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre del empleador mostrado en los informes`: se rellena "
"automáticamente a partir de los ajustes de la empresa. Los empleadores "
"pueden editarlo específicamente para los informes del IRD si es necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employer's File Number`: Enter the EFN for IRD reports. Format: "
"first three characters and eight numbers (e.g., `EFN-12345678`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de expediente del empleador`: introduce el EFN para los "
"informes del IRD. Formato: los primeros tres caracteres y ocho números (por "
"ejemplo, `EFN-12345678`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Configure your MPF Schemes`: Click this to configure the MPF "
"scheme (Manulife, AIA, etc.) for employee benefits."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Configura tus planes MPF`: haz clic aquí para configurar el plan "
"MPF (Manulife, AIA, etc.) para las prestaciones de los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salaries Bank Account`: Select the bank account to be used in the "
"HSBCnet report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria de salarios`: selecciona la cuenta bancaria que "
"se utilizará en el informe de HSBCnet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:105
msgid "Advantages"
msgstr "Ventajas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`HK: Internet Subscription`: Add a default monthly internet "
"allowance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`HK: suscripción a internet`: Añade una asignación mensual de "
"internet por defecto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End of Year Payments Month`: Select the month to automatically "
"add end-of-year payments to payslips (if any)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mes de pagos de fin de año`: Selecciona el mes para añadir "
"automáticamente los pagos de fin de año a las nóminas (si los hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use MPF Offsetting`: Enable this to define pre-set and post-set "
"offset periods for calculating Severance Payments (SP) and Long Service "
"Payments (LSP)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Usar compensación MPF`: Activa esto para definir períodos de "
"compensación previos y posteriores para calcular indemnizaciones por despido "
"(SP) y pagos por servicio prolongado (LSP)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:113
msgid "The Hong Kong Localization section in Payroll Settings."
msgstr "La sección de localización de Hong Kong en los ajustes de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:117
msgid ""
"The Advantages section is optional. Configuring benefits here applies the "
"same value to all employees, reducing manual configuration."
msgstr ""
"La sección de ventajas es opcional. Configurar beneficios aquí aplica el "
"mismo valor a todos los empleados, reduciendo la configuración manual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:121
msgid "Accounting section"
msgstr "Sección de contabilidad"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:123
msgid "Configure the entries for the :guilabel:`Accounting` section:"
msgstr "Configura las entradas de la sección :guilabel:`Contabilidad`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:125
msgid ":guilabel:`Payroll HSBC Autopay`: Enable to create HSBC payment files."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Autopago HSBC de nómina`: Activa para crear archivos de pago HSBC."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Batch Account Move Lines`: Enable to merge all accounting entries "
"for the same period into a single account move line. This anonymizes "
"accounting entries but disables single payment generations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agrupar líneas de asiento contable`: Activa para fusionar todos "
"los asientos contables del mismo período en una única línea de asiento "
"contable. Esto anonimiza los asientos contables pero deshabilita la "
"generación de pagos individuales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:130
msgid "The Accounting section in Payroll Settings."
msgstr "La sección de Contabilidad en la configuración de Nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:136
msgid "Structures & rules"
msgstr "Estructuras y reglas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:138
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structures --> "
"Rules` to check salary rules or configure specific company salary rules."
msgstr ""
"Navega a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Estructuras "
"--> Reglas` para revisar las reglas salariales o configurar reglas "
"salariales específicas de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:142
msgid "CAP57: Employees Monthly Pay"
msgstr "CAP57: Pago mensual de empleados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:144
msgid ""
"Odoo provides the :guilabel:`CAP57: Employees Monthly Pay` salary structure "
"to calculate compliant payroll for regular employees. The following salary "
"rules are mandatory, which are added automatically to payslips:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo proporciona la estructura salarial :guilabel:`CAP57: Pago mensual de "
"empleados` para calcular la nómina conforme para empleados regulares. Las "
"siguientes reglas salariales son obligatorias y se añaden automáticamente a "
"las nóminas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:148
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Housing Reimbursement`: Amount derived from the employee's active "
"rental record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reembolso de vivienda`: importe obtenido a partir del registro de "
"alquiler activo del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Basic Salary`: Amount of base salary provided (after rent "
"allowance deduction)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario base`: Importe del salario base proporcionado (después de "
"la deducción de la asignación de alquiler)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:150
msgid ""
":guilabel:`713 Gross`: Net payable amount considering commissions, internet "
"allowance, reimbursements, back-pay, deductions, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`713 bruto`: Importe neto a pagar considerando comisiones, "
"asignación de internet, reembolsos, pagos atrasados, deducciones, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:152
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MPF Gross`: Net payable amount from 713 gross after consideration "
"of additional allowances, deductions, and end-of-year payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MPF bruto`: Importe neto a pagar desde el 713 bruto después de "
"considerar asignaciones adicionales, deducciones y pago de fin de año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Mandatory Contribution`: Mandatory employee |MPF| "
"contribution."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución obligatoria del empleado`: contribuciones al MPF "
"hechas por el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:155
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employer Mandatory Contribution`: Mandatory employer |MPF| "
"contribution."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución obligatoria del empleador`: contribuciones al MPF "
"hechas por el empleador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Voluntary Contribution`: Voluntary employee contribution "
"(if any)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución voluntaria del empleado`: Contribución voluntaria "
"del empleado (si la hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:157
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employer Voluntary Contribution`: Voluntary employer contribution "
"(if any)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución voluntaria del empleador`: Contribución voluntaria "
"del empleador (si la hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employer Voluntary Contribution 2`: Additional voluntary employer "
"contribution (if any)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución voluntaria del empleador 2`: Contribución voluntaria "
"adicional del empleador (si la hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gross`: Net payable amount from |MPF| gross after consideration "
"of |MPF| deductions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bruto`: el importe neto a pagar por MPF bruto luego de tomar en "
"cuenta las deducciones del MPF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:161
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Net Salary`: Final payable amount to be paid to the employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Salario neto`: Importe final a pagar al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:163
msgid ""
"The following salary rules are optional rules for employee benefits, which "
"can be manually added as salary inputs in the payslip under "
"the :guilabel:`Salary Inputs` tab:"
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes reglas salariales son reglas opcionales para beneficios del "
"empleado, que pueden añadirse manualmente como entradas salariales en la "
"nómina bajo la pestaña :guilabel:`Entradas salariales`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Back Pay`: Additional salary payout can be included under this "
"category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago atrasado`: El pago de salario adicional puede incluirse bajo "
"esta categoría."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:167
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Commission`: The commission earned during the period can be "
"manually entered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Comisión`: La comisión ganada durante el período puede "
"introducirse manualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:168
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Global Deduction`: A lump-sum deduction from the entire payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Deducción global`: Una deducción de suma global de toda la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Global Reimbursement`: A lump-sum reimbursement to the entire "
"payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reembolso global`: Un reembolso de suma global a toda la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:170
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Referral Fee`: The additional bonus offered for any form of "
"business-related referral."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Comisión por referencia`: La bonificación adicional ofrecida por "
"cualquier forma de referencia relacionada con el negocio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:171
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Moving Daily Wage`: To override the ADW value used for leave "
"computation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario diario móvil`: Para anular el valor ADW utilizado para el "
"cálculo de ausencias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:172
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual Housing Reimbursement`: To override the housing "
"reimbursement amount automatically derived from the employee's active rental "
"record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reembolso manual de vivienda`: para anular el importe del "
"reembolso de vivienda obtenido automáticamente a partir del registro de "
"alquiler activo del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:174
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Skip Rent Allowance`: If set, the rental allowance is excluded "
"from the current payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Omitir subsidio de alquiler`: Si se activa, el subsidio de "
"alquiler se excluye de la nómina actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:176
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Custom Average Monthly Salary`: To override the average monthly "
"salary used for end-of-year payment (rule is only applicable to payslips "
"generated in December)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario mensual promedio personalizado`: Para anular el salario "
"mensual promedio utilizado para el pago de fin de año (la regla solo es "
"aplicable a las nóminas generadas en diciembre)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:180
msgid "CAP57: Payment in Lieu of Notice"
msgstr "CAP57: Pago en lugar de preaviso"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:182
msgid ""
"Odoo provides the :guilabel:`CAP57: Payment in Lieu of Notice` salary "
"structure to process a final payment to an employee in place of serving a "
"required notice period upon termination."
msgstr ""
"Odoo proporciona la estructura salarial :guilabel:`CAP57: Pago en lugar de "
"preaviso` para procesar un pago final a un empleado en lugar de cumplir un "
"período de preaviso requerido al finalizar la relación laboral."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:185
msgid ""
"Mandatory rule for this salary structure which is automatically added to the "
"payslip:"
msgstr ""
"Regla obligatoria para esta estructura salarial que se añade automáticamente "
"a la nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:187
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment in Lieu of Notice`: This is the calculated amount paid to "
"the employee corresponding to the unserved notice period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago en lugar de preaviso`: Este es el importe calculado pagado "
"al empleado correspondiente al período de preaviso no cumplido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:190
msgid ""
"Optional rule for this salary structure which can be manually added as a "
"salary input in the payslip under the :guilabel:`Salary Inputs` tab:"
msgstr ""
"Regla opcional para esta estructura salarial que puede añadirse manualmente "
"como entrada salarial en la nómina en la pestaña :guilabel:`Entradas "
"salariales`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lieu of Notice Period (Months)`: Only applicable to the `CAP57: "
"Payment in Lieu of Notice` salary structure. By default, the final payout is "
"set to 1-month. Use the :guilabel:`Count` field under the salary inputs tab "
"to set a different notice period duration."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Período de preaviso en lugar de (meses)`: Solo aplicable a la "
"estructura salarial `CAP57: Pago en lugar de preaviso`. Por defecto, el pago "
"final se establece en 1 mes. Usa el campo :guilabel:`Cantidad` en la pestaña "
"de entradas salariales para establecer una duración diferente del período de "
"preaviso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:198
msgid "CAP57: Long Service Payment (LSP)"
msgstr "CAP57: Pago por servicios prolongados (LSP)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:200
msgid ""
"Odoo provides the :guilabel:`CAP57: Long Service Payment` salary structure "
"to process an employee whose continuous employment with the employer, under "
"a contract of employment, reaches 5 years."
msgstr ""
"Odoo proporciona la estructura salarial :guilabel:`CAP57: Pago por servicios "
"prolongados` para procesar a un empleado cuyo empleo continuo con el "
"empleador, bajo un contrato de trabajo, alcanza los 5 años."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:203
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:230
msgid ""
"Mandatory rules for this salary structure which are automatically added to "
"the payslip:"
msgstr ""
"Reglas obligatorias para esta estructura salarial que se añaden "
"automáticamente a la nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Long Service Payment`: The final calculated amount of long "
"service payment paid to the employee (after applying offsets, if any)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago por servicios prolongados`: El importe final calculado del "
"pago por servicios prolongados pagado al empleado (después de aplicar "
"compensaciones, si las hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Long Service Payment Pre Transition`: The portion of the long "
"service payment calculated based on the employment period before the "
"transition date of the offsetting arrangement, where |MPF| contributions can "
"still be used to offset the payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago por Servicio Prolongado Pre-Transición`: La parte del pago "
"por servicio prolongado calculada según el período de empleo anterior a la "
"fecha de transición del acuerdo de compensación, donde las contribuciones |"
"MPF| aún pueden utilizarse para compensar el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Long Service Payment Post Transition`: The portion of the long "
"service payment calculated based on the employment period on or after the "
"transition date of the offsetting arrangement."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago por servicios prolongados posterior a la transición`: La "
"parte del pago por servicios prolongados calculada en función del período de "
"empleo en o después de la fecha de transición del acuerdo de compensación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:214
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:240
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Use MPF Offsetting` in the Hong Kong localization section "
"to use these offset salary rules:"
msgstr ""
"Activa :guilabel:`Usar compensación de MPF` en la sección de localización de "
"Hong Kong para usar estas reglas salariales de compensación:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:217
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:243
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pre-transition Offset`: The amount of |MPF| contribution (or "
"benefits from an :abbr:`ORSO (Occupational Retirement Schemes Ordinance)` "
"scheme) that can be used to offset the pre-transition amount."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Compensación Pre-transición`: El importe de la contribución |MPF| "
"(o beneficios de un esquema :abbr:`ORSO (Ordenanza de Esquemas de Jubilación "
"Ocupacional)`) que puede utilizarse para compensar el importe pre-transición."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:220
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:246
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Post-transition Offset`: The amount of |MPF| contribution (or "
"benefits from an :abbr:`ORSO (Occupational Retirement Schemes Ordinance)` "
"scheme) that can be used to offset the post-transition amount."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Compensación Post-transición`: El importe de la contribución |"
"MPF| (o beneficios de un esquema :abbr:`ORSO (Ordenanza de Esquemas de "
"Jubilación Ocupacional)`) que puede utilizarse para compensar el importe "
"post-transición."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:225
msgid "CAP57: Severance Payment (SP)"
msgstr "CAP57: Indemnización por cese (SP)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:227
msgid ""
"Odoo provides the :guilabel:`CAP57: Severance Payment` salary structure to "
"process an employee whose continuous employment with the employer, under a "
"contract of employment, reaches 2 years."
msgstr ""
"Odoo proporciona la estructura salarial :guilabel:`CAP57: Indemnización por "
"cese` para procesar a un empleado cuyo empleo continuo con el empleador, "
"bajo un contrato laboral, alcanza 2 años."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:232
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Severance Payment`: The final calculated amount of severance "
"payment paid to the employee (after applying offsets, if any)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Indemnización por cese`: El importe final calculado de la "
"indemnización por cese pagada al empleado (después de aplicar "
"compensaciones, si las hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:234
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Severance Payment Pre Transition`: The portion of the severance "
"payment calculated based on the employment period before the transition date "
"of the offsetting arrangement, where |MPF| contributions can still be used "
"to offset the payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago por Despido Pre-Transición`: La parte del pago por despido "
"calculada según el período de empleo anterior a la fecha de transición del "
"acuerdo de compensación, donde las contribuciones |MPF| aún pueden "
"utilizarse para compensar el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Severance Payment Post Transition`: The portion of the severance "
"payment calculated based on the employment period on or after the transition "
"date of the offsetting arrangement."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Indemnización por cese post-transición`: La porción de la "
"indemnización por cese calculada en base al período de empleo en o después "
"de la fecha de transición del acuerdo de compensación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:251
msgid "CAP57: Casual Employees Pay"
msgstr "CAP57: Pago a empleados ocasionales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:253
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`CAP57: Casual Employees Pay` salary structure is designed for "
"compliant payroll processing of casual workers. It shares the same salary "
"rules as the :guilabel:`CAP57: Employees Monthly Pay` structure, with the "
"primary difference being the application of `Industry Schemes <https://"
"www.mpfa.org.hk/en/info-centre/faq/employee/industry-sche mes-"
"employee#IndustrySchemesEmployee-2>`_ for MPF calculations."
msgstr ""
"La estructura salarial :guilabel:`CAP57: Pago a empleados ocasionales` está "
"diseñada para procesar de forma conforme las nóminas de los trabajadores "
"ocasionales. Comparte las mismas reglas salariales que la estructura "
":guilabel:`CAP57: Pago mensual a empleados`, con la principal diferencia de "
"que aplica los `planes sectoriales <https://www.mpfa.org.hk/en/info-centre/"
"faq/employee/industry-sche mes-employee#IndustrySchemesEmployee-2>`_ para "
"los cálculos del MPF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:259
msgid ""
"This structure supports compliance for workers enrolled in Industry Schemes, "
"which are tailored for the construction and catering sectors—industries "
"characterized by high labor mobility and frequent daily hiring."
msgstr ""
"Esta estructura garantiza el cumplimiento normativo de los trabajadores "
"inscritos en planes sectoriales, diseñados específicamente para los sectores "
"de la construcción y la restauración, industrias caracterizadas por una alta "
"movilidad laboral y contrataciones diarias frecuentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:268
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Work Entries --"
"> Work Entry Types` to check work entry types or configure a new work entry "
"type."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Entradas de "
"trabajo --> Tipos de entrada de trabajo` para verificar los tipos de entrada "
"de trabajo o configurar un nuevo tipo de entrada de trabajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:271
msgid "In defining each work entry type for Hong Kong, employers can define:"
msgstr ""
"Al definir cada tipo de entrada de trabajo para Hong Kong, los empleadores "
"pueden definir:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:273
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rate`: The rate that is used to calculate for each leave (e.g., "
"80% for sick leave)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tasa`: La tasa que se usa para calcular cada ausencia (por "
"ejemplo, 80% para baja por enfermedad)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:274
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ADW Calculation`: Enable this to calculate the employee's pay "
"according to the Average Daily Wage (ADW) rules under Hong Kong employment "
"regulations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cálculo ADW`: Activa esto para calcular el pago del empleado "
"según las reglas del salario diario promedio (ADW) bajo las regulaciones "
"laborales de Hong Kong."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:277
msgid "Configuration screen for an 80 percent Sick Leave Work Entry Type."
msgstr ""
"Pantalla de configuración para un tipo de entrada de trabajo de baja por "
"enfermedad al 80 por ciento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:280
msgid ""
"Odoo supports 11 HK-specific work entry types which are used together with "
"the **Time Off** app:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo admite 11 tipos de entrada de trabajo específicos de HK que se utilizan "
"junto con la aplicación **Ausencias**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:282
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sick Leave 80%`: Paid sick leave compensated at 80% of the "
"employee's average daily wage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Baja por enfermedad 80%`: Baja por enfermedad remunerada "
"compensada al 80% del salario diario promedio del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:284
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Compassionate Leave`: Leave granted for personal emergencies, "
"such as the death of a family member."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Permiso por compasión`: Permiso concedido por emergencias "
"personales, como el fallecimiento de un familiar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:286
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Marriage Leave`: Time off granted to an employee for their "
"wedding."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Permiso por matrimonio`: Tiempo libre concedido a un empleado "
"para su boda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Examination Leave`: Leave granted to an employee to take "
"professional examinations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Permiso por examen`: Permiso concedido a un empleado para "
"realizar exámenes profesionales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:288
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maternity Leave`: Statutory leave granted to female employees for "
"childbirth."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Permiso por maternidad`: Permiso estatutario concedido a "
"empleadas por parto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:289
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maternity Leave 80%`: Maternity leave compensated at 80% of the "
"average daily wage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Permiso por maternidad 80%`: Permiso por maternidad compensado al "
"80% del salario diario promedio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:290
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Paternity Leave`: Statutory leave granted to male employees "
"following a child's birth."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Permiso por paternidad`: Permiso estatutario concedido a "
"empleados varones tras el nacimiento de un hijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:291
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Statutory Holiday`: Mandatory public holidays recognized by Hong "
"Kong employment law."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Día festivo estatutario`: Días festivos públicos obligatorios "
"reconocidos por la ley laboral de Hong Kong."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:292
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Public Holiday`: General holidays observed by banks and "
"businesses in Hong Kong."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Día festivo`: Días festivos generales observados por bancos y "
"empresas en Hong Kong."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:293
msgid ":guilabel:`Weekend`: Standard non-working days for the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fin de semana`: Días no laborables estándar para el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:298
msgid "MPF schemes"
msgstr "Esquemas MPF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:300
msgid ""
"Odoo allows multiple |MPF| scheme configurations (currently 24 schemes), "
"creation of new schemes, different |MPF| groups and member classes, and "
"definition of income for automated |MPF| calculations. In alignment with "
"eMPF requirements, Odoo-generated eMPF contribution reports are ready to "
"upload to the `eMPF portal <https://www.empf.org.hk/?language_id=1>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo permite múltiples configuraciones de esquema |MPF| (actualmente 24 "
"esquemas), creación de nuevos esquemas, diferentes grupos |MPF| y clases de "
"miembros, y definición de ingresos para cálculos |MPF| automatizados. En "
"línea con los requisitos de eMPF, los informes de contribución eMPF "
"generados por Odoo están listos para cargar en el `portal eMPF <https://"
"www.empf.org.hk/?language_id=1>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:306
msgid "Configuring an eMPF scheme"
msgstr "Configurar un esquema eMPF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:308
msgid "Follow these steps to configure an eMPF scheme:"
msgstr "Sigue estos pasos para configurar un esquema eMPF:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:310
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` or select an eMPF scheme to configure. Enter "
"the :guilabel:`Employer Account No.` (this value is specific to the current "
"company)."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` o selecciona un esquema eMPF para configurar. "
"Introduce el :guilabel:`Número de cuenta del empleador` (este valor es "
"específico de la empresa actual)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:312
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` to create new payroll groups (used for "
"mandatory contributions) and member classes (used for voluntary "
"contributions)."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Añadir una línea` para crear nuevos grupos de nómina "
"(utilizados para contribuciones obligatorias) y clases de miembros "
"(utilizados para contribuciones voluntarias)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:316
msgid ""
"Employers can define one default payroll group or member class which is "
"shown as the default selection upon |MPF| selection whenever creating new "
"employees in :menuselection:`Employees --> Payroll --> MPF`."
msgstr ""
"Los empleadores pueden definir un grupo de nómina o clase de miembro "
"predeterminado que se muestra como la selección predeterminada al "
"seleccionar |MPF| al crear nuevos empleados en :menuselection:`Empleados --> "
"Nómina --> MPF`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:320
msgid ""
"In creating a member class, click :guilabel:`View` to configure each "
"contribution type, option, amount of income, and definition of income."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una clase de miembro, haz clic en :guilabel:`Ver` para configurar "
"cada tipo de contribución, opción, cantidad de ingresos y definición de "
"ingresos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:323
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contribution Type`: Select :guilabel:`Employee's Voluntary "
"Contribution`, :guilabel:`Employer's Voluntary Contribution`, "
"or :guilabel:`Employer's Voluntary Contribution 2`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de contribución`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Contribución "
"voluntaria del empleado`, :guilabel:`Contribución voluntaria del empleador`, "
"o :guilabel:`Contribución voluntaria del empleador 2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:325
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Option`: Defines how much voluntary contribution is calculated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Opción`: Define cómo se calcula la contribución voluntaria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:327
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Percentage of Income`: Contribution according to a "
"percentage."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Porcentaje fijo de ingresos`: Contribución según un porcentaje."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:328
msgid ":guilabel:`Fixed Amount`: Contribution according to a fixed amount."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cantidad fija`: Contribución según una cantidad fija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:329
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Match Employee's Voluntary Contribution`: Contribution matches "
"the employee's voluntary contribution."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Igualar la contribución voluntaria del empleado`: Contribución "
"que iguala la contribución voluntaria del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:331
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Percentage of Income minus Mandatory Contribution`: "
"Contribution capped with mandatory contribution."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Porcentaje fijo de ingresos menos contribución obligatoria`: "
"Contribución limitada con contribución obligatoria."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:334
msgid ":guilabel:`Amount`: Amount to apply as a percentage or fixed amount."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cantidad`: Cantidad a aplicar como porcentaje o cantidad fija."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:335
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Definition of Income`: Define which income is used to calculate "
"voluntary contributions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Definición de ingresos`: Define qué ingresos se utilizan para "
"calcular las contribuciones voluntarias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:338
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Relevant Wages`: Based on all wages (commissions, bonuses, etc.) "
"the employee receives after calculation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salarios relevantes`: Basado en todos los salarios (comisiones, "
"bonificaciones, etc.) que el empleado recibe después del cálculo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:340
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Basic Wage`: Based on the basic wage (wage on contract) the "
"employee receives."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario básico`: Basado en el salario básico (salario en "
"contrato) que el empleado recibe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:342
msgid ""
"Configuration screen for |MPF| member classes and voluntary contributions."
msgstr ""
"Pantalla de configuración para clases de miembros |MPF| y contribuciones "
"voluntarias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:348
msgid "Employee configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de empleado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:350
msgid ""
"To create an employee record, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Employees --> Employees`. Click :guilabel:`New` in the upper-left corner. "
"Fill in the primary contact details, then configure the following tabs:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un registro de empleado, ve a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --"
"> Empleados --> Empleados`. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` en la esquina "
"superior izquierda. Completa los datos de contacto principales y luego "
"configura las siguientes pestañas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:357
msgid "Under the :guilabel:`Work` tab, configure organizational information."
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña :guilabel:`Trabajo`, configura la información organizacional."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:359
msgid ":guilabel:`Work`: Set department, job title, and manager."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Trabajo`: Establece departamento, puesto de trabajo y responsable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:360
msgid ":guilabel:`Departure`: Only visible after archiving an employee record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salida`: Solo visible después de archivar un registro de empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:362
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Departure reason`: Used in eMPF reports for termination payment "
"checks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Motivo de salida`: Utilizado en informes eMPF para verificaciones "
"de pagos por terminación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:363
msgid ":guilabel:`Departure date`: Used in IR56 forms."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fecha de salida`: Utilizado en formularios IR56."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:368
msgid "Under the :guilabel:`Personal` tab, configure personal information."
msgstr "En la pestaña :guilabel:`Personal`, configura la información personal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:370
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Private Contact`: Set surname, given name, name in Chinese (if "
"any), private email, phone number, and bank accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contacto privado`: Establece apellido, nombre, nombre en chino "
"(si corresponde), correo electrónico privado, número de teléfono y cuentas "
"bancarias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:372
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Personal information`: Set employee legal name, birth date, and "
"gender."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Información personal`: Establece el nombre legal del empleado, "
"fecha de nacimiento y género."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:373
msgid ":guilabel:`Identification No`: Set the HKID of the employee."
msgstr ":guilabel:`N.º de identificación`: Establece el HKID del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:374
msgid ":guilabel:`Location`: Set :guilabel:`Private Address`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ubicación`: Establece :guilabel:`Dirección privada`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:377
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Bank Account` needs to be marked as *trusted*. Having an "
"untrusted bank account for an employee causes an error in the pay run. To "
"achieve this, click on the right-arrow button next to the bank account "
"number field. Set the :guilabel:`Send Money to` field to :guilabel:`Trusted` "
"by clicking on the toggle."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`cuenta bancaria` debe estar marcada como *confiable*. Tener "
"una cuenta bancaria no confiable para un empleado causa un error en la "
"ejecución de nómina. Para lograrlo, haz clic en el botón de flecha derecha "
"junto al campo de número de cuenta bancaria. Establece el "
"campo :guilabel:`Enviar dinero a` como :guilabel:`Confiable` haciendo clic "
"en el interruptor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:382
msgid "Employee bank account configuration set to Trusted."
msgstr ""
"Configuración de cuenta bancaria del empleado establecida como Confiable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:386
msgid "Mandatory personal information for government reports:"
msgstr "Información personal obligatoria para informes gubernamentales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:388
msgid ""
"|MPF|: :guilabel:`Surname`, :guilabel:`Given Name`, :guilabel:`Name in "
"Chinese`, :guilabel:`Phone`, :guilabel:`Birthday`, :guilabel:`Private "
"Address`, :guilabel:`Identification No` / :guilabel:`Passport No`."
msgstr ""
"|MPF|: :guilabel:`Apellido`, :guilabel:`Nombre de Pila`, :guilabel:`Nombre "
"en Chino`, :guilabel:`Teléfono`, :guilabel:`Fecha de "
"Nacimiento`, :guilabel:`Dirección Particular`, :guilabel:`Número de "
"Identificación` / :guilabel:`Número de Pasaporte`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:392
msgid ""
"|IRD| Reports: :guilabel:`Surname`, :guilabel:`Given "
"Name`, :guilabel:`Phone`, :guilabel:`Birthday`, :guilabel:`Gender`, :guilabel:`Identification "
"No` / :guilabel:`Passport No`."
msgstr ""
"Informes |IRD|: :guilabel:`Apellido`, :guilabel:`Nombre de "
"Pila`, :guilabel:`Teléfono`, :guilabel:`Fecha de "
"Nacimiento`, :guilabel:`Género`, :guilabel:`Número de "
"Identificación` / :guilabel:`Número de Pasaporte`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:402
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract`: Select contract start and end dates for contract "
"management."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contrato`: Selecciona las fechas de inicio y fin del contrato "
"para la gestión de contratos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:403
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage Type`: Select :guilabel:`Fixed Wage` or :guilabel:`Hourly "
"Wage`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de salario`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Salario fijo` "
"o :guilabel:`Salario por hora`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:404
msgid ":guilabel:`Wage`: Define the employee's monthly wage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Salario`: Define el salario mensual del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:405
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select :guilabel:`CAP57: Hong Kong Employee` for "
"monthly Hong Kong payroll calculations. This defines when the employee is "
"paid, their default working schedule, and the work entry type it applies to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de pago`: Selecciona :guilabel:`CAP57: empleado de Hong "
"Kong` para cálculos de nómina mensuales de Hong Kong. Esto define cuándo se "
"le paga al empleado, su horario de trabajo predeterminado y el tipo de "
"entrada de trabajo al que se aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:410
msgid ""
"When the hourly wage option is selected, the :guilabel:`Hourly Wage` field "
"is displayed to input the employee's hourly rate. You shouldn't put any "
"value in the :guilabel:`Wage` field for hourly paid employees, as that field "
"is based on monthly pay."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se selecciona la opción de salario por hora, se muestra el "
"campo :guilabel:`Salario por hora` para introducir la tarifa horaria del "
"empleado. No debes poner ningún valor en el campo :guilabel:`Salario` para "
"empleados pagados por hora, ya que ese campo se basa en el pago mensual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:414
msgid "The Contract Overview section under the Payroll tab."
msgstr "La sección Resumen del contrato en la pestaña Nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:420
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Entry Source`: Select either :guilabel:`Working "
"Schedule`, :guilabel:`Attendances`, or :guilabel:`Planning`. This field "
"determines how the work entries are accounted for in the payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Origen de entrada de trabajo`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Horario de "
"trabajo`, :guilabel:`Asistencias` o :guilabel:`Planificación`. Este campo "
"determina cómo se contabilizan las entradas de trabajo en la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:424
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Schedule`: Work entries are generated automatically based "
"on the employee's working schedule."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Horario de trabajo`: Las entradas de trabajo se generan "
"automáticamente según el horario de trabajo del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:426
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attendances`: Work entries are generated based on the check-in "
"and check-out period logged in the **Attendances** app."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Asistencias`: Las entradas de trabajo se generan según el período "
"de entrada y salida registrado en la aplicación **Asistencias**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:428
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Planning`: Work entries are generated from planning shifts only."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Planificación`: Las entradas de trabajo se generan únicamente a "
"partir de los turnos de planificación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:430
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: Select :guilabel:`HK Standard 40 hours/week` or "
"any newly created working schedule."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Horas de trabajo`: Selecciona :guilabel:`HK Estándar 40 horas/"
"semana` o cualquier horario de trabajo creado recientemente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:434
msgid "MPF section"
msgstr "Sección MPF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:436
msgid ":guilabel:`Exempt of MPF`: Enable this option for MPF-exempt employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Exento de MPF`: Activa esta opción para empleados exentos de MPF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:437
msgid ":guilabel:`MPF Scheme`: Select the |MPF| scheme."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Esquema MPF`: Selecciona el esquema |MPF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:438
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Member Account No.`: Enter the employee's member account number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Núm. de cuenta de miembro`: Introduce el número de cuenta de "
"miembro del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:439
msgid ":guilabel:`Payroll Group`: Select the |MPF| payroll group."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Grupo de Nómina`: Selecciona el grupo de nómina |MPF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:440
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Member Class`: Select the |MPF| member class for voluntary "
"contributions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Clase de Miembro`: Selecciona la clase de miembro |MPF| para "
"contribuciones voluntarias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:441
msgid ":guilabel:`Registration Status`: Define employee status."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Estado de registro`: Define el estado del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:443
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Registration At Next Contribution`: Select for enrolling a new |"
"MPF| member."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Registro en la Próxima Contribución`: Selecciona para inscribir "
"un nuevo miembro |MPF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:444
msgid ":guilabel:`Registered`: Select for an existing |MPF| member."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Registrado`: Selecciona para un miembro |MPF| existente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:445
msgid ":guilabel:`Terminated`: Select for a terminated |MPF| member."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Terminado`: Selecciona para un miembro |MPF| terminado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:447
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start Contribution`: Define the contribution starting period for "
"new or existing members."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Inicio de contribución`: Define el período de inicio de "
"contribución para miembros nuevos o existentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:450
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Immediately Upon Registration`: Start contribution after "
"registering |MPF|, starting from the first payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Inmediatamente al registrarse`: Inicia la contribución después de "
"registrar |MPF|, a partir de la primera nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:452
msgid ""
":guilabel:`At Due Date`: Start contribution after the contribution holiday "
"period. This starts its contribution mostly in the second or third payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`En la fecha de vencimiento`: Inicia la contribución después del "
"período de vacaciones de contribución. Esto comienza su contribución "
"principalmente en la segunda o tercera nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:455
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date of Joining the Scheme`: Leave empty to set the date "
"automatically upon registration through the eMPF contribution report date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha de incorporación al régimen`: Deja vacío para establecer la "
"fecha automáticamente al registrarse a través de la fecha del informe de "
"contribución eMPF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:458
msgid "The MPF configuration section on the employee form."
msgstr "La sección de configuración MPF en el formulario del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:462
msgid "Benefits section"
msgstr "Sección de beneficios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:464
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Internet Subscription`: Set an additional internet allowance on "
"top of the current salary package."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Suscripción a internet`: Establece un subsidio adicional de "
"internet además del paquete salarial actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:466
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Current Rental`: Configure rental information that is used as a "
"rental allowance in the payslip for the IR56B reporting period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Alquiler actual`: Configura la información del alquiler que se "
"usa como subsidio de alquiler en la nómina para el período de declaración "
"IR56B."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:469
msgid ""
"To create a rental record, click the :guilabel:`History` button near the "
"current rental field. Click :guilabel:`New` to create a rental history. "
"Enter the rental reference, rental start date, rental end date, rental type, "
"rental amount, and address. Change the rental status to :guilabel:`Running`."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un registro de alquiler, haz clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Historial` cerca del campo de alquiler actual. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para crear un historial de alquiler. Introduce la "
"referencia del alquiler, fecha de inicio del alquiler, fecha de finalización "
"del alquiler, tipo de alquiler, importe del alquiler y dirección. Cambia el "
"estado del alquiler a :guilabel:`En curso`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:473
msgid ""
"Odoo's Rental System is designed to align with the `Inland Revenue "
"Department (IRD) guidelines <https://www.ird.gov.hk/eng/tax/ere_house.htm>`_ "
"regarding the taxation of a place of residence provided to an employee. This "
"updated rental system automates the calculation of taxable income based on "
"whether the employer provides a reimbursement, direct payment, or allowance."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de alquileres de Odoo está diseñado para ajustarse a las "
"`directrices del Departamento de Hacienda (IRD) <https://www.ird.gov.hk/eng/"
"tax/ere_house.htm>`_ relativas a la tributación de la vivienda proporcionada "
"a un empleado. Este sistema de alquileres actualizado automatiza el cálculo "
"de la base imponible según si el empleador proporciona un reembolso, un pago "
"directo o una asignación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:479
