":guilabel:`Tipo de arrendamiento`: selecciona el tratamiento fiscal "
"correspondiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:513
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee pays, Company refunds`: Reported as a housing benefit in "
"IR56 reports."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`El empleado paga, la empresa reembolsa`: se declara como "
"beneficio de vivienda en los informes IR56."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:514
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company pays Landlord`: Non-taxable; excluded from cash totals in "
