#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:573
msgid "Run HK payroll"
msgstr "Ejecutar la nómina de HK"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:575
msgid ""
"Before running payroll, the payroll officer must validate employee work "
"entries to confirm pay accuracy and catch errors. This includes checking "
"that all time off is approved and any overtime is appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Antes de ejecutar la nómina, el responsable de nómina debe validar las "
"entradas de trabajo de los empleados para confirmar la precisión del pago y "
"detectar errores. Esto incluye verificar que todas las ausencias estén "
"aprobadas y que cualquier hora extra sea apropiada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:579
msgid ""
"Work entries sync based on the employee's contract configuration. Odoo pulls "
"from the assigned working schedule, attendance records, planning schedule, "
"and approved time off. Any discrepancies or conflicts must be resolved, then "
"the work entries can be regenerated."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas de trabajo se sincronizan según la configuración del contrato "
"del empleado. Odoo extrae del horario de trabajo asignado, registros de "
"asistencia, horario de planificación y ausencias aprobadas. Cualquier "
"discrepancia o conflicto debe resolverse y luego las entradas de trabajo "
"pueden regenerarse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:583
msgid ""
"Once everything is correct, draft payslips can be created individually or in "
"groups, referred to in the **Payroll** app as pay runs."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que todo esté correcto, se pueden crear nóminas en borrador de forma "
"individual o en grupos, denominados en la aplicación **Nómina** como "
"ejecuciones de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:587
msgid ""
"If the work entry or salary inputs for an employee are amended, click the "
"(gear) icon :menuselection:`--> Recompute Whole Sheet` to refresh the "
"payslip's worked days and salary inputs tab."
msgstr ""
"Si se modifica la entrada de trabajo o los datos salariales de un empleado, "
"haz clic en el icono de engranaje :menuselection:`--> Recalcular hoja "
"completa` para actualizar la pestaña de días trabajados y datos salariales "
"de la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:592
msgid "Individual payslip"
msgstr "Nómina individual"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:594
msgid "To create an individual payslip in the **Payroll** app:"
msgstr "Para crear una nómina individual en la aplicación **Nómina**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:596
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips --> Payslips`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New Off-Cycle` to create a payslip for a single employee. "
"Select the employee and period."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Nóminas --> Nóminas`. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nueva fuera de ciclo` para crear una nómina para un solo "
"empleado. Selecciona el empleado y el período."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:600
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically excludes out-of-contract days for pro-rata calculations "
"(i.e., you do not need to select the period according to the employee "
"joining date; Odoo automatically excludes out-of-contract days and reduces "
"the basic salary)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo excluye automáticamente los días fuera de contrato para los cálculos "
"prorrateados (es decir, no necesitas seleccionar el período según la fecha "
"de incorporación del empleado; Odoo excluye automáticamente los días fuera "
"de contrato y reduce el salario básico)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:604
msgid ""
"Once the payslips are drafted, review them for accuracy. Check "
"the :guilabel:`Worked Days` tab, :guilabel:`Salary Inputs` tab, "
"and :guilabel:`Other info` tab. Ensure the listed worked time is correct, as "
"well as any other inputs. Add any missing optional inputs, such as "
"commissions, tips, reimbursements, etc."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que las nóminas estén en borrador, revísalas para verificar su "
"precisión. Comprueba la pestaña :guilabel:`Días trabajados`, la "
"pestaña :guilabel:`Datos salariales` y la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra "
"información`. Asegúrate de que el tiempo trabajado indicado sea correcto, "
"así como cualquier otro dato. Añade cualquier dato opcional que falte, como "
"comisiones, propinas, reembolsos, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:609
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` button, then click "
"the :guilabel:`Validate` button."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Calcular hoja`, luego haz clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Validar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:612
msgid ""
"Once the payslip is validated, work entries are generated and cannot be "
"edited. Cancel the payslip and set it to draft again if there are any "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que la nómina esté validada, se generan las entradas de trabajo y no "
"se pueden editar. Cancela la nómina y ponla de nuevo en borrador si hay "
"actualizaciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:615
msgid "A completed individual payslip ready for validation."
msgstr "Una nómina individual completada lista para validación."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:619
msgid "Batch pay run (payslips in groups)"
msgstr "Ejecución de pago por lotes (nóminas en grupos)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:621
msgid ""
"To create a batch pay run in the **Payroll** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips --> Pay Runs`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new pay run. Select the salary structure, "
"pay schedule, |MPF| scheme, payroll group, and period."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un lote de nóminas en la aplicación **Nómina**, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Nóminas --> Ejecuciones de pago`. "
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para crear una nueva ejecución de pago. "
"Selecciona la estructura salarial, el calendario de pagos, el esquema |MPF|, "
"el grupo de nóminas y el período."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:626
msgid ""
"The |MPF| scheme and payroll group are optional; if there is only one scheme "
"and one group, you can leave it blank."
msgstr ""
"El esquema |MPF| y el grupo de nóminas son opcionales; si solo hay un "
"esquema y un grupo, puedes dejarlo en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:629
msgid ""
"Next, select the employees. A pay run is created along with the drafted "
"employee payslips. Check all calculations and click the :guilabel:`Validate` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, selecciona a los empleados. Se crea un procesamiento de "
"nóminas junto con los borradores de las nóminas de los empleados. Revisa "
"todos los cálculos y haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Validar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:632
msgid "Validating a batch Pay Run."
msgstr "Validación de una ejecución de pago por lotes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:636
msgid ""
"An eMPF report is automatically generated after every pay run. Click the "
"eMPF report or find it in :menuselection:`Reporting --> eMPF Contribution`."
msgstr ""
"Se genera automáticamente un informe eMPF después de cada ejecución de pago. "
"Haz clic en el informe eMPF o encuéntralo en :menuselection:`Informes --> "
"Contribución eMPF`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:642
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:387
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:439
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:459
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:378
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:381
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:526
msgid "Accounting check"
msgstr "Verificación contable"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:644
msgid ""
"The accounting process when running payroll has two components: creating "
"journal entries, and registering payments. For each component, there are two "
"possible scenarios: individual or batch."
msgstr ""
"El proceso contable al ejecutar la nómina tiene dos componentes: crear "
"asientos contables y registrar pagos. Para cada componente, hay dos "
"escenarios posibles: individual o por lotes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:648
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:395
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:447
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:467
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:386
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:389
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:534
msgid "Journal entry creation"
msgstr "Creación de asiento contable"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:650
msgid ""
"After payslips are confirmed and validated, journal entries are posted "
"either individually or in a batch. The journal entry is created first as a "
"draft."
msgstr ""
"Después de confirmar y validar las nóminas, los asientos contables se "
"publican de forma individual o por lotes. El asiento contable se crea "
"primero como borrador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:654
msgid ""
"It must be decided if journal entries are done individually or in batches "
"(:guilabel:`Batch Account Move Lines`) in the configuration before running "
"payroll."
msgstr ""
"Debe decidirse si los asientos contables se hacen individualmente o por "
"lotes (:guilabel:`líneas de movimiento de cuenta por lotes`) en la "
"configuración antes de ejecutar la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:658
msgid "Individual journal entries"
msgstr "Asientos contables individuales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:660
msgid ""
"Without enabling the batch account move line option, you need manual journal "
"entry postings for each payslip, regardless of using a pay run or individual "
"payslip. Select a payslip and click the :guilabel:`Journal Entry (Draft)` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Sin habilitar la opción de líneas de movimientos contables por lotes, "
"necesitas registros de asientos manuales para cada nómina, "
"independientemente de usar una ejecución de pago o nómina individual. "
"Selecciona una nómina y haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Asiento contable "
"(borrador)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:665
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Pay` button appears only for individual journal entries "
"posting. Enabling the :guilabel:`Batch Account Move Lines` option causes "
"this button to disappear."
msgstr ""
"El botón :guilabel:`Pagar` aparece solo para la publicación de asientos "
"contables individuales. Habilitar la opción :guilabel:`líneas de movimiento "
"de cuenta por lotes` hace que este botón desaparezca."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:668
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Post` button. Each payslip is automatically posted as "
"individual journal entries in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal "
"entries`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Publicar`. Cada nómina se publica "
"automáticamente como asientos contables individuales "
"en :menuselection:`Contabilidad --> Asientos contables`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:671
msgid "Posting a drafted Journal Entry."
msgstr "Publicación de un asiento contable en borrador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:674
msgid ""
"Four accounts from the Hong Kong CoA are included with the payroll "
"localization:"
msgstr ""
"Cuatro cuentas del plan contable de Hong Kong están incluidas con la "
"localización de nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:676
msgid ""
"`221001 MPF Accrued (Employer)`: Accrue |MPF| benefits that are spent by "
"employers."
msgstr ""
"`221001 MPF Acumulado (Empleador)`: Acumula beneficios |MPF| que son pagados "
"por los empleadores."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:677
msgid ""
"`221002 MPF Withheld (Employee)`: Withheld |MPF| benefits that are paid by "
"employees, which will be paid to the |MPF| provider soon."
msgstr ""
"`221002 MPF Retenido (Empleado)`: Beneficios |MPF| retenidos que son pagados "
"por los empleados, que se pagarán pronto al proveedor |MPF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:679
msgid ""
"`521700 MPF Contribution (Employer)`: Employer portion of |MPF| "
"contributions expected to be paid to the |MPF| provider soon."
msgstr ""
"`521700 MPF Contribución (Empleador)`: Porción del empleador de las "
"contribuciones |MPF| que se espera pagar pronto al proveedor |MPF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:681
msgid "`221700 Salaries & Wages Payable`: Net salary owed to the employee."
msgstr ""
"`221700 Sueldos y salarios por pagar`: salario neto adeudado al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:684
msgid "Batch entries"
msgstr "Asientos por lotes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:686
msgid ""
"Enabling :guilabel:`Batch Account Move Lines` aggregates all accounting "
"entries for the period into a single account move line. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Journal Entry (Draft)` button (which only appears after "
"enabling the batch account move line in payroll configuration for pay runs). "
"Click the :guilabel:`Post` button. All payslips are automatically "
"consolidated as one journal entry."
msgstr ""
"Habilitar :guilabel:`Batch Account Move Lines` agrega todas las entradas "
"contables del período en una sola línea de asiento contable. Haz clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Journal Entry (Draft)` (que solo aparece después de "
"habilitar la línea de asiento contable por lotes en la configuración de "
"nómina para las ejecuciones de pago). Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Post`. "
"Todas las nóminas se consolidan automáticamente como un solo asiento "
"contable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:692
msgid "Register payment"
msgstr "Registrar pago"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:694
msgid ""
"After the journal entries are validated, Odoo generates payment report files."
msgstr ""
"Una vez validados los asientos contables, Odoo genera archivos de informes "
"de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:697
msgid ""
"To generate payments from payslips, an employee must have a trusted bank "
"account. If the employee's bank account is not marked as trusted, payment "
"files cannot be generated."
msgstr ""
"Para generar pagos desde nóminas, un empleado debe tener una cuenta bancaria "
"de confianza. Si la cuenta bancaria del empleado no está marcada como de "
"confianza, no se pueden generar archivos de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:700
msgid ""
"**HSBC Auto Pay Report**: Click :guilabel:`HSBC Auto Pay Report`. (You must "
"configure the HSBC Autopay bank account in configuration for this button to "
"appear). Configure the HSBC Autopay report information. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Confirm` button. Click the download icon to download the "
"`.apc` HSBC report."
msgstr ""
"**Informe HSBC Auto Pay**: Haz clic en :guilabel:`HSBC Auto Pay Report`. "
"(Debes configurar la cuenta bancaria HSBC Autopay en la configuración para "
"que aparezca este botón). Configura la información del informe HSBC Autopay. "
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Confirm`. Haz clic en el icono de descarga "
"para descargar el informe HSBC `.apc`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:704
msgid ""
"**Payment Report**: Click :guilabel:`Payment Report`. Payments can be "
"grouped by partner if there is a partner associated with a salary rule. "
"Select the export format and click :guilabel:`Generate` to download the CSV."
msgstr ""
"**Informe de pago**: Haz clic en :guilabel:`Payment Report`. Los pagos se "
"pueden agrupar por contacto si hay un contacto asociado con una regla "
"salarial. Selecciona el formato de exportación y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Generate` para descargar el CSV."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:711
msgid "Payroll reporting"
msgstr "Informes de nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:713
msgid ""
"The Hong Kong localization contains several reports unique to HK, which "
"provide eMPF contribution reports and auto-generated IR56 reports (both in "
"`.xml` and PDF formats)."
msgstr ""
"La localización de Hong Kong contiene varios informes únicos de HK, que "
"proporcionan informes de contribuciones eMPF e informes IR56 autogenerados "
"(en formatos `.xml` y PDF)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:717
msgid ""
"Payslips must be validated in order to generate eMPF reports and IR56 "
"reports."
msgstr ""
"Las nóminas deben validarse para generar informes eMPF e informes IR56."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:720
msgid "eMPF contribution reports"
msgstr "Informes de contribuciones eMPF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:722
msgid "eMPF contribution reports can be generated in two ways:"
msgstr "Los informes de contribuciones eMPF se pueden generar de dos maneras:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:724
msgid ""
"**Auto-generated reports**: After every pay run, eMPF contributions reports "
"can be found in :menuselection:`Payroll app --> eMPF Contributions`."
msgstr ""
"**Informes generados automáticamente**: Después de cada ejecución de pago, "
"los informes de contribuciones eMPF se pueden encontrar "
"en :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Contribuciones eMPF`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:726
msgid ""
"**Manually generated reports**: eMPF contribution reports can be generated "
"manually only after the payslips are validated."
msgstr ""
"**Informes generados manualmente**: Los informes de contribuciones eMPF "
"pueden generarse manualmente solo después de que las nóminas estén validadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:729
msgid ""
"Click :menuselection:`Payroll --> eMPF Contributions`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New`. Select the contribution period, scheme, and payroll "
"group to generate the report."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en :menuselection:`Nómina --> Contribuciones eMPF`. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. Selecciona el período de contribución, el esquema y el "
"grupo de nómina para generar el informe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:732
msgid "**Member status**:"
msgstr "**Estado del miembro**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:734
msgid ":guilabel:`Existing Member`: Employees making monthly contributions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Miembro existente`: Empleados que realizan contribuciones "
"mensuales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:735
msgid ""
":guilabel:`New Member`: New employees in holiday periods for contributions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Miembro nuevo`: Nuevos empleados en períodos vacacionales para "
"contribuciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:736
msgid ":guilabel:`Terminated Member`: Employee leaving the company."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Miembro dado de baja`: Empleado que deja la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:738
msgid "**Termination payment**:"
msgstr "**Pago por terminación**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:740
msgid ""
":guilabel:`L`: Appears if a leaving employee has a long service payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`L`: Aparece si un empleado que se va tiene un pago por servicio "
"prolongado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:741
msgid ":guilabel:`S`: Appears if a leaving employee has a severance payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`S`: Aparece si un empleado que se va tiene un pago por "
"indemnización."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:743
msgid "The eMPF Contribution report screen."
msgstr "La pantalla del informe de contribución eMPF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:747
msgid ""
"Each contribution line can be amended (i.e., member status and termination "
"payment type can be updated or deleted). However, relevant income and "
"contributions cannot be edited. If the contribution line for an employee is "
"amended, click the (gear) icon :menuselection:`--> Recompute contribution` "
"to refresh the information."
msgstr ""
"Cada línea de contribución puede modificarse (es decir, el estado del "
"miembro y el tipo de pago por terminación pueden actualizarse o eliminarse). "
"Sin embargo, los ingresos y contribuciones relevantes no pueden editarse. Si "
"se modifica la línea de contribución de un empleado, haz clic en el icono "
"(engranaje) :menuselection:`--> Recalcular contribución` para actualizar la "
"información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:752
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Validate` button. If there are no errors, eMPF "
"contribution reports are generated in three different `.csv` files inside a "
"zip file, which are ready to upload to the eMPF portal: `new employees.csv`, "
"`contributions.csv`, and `terminated employees.csv`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Validar`. Si no hay errores, se generan "
"informes de contribución eMPF en tres archivos `.csv` diferentes dentro de "
"un archivo zip, que están listos para subir al portal eMPF: `new "
"employees.csv`, `contributions.csv` y `terminated employees.csv`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:757
msgid ""
"Warnings are mainly raised to align with eMPF requirements for employee "
"information. Employees **must** be 18-60 years of age, and the phone number "
"must be a valid Hong Kong phone number."
msgstr ""
"Las advertencias se generan principalmente para alinearse con los requisitos "
"de eMPF para la información de los empleados. Los empleados **deben** tener "
"entre 18 y 60 años de edad, y el número de teléfono debe ser un número de "
"teléfono válido de Hong Kong."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:761
msgid "IR56 reports"
msgstr "Informes IR56"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:763
msgid "Odoo provides four |IRD| reports:"
msgstr "Odoo proporciona cuatro informes |IRD|:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:765
msgid ""
":guilabel:`IR56B (Annual Return)`: The Employer's Return of Remuneration and "
"Pensions; submitted annually for all existing employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`IR56B (Declaración anual)`: La declaración del empleador de "
"remuneraciones y pensiones; se presenta anualmente para todos los empleados "
"actuales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:767
msgid ""
":guilabel:`IR56E (New Hire)`: Notification of Commencement of Employment; "
"submitted for new employees within three months of their start date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`IR56E (Nueva contratación)`: Notificación de inicio de empleo; se "
"presenta para nuevos empleados dentro de los tres meses posteriores a su "
"fecha de inicio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:769
msgid ""
":guilabel:`IR56F (Termination)`: Notification of Cessation of Employment for "
"employees leaving the company but remaining in Hong Kong."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`IR56F (Terminación)`: Notificación de cese de empleo para "
"empleados que dejan la empresa pero permanecen en Hong Kong."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:771
msgid ""
":guilabel:`IR56G (Departure)`: Notification of Cessation of Employment for "
"employees leaving Hong Kong permanently or for a long period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`IR56G (Salida)`: Notificación de cese de empleo para empleados "
"que abandonan Hong Kong de forma permanente o por un período prolongado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:775
msgid ""
"When generating the IR56B in Odoo, the system automatically looks at the "
"date on the payslips to pull all records falling within the last year, April "
"1 to March 31 of the current year. Once an employer files an IR56F or IR56G "
"for an employee, it should not be included again in the annual IR56B to "
"avoid double-reporting income."
msgstr ""
"Al generar el IR56B en Odoo, el sistema busca automáticamente la fecha en "
"las nóminas para extraer todos los registros que caen dentro del último año, "
"del 1 de abril al 31 de marzo del año actual. Una vez que un empleador "
"presenta un IR56F o IR56G para un empleado, no debe incluirse nuevamente en "
"el IR56B anual para evitar declarar ingresos por duplicado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:781
msgid "Generating an IR56 report"
msgstr "Generar un informe IR56"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:783
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting`, and select one of the "
"IR56B/E/F/G sheet options. Click :guilabel:`New`. Fill in the relevant "
"information for the |IRD| report (e.g., :guilabel:`Submission "
"Date`, :guilabel:`Year of Employer's Return`). Click "
"the :guilabel:`Populate` button."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Informes`, y selecciona una de "
"las opciones de hojas IR56B/E/F/G. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. Completa "
"la información relevante para el informe |IRD| (por "
"ejemplo, :guilabel:`Fecha de presentación`, :guilabel:`Año de declaración "
"del empleador`). Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Completar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:788
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Create XML` and :guilabel:`Eligible Employees` smart buttons "
"appear if there is relevant generated payslip information. "
"Click :guilabel:`Create XML` to download the XML report. "
"Click :guilabel:`Eligible Employees` to view the list and "
"select :guilabel:`Generate PDFs` to queue PDF document generation."
msgstr ""
"Los botones inteligentes :guilabel:`Crear XML` y :guilabel:`Empleados "
"elegibles` aparecen si hay información relevante de nóminas generadas. Haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Crear XML` para descargar el informe XML. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Empleados elegibles` para ver la lista y "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Generar PDF` para poner en cola la generación de "
"documentos PDF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:793
msgid "The completed IR56B report screen with downloadable files."
msgstr "La pantalla del informe IR56B completado con archivos descargables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:799
msgid "Payslip tabs"
msgstr "Pestañas de la nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:801
msgid ""
"Different tabs in each payslip define worked days used to calculate payroll, "
"additional salary inputs to add to the payslip, how salary computation is "
"handled, and other info that impacts the payslip."
msgstr ""
"Las diferentes pestañas en cada nómina definen los días trabajados "
"utilizados para calcular la nómina, las entradas salariales adicionales para "
"agregar a la nómina, cómo se gestiona el cálculo del salario y otra "
"información que impacta la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:805
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worked Days`: Details all the individual attendance records for "
"the time period, including both worked time and any time off taken. It is "
"auto-populated and cannot be edited."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Días trabajados`: Detalla todos los registros de asistencia "
"individuales para el período de tiempo, incluido tanto el tiempo trabajado "
"como cualquier ausencia tomada. Se completa automáticamente y no puede "
"editarse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:807
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Inputs`: Details where additional salary inputs are "
"listed, such as deductions, reimbursements, and expenses. "
"Click :guilabel:`Add Inputs` to manually include them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Entradas salariales`: Detalla dónde se listan las entradas "
"salariales adicionales, como deducciones, reembolsos y gastos. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Añadir entradas` para incluirlas manualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:809
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Computation`: Where all the individual salary rules are "
"listed and calculated, including everything from the employee's salary to "
"all the deductions, taxes, and |MPF| contributions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cálculo salarial`: Donde se enumeran y calculan todas las reglas "
"salariales individuales, incluyendo todo desde el salario del empleado hasta "
"todas las deducciones, impuestos y contribuciones |MPF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:812
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other Info`: Shows the :guilabel:`Average Daily Wage` rate that "
"is used to calculate statutory HK holidays and entitlements. Also contains "
"the :guilabel:`End-of-Year Pay`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Otra información`: Muestra la tasa de :guilabel:`Salario diario "
"promedio` que se utiliza para calcular las vacaciones y derechos legales de "
"Hong Kong. También contiene el :guilabel:`Pago de fin de año`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:816
msgid ""
"Manually adding an end-of-year payment to a specific payslip may require "
"saving the record manually, clicking the :icon:`fa-"
"gear` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, and then selecting :guilabel:`Recompute "
"Whole Sheet`."
msgstr ""
"Añadir manualmente un pago de fin de año a una nómina específica puede "
"requerir guardar el registro manualmente, hacer clic en el icono :icon:`fa-"
"gear` :guilabel:`Acciones` y luego seleccionar :guilabel:`Recalcular toda la "
"hoja`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:820
msgid "Other info tab under payslip"
msgstr "Pestaña otra información bajo nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:826
msgid "Understanding Hong Kong payroll"
msgstr "Entender la nómina de Hong Kong"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:828
msgid ""
"In Hong Kong, payroll calculations typically follow a standard daily wage "
"formula:"
msgstr ""
"En Hong Kong, los cálculos de nómina suelen seguir una fórmula estándar de "
"salario diario:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:830
msgid ""
"\\text{Daily Wage} = \\frac{\\text{Total wage in a month}}{\\text{Total days "
"in a month}}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Salario diario} = \\frac{\\text{Salario total en un mes}}"
"{\\text{Total de días en un mes}}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:834
msgid ""
"However, the Employment (Amendment) Ordinance 2007 (often referred to as the "
"*713 Ordinance*) requires employers to use the Average Daily Wage (ADW) when "
"calculating specific statutory entitlements. Statutory entitlements "
"requiring ADW include: holiday pay, annual leave pay, sickness allowance, "
"maternity leave pay, paternity leave pay, end of year payment, and payment "
"in lieu of notice."
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, la Ordenanza de Empleo (Enmienda) 2007 (a menudo denominada "
"\"Ordenanza 713\") requiere que los empleadores usen el salario diario "
"promedio (ADW) al calcular derechos estatutarios específicos. Los derechos "
"estatutarios que requieren ADW incluyen: pago por días festivos, pago por "
"vacaciones anuales, subsidio por enfermedad, pago por licencia de "
"maternidad, pago por licencia de paternidad, pago de fin de año y pago en "
"lugar de aviso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:840
msgid ""
"To calculate the ADW, use the earnings and days from the preceding 12 months:"
msgstr ""
"Para calcular el ADW, usa las ganancias y días de los 12 meses anteriores:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:842
msgid ""
"\\text{ADW} = \\frac{\\text{Total Wage in 12-month period} - \\text{Wages of "
"Non-full pay}}{\\text{Total Days in 12-month period} - \\text{Days of Non-"
"full pay}}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{ADW} = \\frac{\\text{Salario total en período de 12 meses} - "
"\\text{Salarios de pago no completo}}{\\text{Total de días en período de 12 "
"meses} - \\text{Días de pago no completo}}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:846
msgid "Where:"
msgstr "Donde:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:848
msgid ""
"**Total Wage in 12-month period**: All earnings in the last 12 months (e.g., "
"basic salary, overtime, commissions, and allowances)."
msgstr ""
"**Salario total en período de 12 meses**: Todas las ganancias en los últimos "
"12 meses (por ejemplo, salario básico, horas extras, comisiones y subsidios)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:850
msgid ""
"**Wages of Non-full pay**: Any wages paid at less than the full rate (e.g., "
"sick leave, maternity/paternity leave, etc)."
msgstr ""
"**Salarios de pago no completo**: Cualquier salario pagado a una tasa "
"inferior a la completa (por ejemplo, licencia por enfermedad, licencia de "
"maternidad/paternidad, etc)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:852
msgid ""
"**Total Days in 12-month period**: Total calendar days in the 12-month "
"reference period."
msgstr ""
"**Total de días en período de 12 meses**: Total de días calendario en el "
"período de referencia de 12 meses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:853
msgid ""
"**Days of Non-full pay**: The specific number of days for which the employee "
"was not paid in full."
msgstr ""
"**Días de pago no completo**: El número específico de días por los cuales el "
"empleado no recibió pago completo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:856
msgid ""
"Odoo requires historical payroll records to calculate ADW accurately. If no "
"prior records exist, the ADW calculation always results in zero."
msgstr ""
"Odoo requiere registros históricos de nómina para calcular el ADW con "
"precisión. Si no existen registros previos, el cálculo del ADW siempre "
"resulta en cero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:862
msgid "Calculation examples"
msgstr "Ejemplos de cálculo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:865
msgid "CAP 57: Employees Monthly Pay"
msgstr "CAP 57: Pago mensual de empleados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:867
msgid ""
"Calculate the March payslip for Natalie Chan who joined Jan 1, 2026, with a "
"monthly salary of 20K."
msgstr ""
"Calcula la nómina de marzo para Natalie Chan quien se incorporó el 1 de "
"enero de 2026, con un salario mensual de 20K."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:869
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:927
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:958
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:998
msgid "Jan: Monthly salary 20K."
msgstr "Ene: Salario mensual 20K."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:870
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:928
msgid "Feb: Monthly salary 20K and 5K commission."
msgstr "Feb: Salario mensual 20K y 5K de comisión."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:871
msgid ""
"Mar: Apply for one full-paid paternity leave and one sick leave with 80% ADW "
"in March."
msgstr ""
"Mar: Solicitar una baja de paternidad totalmente remunerada y una baja por "
"enfermedad con 80% de SDP en marzo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:873
msgid "**Calculate ADW:**"
msgstr "**Calcular SDP:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:875
msgid "Total wages earned: 20,000 + 25,000 = 45,000"
msgstr "Salarios totales ganados: 20.000 + 25.000 = 45.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:876
msgid "Total days: 31 + 28 = 59 days"
msgstr "Total de días: 31 + 28 = 59 días"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:878
msgid "\\text{ADW} = \\frac{45,000}{59} = 762.71"
msgstr "\\text{SDP} = \\frac{45.000}{59} = 762,71"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:882
msgid "**Calculate leave payment and total wages:**"
msgstr "**Calcular el pago de baja y salarios totales:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:884
msgid "One full day paternity leave (full paid ADW) = 762.71"
msgstr ""
"Un día completo de baja de paternidad (SDP totalmente remunerado) = 762,71"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:885
msgid "One full day sick leave 80% (80% paid ADW) = 762.71 * 80% = 610.17"
msgstr ""
"Un día completo de baja por enfermedad al 80% (80% pagado ADW) = 762,71 * "
"80% = 610,17"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:886
msgid ""
"Attendance = Daily wage * num of working days = (20,000 / 31) * 20 = "
"12,903.23"
msgstr ""
"Asistencia = Salario diario * número de días laborables = (20.000 / 31) * 20 "
"= 12.903,23"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:887
msgid "Weekend = Daily wage * num of weekends = (20,000 / 31) * 9 = 5,806.45"
msgstr ""
"Fin de semana = Salario diario * número de fines de semana = (20.000 / 31) * "
"9 = 5.806,45"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:888
msgid ""
"Wages earned for Mar = 762.71 + 610.17 + 12,903.23 + 5,806.45 = 20,082.56"
msgstr ""
"Salarios ganados para Mar = 762,71 + 610,17 + 12.903,23 + 5.806,45 = "
"20.082,56"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:890
msgid "**Calculate HK compliant payslip:**"
msgstr "**Calcular nómina conforme a HK:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:892
msgid "Basic salary = 20,082.56"
msgstr "Salario básico = 20.082,56"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:893
msgid "|MPF| gross = 20,082.56"
msgstr "Bruto |MPF| = 20.082,56"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:894
msgid "Employee mandatory contribution = 20,082.56 * 5% = 1,004.13"
msgstr "Contribución obligatoria del empleado = 20.082,56 * 5% = 1.004,13"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:895
msgid "Net salary earned for Mar = 20,082.56 - 1,004.13 = 19,078.43"
msgstr "Salario neto ganado para Mar = 20.082,56 - 1.004,13 = 19.078,43"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:898
msgid "CAP 57: Hong Kong Casual Employee"
msgstr "CAP 57: Empleado ocasional de Hong Kong"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:900
msgid ""
"Calculate the January first-week payslip for David Lee who joined Jan 1, "
"2026, with an hourly wage of 80 HKD."
msgstr ""
"Calcula la nómina de la primera semana de enero de David Lee, que se "
"incorporó el 1 de enero de 2026, con un salario por hora de 80 HKD."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:903
msgid "Jan 5 - Jan 11: 8 hours per day, 5 days per week."
msgstr "5 - 11 de enero: 8 horas al día, 5 días a la semana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:905
msgid "**1. Calculate the daily income:**"
msgstr "**1. Calcula los ingresos diarios:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:907
msgid ""
"Calculate the daily income to determine the Industry Schemes MPF amount."
msgstr ""
"Calcula los ingresos diarios para determinar el importe del MPF para "
"regímenes sectoriales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:909
msgid "\\text{Daily Income} = 80 \\times 8 = 640"
msgstr "\\text{Ingreso diario} = 80 \\times 8 = 640"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:913
msgid "**2. Calculate the daily MPF:**"
msgstr "**2. Calcula el MPF diario:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:915
msgid ""
"Based on the Industry Scheme daily income brackets, a daily income of 640 "
"HKD falls into the \"$550 to less than $650\" bracket."
msgstr ""
"Según los tramos de ingresos diarios del Plan del sector, un ingreso diario "
"de 640 HKD se sitúa en el tramo de «550 $ a menos de 650 $»."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:918
msgid "Employee mandatory contribution: 30 per day"
msgstr "Aportación obligatoria del empleado: 30 al día"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:919
msgid "Employer mandatory contribution: 30 per day"
msgstr "Aportación obligatoria del empleador: 30 al día"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:922
msgid "CAP 57: Payment in Lieu of Notice"
msgstr "CAP 57: Pago en lugar de aviso"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:924
msgid ""
"Calculate payment in lieu of notice for Natalie Chan who joined Jan 1, 2026, "
"with a monthly salary of 20K and was fired in Mar with one month of payment "
"in lieu of notice."
msgstr ""
"Calcular el pago en lugar de aviso para Natalie Chan, que se incorporó el 1 "
"de enero de 2026, con un salario mensual de 20K y fue despedida en marzo con "
"un mes de pago en lugar de aviso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:930
msgid "**1. Calculate average monthly salary:**"
msgstr "**1. Calcular el salario mensual promedio:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:932
msgid "Days in average month: 365 days / 12 months = 30.41667 days"
msgstr "Días en un mes promedio: 365 días / 12 meses = 30,41667 días"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:934
msgid ""
"\\text{Average monthly salary} = \\text{ADW} \\times \\text{Days in average "
"month}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Salario mensual promedio} = \\text{ADW} \\times \\text{Días en un mes "
"promedio}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:938
msgid "\\text{Average monthly salary} = 762.71 \\times 30.41667 = 23,199.15"
msgstr "\\text{Salario mensual promedio} = 762.71 \\times 30.41667 = 23,199.15"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:942
msgid "**2. Calculate payment in lieu of notice:**"
msgstr "**2. Calcular pago en lugar de preaviso:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:944
msgid ""
"\\text{Payment in Lieu of Notice} = \\text{Average monthly salary} \\times "
"\\text{Notice Period}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Pago en lugar de preaviso} = \\text{Salario mensual promedio} \\times "
"\\text{Período de preaviso}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:948
msgid "\\text{Payment in Lieu of Notice} = 23,199.15 \\times 1 = 23,199.15"
msgstr "\\text{Pago en lugar de preaviso} = 23,199.15 \\times 1 = 23,199.15"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:953
msgid "CAP 57: Long Service Payment"
msgstr "CAP 57: Pago por servicio prolongado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:955
msgid ""
"Calculate long service payment for Anthony Choi who joined Jan 1, 2021, with "
"a monthly salary of 20K and left the company on Feb 28, 2026."
msgstr ""
"Calcula el pago por servicio prolongado para Anthony Choi, quien se unió el "
"1 de enero de 2021, con un salario mensual de 20K y dejó la empresa el 28 de "
"febrero de 2026."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:959
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:999
msgid "Feb: Monthly salary 20K."
msgstr "Feb: Salario mensual 20K."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:961
msgid "**1. Calculate long service payment:**"
msgstr "**1. Calcular pago por servicio prolongado:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:963
msgid ""
"Last month's monthly salary record must be in Odoo to calculate SP/LSP. The "
"LSP is based on pre/post transition according to the `HK Labour calculator "
"<https://www.lr.labour.gov.hk/web/en/calculator/index.html>`_:"
msgstr ""
"El registro del salario mensual del último mes debe estar en Odoo para "
"calcular SP/LSP. El LSP se basa en pre/post transición según la `calculadora "
"laboral de HK <https://www.lr.labour.gov.hk/web/en/calculator/index.html>`_:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:967
msgid ""
"\\text{LSP} = \\left(\\text{Last Full Month's Wages} \\times \\frac{2}"
"{3}\\right) \\times \\text{Years of Service}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{LSP} = \\left(\\text{Salarios del último mes completo} \\times "
"\\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\times \\text{Años de servicio}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:971
msgid ""
"\\text{LSP} = \\text{Pre-transition portion} + \\text{Post-transition "
"portion}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{LSP} = \\text{Porción pre-transición} + \\text{Porción post-"
"transición}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:975
msgid ""
"\\text{LSP} = \\left(20,000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\left(4 + "
"\\frac{120}{365}\\right)\\right) + \\left(20,000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} "
"\\times \\left(0 + \\frac{304}{365}\\right)\\right)"
msgstr ""
"\\text{LSP} = \\left(20,000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\left(4 + "
"\\frac{120}{365}\\right)\\right) + \\left(20,000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} "
"\\times \\left(0 + \\frac{304}{365}\\right)\\right)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:979
msgid "\\text{LSP} = 57,716.89 + 11,105.02 = 68,821.91"
msgstr "\\text{LSP} = 57,716.89 + 11,105.02 = 68,821.91"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:983
msgid "**2. Calculate long service payment with MPF offset:**"
msgstr "**2. Calcular pago por servicio prolongado con compensación MPF:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:985
msgid ""
"**Pre-transition offset**: Total employee mandatory contributions made "
"before May 2025 can be excluded from the long service payment. Example: If "
"Anthony's total employee mandatory contribution before May 2025 was "
"7,047.98, this amount is treated as a pre-transition offset and excluded "
"from the long service payment."
msgstr ""
"**Compensación pre-transición**: Las contribuciones obligatorias totales del "
"empleado realizadas antes de mayo de 2025 pueden excluirse del pago por "
"servicio prolongado. Ejemplo: Si la contribución obligatoria total de "
"Anthony antes de mayo de 2025 fue de 7.047,98, este monto se trata como una "
"compensación pre-transición y se excluye del pago por servicio prolongado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:989
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1029
msgid ""
"**Post-transition offset**: Employee mandatory contributions made after May "
"2025 cannot be excluded (no post-transition offset)."
msgstr ""
"**Compensación post-transición**: Las contribuciones obligatorias del "
"empleado realizadas después de mayo de 2025 no pueden excluirse (sin "
"compensación post-transición)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:993
msgid "CAP 57: Severance Payment"
msgstr "CAP 57: Pago de indemnización"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:995
msgid ""
"Calculate severance payment for Anthony Choi who joined Jan 1, 2023, with a "
"monthly salary of 20K and leaves the company on Feb 28, 2026."
msgstr ""
"Calcular el pago de indemnización para Anthony Choi que se incorporó el 1 de "
"enero de 2023, con un salario mensual de 20K y deja la empresa el 28 de "
"febrero de 2026."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1001
msgid "**1. Calculate severance payment:**"
msgstr "**1. Calcular la indemnización por despido:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1003
msgid ""
"Last month's monthly salary record must be in Odoo to calculate SP/LSP. The "
"SP is based on pre/post transition according to the `HK Labour calculator "
"<https://www.lr.labour.gov.hk/web/en/calculator/index.html>`_:"
msgstr ""
"El registro salarial mensual del último mes debe estar en Odoo para calcular "
"SP/LSP. El SP se basa en pre/post transición según la `calculadora laboral "
"de HK <https://www.lr.labour.gov.hk/web/en/calculator/index.html>`_:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1007
msgid ""
"\\text{SP} = \\left(\\text{Last Full Month's Wages} \\times \\frac{2}"
"{3}\\right) \\times \\text{Years of Service}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{SP} = \\left(\\text{Salario del Último Mes Completo} \\times \\frac{2}"
"{3}\\right) \\times \\text{Años de Servicio}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1011
msgid ""
"\\text{SP} = \\text{Pre-transition portion} + \\text{Post-transition portion}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{SP} = \\text{Parte previa a la transición} + \\text{Parte posterior a "
"la transición}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1015
msgid ""
"\\text{SP} = \\left(20,000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\left(2 + "
"\\frac{120}{365}\\right)\\right) + \\left(20,000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} "
"\\times \\left(0 + \\frac{304}{365}\\right)\\right)"
msgstr ""
"\\text{SP} = \\left(20.000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} \\times \\left(2 + "
"\\frac{120}{365}\\right)\\right) + \\left(20.000 \\times \\frac{2}{3} "
"\\times \\left(0 + \\frac{304}{365}\\right)\\right)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1019
msgid "\\text{SP} = 31,050.23 + 11,105.02 = 42,155.25"
msgstr "\\text{SP} = 31.050,23 + 11.105,02 = 42.155,25"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1023
msgid "**2. Calculate severance payment with MPF offset:**"
msgstr "**2. Calcular la indemnización por despido con compensación MPF:**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/hong_kong.rst:1025
msgid ""
"**Pre-transition offset**: Total employee mandatory contributions made "
"before May 2025 can be excluded from the severance payment. Example: If "
"Anthony's total employee mandatory contribution before May 2025 was "
"7,047.98, this amount is treated as a pre-transition offset and excluded "
"from the severance payment."
msgstr ""
"**Compensación previa a la transición**: Las contribuciones obligatorias "
"totales del empleado realizadas antes de mayo de 2025 pueden excluirse de la "
"indemnización por despido. Ejemplo: Si la contribución obligatoria total de "
"Anthony antes de mayo de 2025 fue de 7.047,98, este importe se trata como "
"una compensación previa a la transición y se excluye de la indemnización por "
"despido."

