msgstr "Seguro Estatal de Empleados (ESIC)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:173
msgid ""
"The **ESIC** is a social security scheme that provides medical and cash "
"benefits to employees and their families."
msgstr ""
"El **ESIC** es un sistema de seguridad social que proporciona beneficios "
"médicos y en efectivo a los empleados y sus familias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:176
msgid ""
"Both employer and employee contributions are automatically calculated as a "
"percentage of the wage."
msgstr ""
"Las contribuciones tanto del empleador como del empleado se calculan "
"automáticamente como un porcentaje del salario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/india.rst:179
msgid ""
"More information about `Employees' State Insurance Corporation (ESIC) "
"<https://esic.gov.in/>`_"
