"Links payroll and accounting by creating journal entries to record payroll "
"in the company's books."
msgstr ""
"Vincula la nómina y la contabilidad creando asientos contables para "
"registrar la nómina en los libros de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:39
msgid ""
"Before configuring the Jordan localization, refer to the "
"general :doc:`payroll <../../payroll>` documentation, which includes the "
"basic information for all localizations, as well as all universal settings "
"and fields."
msgstr ""
"Antes de configurar la localización de Jordania, consulta la documentación "
"general de :doc:`nómina <../../payroll>`, que incluye la información básica "
"para todas las localizaciones, así como todos los ajustes y campos "
"universales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`Jordan fiscal localization documentation <../../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/jordan>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Documentación de localización fiscal de Jordania <../../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/jordan>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: Complete the full address, including "
"the :guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`Zip Code`, and :guilabel:`Country` fields."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dirección`: Completa la dirección completa, incluyendo los "
"campos :guilabel:`Ciudad`, :guilabel:`Código postal` y :guilabel:`País`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:58
msgid ""
"Jordan does not use the :guilabel:`State` field, this remains blank. "
"The :guilabel:`Zip Code` refers to the Jordanian `Postal Code`."
msgstr ""
"Jordania no usa el campo :guilabel:`Estado`, este permanece en blanco. "
"El :guilabel:`Código postal` se refiere al `Postal Code` jordano."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:61
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`: Enter the company's tax identification number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ID fiscal`: Introduce el número de identificación fiscal de la "
"empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:62
msgid ":guilabel:`Company ID` : Enter the business's registry number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ID de empresa` : Introduce el número de registro de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, :abbr:`JOD (Jordanian Dollars)` is "
"selected. If not, select :guilabel:`JOD` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moneda`: Por defecto, se selecciona :abbr:`JOD (dólares "
"jordanos)`. Si no es así, selecciona :guilabel:`JOD` en el menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:69
msgid ""
"Every employee being paid must have their employee profiles configured for "
"the Jordan payroll localization. Additional fields are present after "
"configuring the database for Jordan."
msgstr ""
"Cada empleado que reciba un pago debe tener su perfil de empleado "
"configurado para la localización de nómina de Jordania. Aparecen campos "
"adicionales después de configurar la base de datos para Jordania."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:72
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:75
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:144
msgid ""
"To update an employee form, open the :menuselection:`Employees` app and "
"click on the desired employee record. On the employee form, configure the "
"required fields in the related tabs."
msgstr ""
"Para actualizar un formulario de empleado, abre la "
"aplicación :menuselection:`Empleados` y haz clic en el registro del empleado "
"deseado. En el formulario del empleado, configura los campos requeridos en "
"las pestañas relacionadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:78
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:104
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:81
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:69
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Work Address` for the employee in "
"the :guilabel:`Location` section of the :guilabel:`Work` tab."
msgstr ""
"Introduce la :guilabel:`Dirección de trabajo` del empleado en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Ubicación` de la pestaña :guilabel:`Trabajo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:114
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:75
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:159
msgid ""
"Ensure the employee has a minimum of one :ref:`trusted bank account "
"<employees/private-contact>` listed in the :guilabel:`Bank Accounts` field "
"in the :guilabel:`Private Contact` section."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que el empleado tenga un mínimo de una :ref:`cuenta bancaria de "
"confianza <employees/private-contact>` listada en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Cuentas bancarias` en la sección :guilabel:`Contacto "
"privado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:91
msgid ""
"If the employee is **not** a resident of Jordan, tick the :guilabel:`Non-"
"resident` box. This indicates the employee is *not* eligible for personal "
"exemptions."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado **no** es residente de Jordania, marca la "
"casilla :guilabel:`No residente`. Esto indica que el empleado *no* es "
"elegible para exenciones personales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:94
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Family` section, ensure the :guilabel:`Has Dependants` "
"box is ticked if the employee has any dependants, such as a spouse, "
"children, or parents. This ensures they receive an additional exemption on "
"their taxable salary."
msgstr ""
"En la sección :guilabel:`Familia`, asegúrate de que la "
"casilla :guilabel:`Tiene dependientes` esté marcada si el empleado tiene "
"dependientes, como cónyuge, hijos o padres. Esto garantiza que reciban una "
"exención adicional sobre su salario imponible."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:98
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Is Eligible for EOS` checkbox is ticked, in "
"the :guilabel:`Personal Information` section, indicating the employee is "
"eligible for end of service benefits. If the employee is **not** eligible, "
"ensure the box is unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, la casilla :guilabel:`Es elegible para EOS` está marcada, en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Información personal`, indicando que el empleado es "
"elegible para los beneficios de fin de servicio. Si el empleado **no** es "
"elegible, asegúrate de desmarcar la casilla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:102
msgid ""
"Additionally, if the employee is blind, tick the :guilabel:`Is Blind` "
"checkbox. This ensures the employee's entire salary is tax-exempt."
msgstr ""
"Además, si el empleado es ciego, marca la casilla :guilabel:`Es ciego`. Esto "
"garantiza que el salario completo del empleado esté exento de impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:111
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:143
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:109
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:90
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:179
msgid ""
"This section holds information that drives salary calculations. Ensure the "
"following fields are configured:"
msgstr ""
"Esta sección contiene información que impulsa los cálculos salariales. "
"Asegúrate de que los siguientes campos estén configurados:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract`: Ensure the contract dates are populated. The contract "
"start date populates the first field, and if the contract has a set end "
"date, that is populated in the second field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contrato`: Asegúrate de que las fechas del contrato estén "
"completadas. La fecha de inicio del contrato completa el primer campo y, si "
"el contrato tiene una fecha de finalización establecida, esta se completa en "
"el segundo campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:116
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:148
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:114
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:94
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:184
msgid ":guilabel:`Wage Type`: Select how the employee is paid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tipo de salario`: selecciona cómo se le paga al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:118
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:150
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:116
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:96
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:186
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Fixed Wage` for salaried employees who receive the same "
"amount each pay period."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona :guilabel:`Salario fijo` para empleados asalariados que reciben "
"la misma cantidad cada período de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:120
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:152
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:118
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:188
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Hourly Wage` for employees paid based on hours worked."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona :guilabel:`Salario por hora` para empleados pagados en función de "
"las horas trabajadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage`: Enter the monthly wage in this field, in :abbr:`JOD "
"(Jordanian Dollars)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario`: Introduce el salario mensual en este campo, "
"en :abbr:`JOD (dólares jordanos)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Type`: Select what kind of employee the contract is for, "
"such as :guilabel:`Employee` or :guilabel:`Freelance`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de empleado`: Selecciona qué tipo de empleado es el "
"contrato, como :guilabel:`Empleado` o :guilabel:`Autónomo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Type`: Determines how the employee is paid and "
"classified, such "
"as :guilabel:`Permanent`, :guilabel:`Temporary`, :guilabel:`Seasonal`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de contrato`: Determina cómo se paga y clasifica al "
"empleado, "
"como :guilabel:`Permanente`, :guilabel:`Temporal`, :guilabel:`Estacional`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select :guilabel:`Jordan: Employee` for this "
"field. This defines when the employee is paid, their default working "
"schedule, and the work entry type it applies to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de pago`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Jordania: Empleado` "
"para este campo. Esto define cuándo se paga al empleado, su horario de "
"trabajo predeterminado y el tipo de entrada de trabajo al que se aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:135
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:131
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:117
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:205
msgid "The contract overview section of the employee form of the payroll tab."
msgstr ""
"La sección de resumen del contrato del formulario de empleado de la pestaña "
"de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:151
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:184
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:147
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:221
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Hours`: Tick the checkbox to allow the **Attendances** app "
"to add any extra work entries logged by the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Horas extra`: marca la casilla para permitir que la aplicación "
"**Asistencias** agregue cualquier entrada de trabajo adicional registrada "
"por el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:153
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: Using the drop-down menu, "
"select :guilabel:`Jordan Working Schedule`, which consists of a Sunday - "
"Thursday, 40-hour work week."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Horario de Trabajo`: usando el menú desplegable, "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Horario de Trabajo de Jordania`, que consiste en una "
"semana laboral de domingo a jueves de 40 horas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:157
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:166
msgid "Allowances section"
msgstr "Sección de complementos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:159
msgid ""
"The following sections of benefits are considered common ones offered by "
"Jordanian employers. This information needs to be populated with the "
"information selected by the employee."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes secciones de beneficios se consideran comunes y son ofrecidas "
"por los empleadores jordanos. Esta información debe completarse con la "
"información seleccionada por el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:163
msgid ""
"The benefits listed in this section are considered the ones most commonly "
"offered by companies. If other employee benefits exist that require regular "
"paycheck deductions, they can be added as *inputs*."
msgstr ""
"Los beneficios listados en esta sección se consideran los más comúnmente "
"ofrecidos por las empresas. Si existen otros beneficios para empleados que "
"requieren deducciones regulares del salario, pueden añadirse como *entradas*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:167
msgid ""
"Enter the monthly allowance amount "
"for :guilabel:`Housing`, :guilabel:`Transportation`, and :guilabel:`Other` "
"allowances."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el importe mensual del complemento "
"para :guilabel:`Vivienda`, :guilabel:`Transporte` y :guilabel:`Otros` "
"complementos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:170
msgid ""
"If the employee is tax exempt, enter the annual amount that is not subject "
"to taxes in the :guilabel:`Tax Exemption` field."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado está exento de impuestos, introduce el importe anual que no "
"está sujeto a impuestos en el campo :guilabel:`Exención Fiscal`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:173
msgid ""
"If the employee's salary is based on commission, tick the :guilabel:`Is "
"Commission based` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Si el salario del empleado se basa en comisiones, marca la "
"casilla :guilabel:`Basado en Comisión`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:176
msgid "Annual leave provision section"
msgstr "Sección de provisión de vacaciones anuales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:178
msgid ""
"Every year, employees receive days off. Enter the number of days in "
"the :guilabel:`Number of Leave days` field. The default value is 14."
msgstr ""
"Cada año, los empleados reciben días libres. Introduce el número de días en "
"el campo :guilabel:`Número de Días de Vacaciones`. El valor predeterminado "
"es 14."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:182
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:166
msgid "Social Insurance"
msgstr "Seguro social"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:184
msgid ""
"Social insurance rules calculate the contribution amounts that are to be "
"paid by the employer and employee to the :abbr:`Social Security Corporation "
"(SSC)`. This is only available for Jordanian employees."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas del seguro social calculan los importes de contribución que deben "
"pagar el empleador y el empleado a la :abbr:`Corporación de Seguridad Social "
"(SSC)`. Esto solo está disponible para empleados jordanos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:188
msgid ""
"The employer contributes 14.25% of the employee's salary to "
"the :abbr:`Social Security Corporation (SSC)`, while the employee "
"contributes 7.5% of their salary, which is deducted from their payslip."
msgstr ""
"El empleador contribuye con el 14,25% del salario del empleado a "
"la :abbr:`Corporación de Seguridad Social (SSC)`, mientras que el empleado "
"contribuye con el 7,5% de su salario, que se deduce de su nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:191
msgid ""
"For both employer and employee contributions, the base amount on which they "
"are calculated is bound by a cap that gets updated every year."
msgstr ""
"Para las contribuciones del empleador y del empleado, el importe base sobre "
"el que se calculan está limitado por un tope que se actualiza cada año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:197
msgid "The following leave types are available to employees working in Jordan:"
msgstr ""
"Los siguientes tipos de ausencia están disponibles para empleados que "
"trabajan en Jordania:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:199
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Annual leave`: Employee's are eligible for 21 days of annual "
"leave, and if the employee requires more days, they have to be requested "
"from HR managers accordingly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vacaciones anuales`: los empleados tienen derecho a 21 días de "
"vacaciones anuales, y si el empleado requiere más días, deben solicitarse a "
"los responsables de RR.HH. en consecuencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sick leave`: Employee's working in Jordan are entitled to 14 days "
"of paid sick leave per year, with the possibility of an additional 14 days "
"if hospitalized. No deductions are applied to the employee in those cases."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Baja por enfermedad`: los empleados que trabajan en Jordania "
"tienen derecho a 14 días de baja por enfermedad remunerada al año, con la "
"posibilidad de 14 días adicionales si están hospitalizados. No se aplican "
"deducciones al empleado en esos casos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other leave types`: These leave types are fully paid and do not "
"affect the final payslip, but are tracked for reporting purposes:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Otros tipos de ausencia`: estos tipos de ausencia están "
"completamente remunerados y no afectan a la nómina final, pero se rastrean "
"con fines informativos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:213
msgid ":guilabel:`Maternity leave`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Baja por maternidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:214
msgid ":guilabel:`Paternity Leave`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Baja por paternidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:215
msgid ":guilabel:`Pilgrimage Leave`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Baja por peregrinación`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:216
msgid ":guilabel:`Study leave`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Permiso de estudios`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:219
msgid "Income Tax"
msgstr "Impuesto sobre la renta"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:221
msgid ""
"In Jordan, employees are subject to a progressive income tax system, where "
"tax rates increase with higher annual income brackets."
msgstr ""
"En Jordania, los empleados están sujetos a un sistema progresivo de impuesto "
"sobre la renta, donde las tasas impositivas aumentan con tramos de ingresos "
"anuales más altos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:233
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:262
msgid "Taxable Bracket"
msgstr "Tramo imponible"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:234
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:263
msgid "Range"
msgstr "Rango"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:235
msgid "5%"
msgstr "5%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:236
msgid "0-5,000"
msgstr "0-5.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:238
msgid "5,001 - 10,000"
msgstr "5.001 - 10.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:240
msgid "10,001 - 15,000"
msgstr "10.001 - 15.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:242
msgid "15,001 - 20,000"
msgstr "15.001 - 20.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:244
msgid "20,001 - 1,000,000"
msgstr "20.001 - 1.000.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:245
msgid "30%"
msgstr "30%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:246
msgid "More than 1,000,000"
msgstr "Más de 1.000.000"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:249
msgid ""
"Tax brackets are applied progressively. This means each portion of an "
"employee's income is taxed at its respective rate within each bracket, "
"rather than their entire income being taxed at the rate of the highest "
"bracket they fall into."
msgstr ""
"Los tramos impositivos se aplican de forma progresiva. Esto significa que "
"cada porción de los ingresos de un empleado se grava a su tasa respectiva "
"dentro de cada tramo, en lugar de que todos sus ingresos se graven a la tasa "
"del tramo más alto en el que se encuentren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:256
msgid ""
"Several factors contribute to exempting part of an employee's gross income, "
"including:"
msgstr ""
"Varios factores contribuyen a eximir parte de los ingresos brutos de un "
"empleado, incluyendo:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:258
msgid ""
"**Jordanian residency**: Residents are entitled to a yearly exemption of "
"12,000 JOD."
msgstr ""
"**Residencia jordana**: Los residentes tienen derecho a una exención anual "
"de 12.000 JOD."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:259
msgid ""
"**Blindness**: Individuals who are blind are **fully** exempt from income "
"tax."
msgstr ""
"**Ceguera**: Las personas ciegas están **totalmente** exentas del impuesto "
"sobre la renta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:260
msgid ""
"**Dependents**: An additional 12,000 JOD exemption per year for employees "
"with dependents."
msgstr ""
"**Dependientes**: Una exención adicional de 12.000 JOD por año para "
"empleados con dependientes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:265
msgid ""
"Employees are entitled to additional pay for overtime worked, depending on "
"when the overtime hours are worked:"
msgstr ""
"Los empleados tienen derecho a pago adicional por horas extras trabajadas, "
"dependiendo de cuándo se trabajen las horas extras:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:268
msgid ""
"On working days: Overtime is paid at 1.25 times the regular hourly wage."
msgstr ""
"En días laborables: Las horas extras se pagan a 1,25 veces el salario "
"horario regular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:269
msgid ""
"On rest days: Overtime is compensated at 1.5 times the regular hourly wage."
msgstr ""
"En días de descanso: Las horas extras se compensan a 1,5 veces el salario "
"horario regular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:271
msgid "These percentages are recorded in the input parameters model."
msgstr "Estos porcentajes se registran en el modelo de parámetros de entrada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:274
msgid ""
"The number of overtime hours is registered as other inputs directly on "
"payslips."
msgstr ""
"El número de horas extras se registra como otros inputs directamente en las "
"nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:279
msgid ""
"Provisions are the amounts computed by the employer to account for the "
"payments made to the employee for :abbr:`end-of-service (EOS)` benefits or "
"annual leaves. It is computed on a monthly basis."
msgstr ""
"Las provisiones son los montos calculados por el empleador para contabilizar "
"los pagos realizados al empleado por beneficios de :abbr:`fin de servicio "
"(EOS)` o vacaciones anuales. Se calcula mensualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:282
msgid ""
"**End of service benefit provision**: This is computed by dividing the "
"monthly gross salary by 12"
msgstr ""
"**Provisión de beneficio de fin de servicio**: Se calcula dividiendo el "
"salario bruto mensual entre 12"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:284
msgid "\\frac{\\text{Basic} + \\text{Allowances}}{12}"
msgstr "\\frac{\\text{Básico} + \\text{Asignaciones}}{12}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:288
msgid ""
"**Annual leave provision**: This is computed by dividing the gross salary by "
"30 to get the daily salary, then multiplying that by the number of leave "
"days, and dividing the result by 12."
msgstr ""
"**Provisión de vacaciones anuales**: Se calcula dividiendo el salario bruto "
"entre 30 para obtener el salario diario, luego multiplicando ese resultado "
"por el número de días de vacaciones y dividiendo el resultado entre 12."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:291
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:296
msgid ""
"\\left(\\frac{\\text{Basic} + \\text{Allowances}}{30}\\right)\n"
"\\times\n"
"\\left(\\frac{\\text{Number of Leave Days}}{12}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"\\left(\\frac{\\text{Básico} + \\text{Asignaciones}}{30}\\right)\n"
"\\times\n"
"\\left(\\frac{\\text{Número de Días de Vacaciones}}{12}\\right)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:298
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:237
msgid "End of Service"
msgstr "Fin de servicio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:300
msgid ""
"At the end of the employee's service, if they are eligible for end-of-"
"service benefits, they should receive the following two benefits:"
msgstr ""
"Al finalizar el servicio del empleado, si es elegible para los beneficios de "
"fin de servicio, debe recibir los siguientes dos beneficios:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:303
msgid ""
"**Unused leaves compensation**: The Annual Leave Balance is shown on the "
"employee's record. It is based on the annual leave type defined in the "
"**Payroll** app settings and is calculated as the total remaining "
"allocations for that specific leave type assigned to the employee."
msgstr ""
"**Compensación por vacaciones no utilizadas**: El saldo de vacaciones "
"anuales se muestra en el registro del empleado. Se basa en el tipo de "
"vacaciones anuales definido en la configuración de la aplicación **Nómina** "
"y se calcula como el total de asignaciones restantes para ese tipo "
"específico de vacaciones asignado al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:307
msgid ""
"The balance represents the total remaining leave allocated to the employee "
"but does not reflect the portion of leave days the employee has earned up to "
"the current month."
msgstr ""
"El saldo representa el total de vacaciones restantes asignadas al empleado, "
"pero no refleja la porción de días de vacaciones que el empleado ha ganado "
"hasta el mes actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:310
msgid ""
"When calculating the benefit value, the deserved leave balance is determined "
"based on the portion of the year worked. The benefit value is then "
"calculated by multiplying this deserved balance by the employee's daily rate."
msgstr ""
"Al calcular el valor del beneficio, el saldo de vacaciones merecidas se "
"determina según la porción del año trabajado. El valor del beneficio se "
"calcula multiplicando este saldo merecido por la tarifa diaria del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:315
msgid ""
"If an employee is entitled to 14 leave days per year and has worked for 6 "
"months, they deserve 7 leave days so far. If their daily rate is 50 JOD, the "
"benefit value is: 7 days × 50 JOD = 350 JOD"
msgstr ""
"Si un empleado tiene derecho a 14 días de vacaciones al año y ha trabajado "
"durante 6 meses, merece 7 días de vacaciones hasta el momento. Si su tarifa "
"diaria es de 50 JOD, el valor del beneficio es: 7 días × 50 JOD = 350 JOD"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:320
msgid ""
"The flow mentioned above requires the allocation for the annual leave to be "
"given fully upfront in the beginning of the year for that employee"
msgstr ""
"El flujo mencionado anteriormente requiere que la asignación de vacaciones "
"anuales se otorgue completamente por adelantado al inicio del año para ese "
"empleado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:323
msgid ""
"**End of Service Benefit**: The calculation begins by determining the total "
"number of days the employee has worked at the company, starting from their "
"joining date up to their last working day."
msgstr ""
"**Beneficio de fin de servicio**: El cálculo comienza determinando el número "
"total de días que el empleado ha trabajado en la empresa, desde su fecha de "
"ingreso hasta su último día laboral."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:326
msgid "The total service duration is calculated out of a 365-day year."
msgstr "La duración total del servicio se calcula sobre un año de 365 días."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:328
msgid ""
"The resulting period in years is then multiplied by the employee's gross "
"salary, which includes the basic salary and the allowances defined in the "
"payroll tab on the employee record."
msgstr ""
"El período resultante en años se multiplica por el salario bruto del "
"empleado, que incluye el salario básico y las asignaciones definidas en la "
"pestaña de nómina en el registro del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:331
msgid ""
"(\\text{Basic} + \\text{Allowances}) \\times \\left(\\frac{\\text{Number of "
"Days}}{365}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"(\\text{Básico} + \\text{Asignaciones}) \\times \\left(\\frac{\\text{Número "
"de Días}}{365}\\right)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:338
msgid ""
"Several sections within the **Payroll** app installs a Salary Structure, "
"Structure Type, Rules, and Parameters specific to Jordan."
msgstr ""
"Varias secciones dentro de la aplicación **Nómina** instalan una estructura "
"salarial, tipo de estructura, reglas y parámetros específicos para Jordania."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:344
msgid ""
"When the **l10n_jo_hr_payroll** module is :ref:`installed <payroll/"
"jordan_apps>`, a new :guilabel:`Salary Structure` gets "
"installed, :guilabel:`Jordan: Monthly Pay`. This structure includes "
"one :guilabel:`Structure Type`, :guilabel:`Jordan: Employee`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el módulo **l10n_jo_hr_payroll** se :ref:`instala <payroll/"
"jordan_apps>`, se instala una nueva :guilabel:`estructura "
"salarial`, :guilabel:`Jordania: pago mensual`. Esta estructura incluye "
"un :guilabel:`tipo de estructura`, :guilabel:`Jordania: empleado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:348
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Salary Structure` contains all the individual :ref:`salary "
"rules <payroll/jordan_apps>` that informs the **Payroll** app how to "
"calculate employee payslips."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`estructura salarial` contiene todas las :ref:`reglas "
"salariales <payroll/jordan_apps>` individuales que informan a la aplicación "
"**Nómina** cómo calcular las nóminas de los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:351
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:365
msgid "The United States salary structure in the salary structures list."
msgstr ""
"La estructura salarial de Estados Unidos en la lista de estructuras "
"salariales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:359
msgid ""
"To view the salary rules that inform the salary structure what to do, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structures` "
"and expand the :guilabel:`Jordan: Employee` entry to reveal "
"the :guilabel:`Jordan: Monthly Pay` structure type. Click :guilabel:`Jordan: "
"Monthly Pay` to view the detailed salary rules."
msgstr ""
"Para ver las reglas salariales que informan a la estructura salarial qué "
"hacer, ve a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> "
"Estructuras` y expande la entrada :guilabel:`Jordania: Empleado` para "
"revelar el tipo de estructura :guilabel:`Jordania: Pago Mensual`. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Jordania: Pago Mensual` para ver las reglas salariales "
"detalladas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:364
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:359
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:245
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:378
msgid "The top portion of the US salary rules."
msgstr "La parte superior de las reglas salariales de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:367
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:333
msgid ""
"Each rule defines how pay is calculated, taking into account factors such as "
"allowances, deductions, and taxes."
msgstr ""
"Cada regla define cómo se calcula el pago, teniendo en cuenta factores como "
"asignaciones, deducciones e impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:377
msgid ""
"The percentage rate for employee Social Security deductions is set in the "
"`Jordan Social Security Employee Deduction Rate %` parameter."
msgstr ""
"El porcentaje de tasa para las deducciones de Seguridad Social del empleado "
"se establece en el parámetro `Tasa de Deducción de Seguridad Social del "
"Empleado de Jordania %`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:389
msgid ""
"Odoo adds updated rule parameters for the current calendar year. It is "
"**not** recommended to edit rule parameters **unless a national parameter "
"has changed**, and is different from the rule parameters created by Odoo. "
"Check with all national regulations *before* making any changes to rule "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Odoo añade parámetros de reglas actualizados para el año calendario actual. "
"**No** se recomienda editar los parámetros de reglas **a menos que un "
"parámetro nacional haya cambiado** y sea diferente de los parámetros de "
"reglas creados por Odoo. Verifica todas las regulaciones nacionales *antes* "
"de realizar cualquier cambio en los parámetros de reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:395
msgid "Run Jordan payroll"
msgstr "Ejecutar nómina de Jordania"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:404
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:423
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:484
msgid ""
"Any :ref:`discrepencies or conflicts <payroll/conflicts>` must be resolved, "
"then the work entries can be :ref:`regenerated <payroll/regenerate-work-"
"entries>`."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier :ref:`discrepancia o conflicto <payroll/conflicts>` debe "
"resolverse, luego las entradas de trabajo pueden ser :ref:`regeneradas "
"<payroll/regenerate-work-entries>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:441
msgid ""
"The accounting process when running payroll has two "
"components: :ref:`creating journal entries <payroll/jo-journal>`, "
"and :ref:`registering payments <payroll/jo-register>`."
msgstr ""
"El proceso contable al ejecutar la nómina tiene dos componentes: :ref:`crear "
"asientos contables <payroll/jo-journal>` y :ref:`registrar pagos <payroll/jo-"
"register>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:459
msgid ""
"Thirteen accounts from the Jordan :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` are "
"included with the Jordan payroll localization:"
msgstr ""
"Trece cuentas del :abbr:`Plan de Cuentas (Chart of Accounts)` de Jordania "
"están incluidas con la localización de nómina de Jordania:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:462
msgid "`500301 Basic Salary`: Tracks the basic wages paid to employees."
msgstr ""
"`500301 Salario Básico`: Rastrea los salarios básicos pagados a los "
"empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:463
msgid ""
"`500302 Housing Allowance`: Captures housing allowance payments provided to "
"employees."
msgstr ""
"`500302 Asignación de Vivienda`: Captura los pagos de asignación de vivienda "
"proporcionados a los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:464
msgid ""
"`500303 Transportation Allowance`: Captures transportation allowance "
"payments to employees."
msgstr ""
"`500303 Asignación de Transporte`: Captura los pagos de asignación de "
"transporte a los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:465
msgid ""
"`500308 Staff Other Allowances`: Covers employee allowances that do not fit "
"any other available categories."
msgstr ""
"`500308 Otras Asignaciones del Personal`: Cubre las asignaciones de "
"empleados que no encajan en ninguna otra categoría disponible."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:467
msgid ""
"`500310 Salary Deductions`: Reflects deductions applied to employee salaries "
"(e.g., advances, fines, statutory deductions)."
msgstr ""
"`500310 Deducciones Salariales`: Refleja las deducciones aplicadas a los "
"salarios de los empleados (por ejemplo, anticipos, multas, deducciones "
"obligatorias)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:469
msgid ""
"`500305 Leave Salary`: Records salaries actually paid to employees while on "
"paid leave."
msgstr ""
"`500305 Salario por Licencia`: Registra los salarios efectivamente pagados a "
"los empleados mientras están en licencia remunerada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:470
msgid ""
"`201022 Social Security Payable`: Holds both employee and employer amounts "
"payable for social insurance contributions."
msgstr ""
"`201022 Seguridad Social por Pagar`: Contiene tanto los montos del empleado "
"como del empleador a pagar por contribuciones al seguro social."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:472
msgid ""
"`200502 Leave Days Provision`: Accrues the cost of paid leave; the balance "
"is reduced when leave is taken, and any leave not taken may be paid out when "
"the employee leaves the company."
msgstr ""
"`200502 Provisión por Días de Licencia`: Acumula el costo de la licencia "
"remunerada; el saldo se reduce cuando se toma la licencia, y cualquier "
"licencia no tomada puede pagarse cuando el empleado deja la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:474
msgid ""
"`200503 End of Service Provision`: Accumulates the end-of-service benefit "
"monthly, so the amount can be paid (partially or fully) when the employee "
"leaves, per service length and reason."
msgstr ""
"`200503 Provisión por Fin de Servicio`: Acumula mensualmente el beneficio de "
"fin de servicio, para que el monto pueda pagarse (parcial o totalmente) "
"cuando el empleado se vaya, según la duración del servicio y el motivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:476
msgid ""
"`200101 Payables`: Shows amounts payable to employees as salaries (unpaid "
"salary liability at period end)."
msgstr ""
"`200101 Cuentas por Pagar`: Muestra los montos a pagar a los empleados como "
"salarios (pasivo salarial no pagado al final del período)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:478
msgid ""
"`500202 End of Service Indemnity`: Captures company expenses set aside to "
"fund end-of-service benefits (expense-side counterpart to the provision)."
msgstr ""
"`500202 Indemnización por Fin de Servicio`: Captura los gastos de la empresa "
"reservados para financiar los beneficios de fin de servicio (contrapartida "
"del gasto a la provisión)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:480
msgid ""
"`200307 Employee Income Tax`: Accumulates the income tax amount withheld "
"from the employee's salary."
msgstr ""
"`200307 Impuesto sobre la Renta del Empleado`: Acumula el monto del impuesto "
"sobre la renta retenido del salario del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:482
msgid ""
"`500311 Social Security Expenses`: Captures The total expense amount from "
"payments to the social insurance authority."
msgstr ""
"`500311 Gastos de Seguridad Social`: Captura el monto total de gastos de los "
"pagos a la autoridad del seguro social."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:485
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` configuration is done by default when "
"installing the Jordan payroll localization. The account codes and names can "
"be edited to suit the company's needs."
msgstr ""
"La configuración del :abbr:`CoA (Plan de Cuentas)` se realiza por defecto al "
"instalar la localización de nómina de Jordania. Los códigos y nombres de las "
"cuentas pueden editarse para adaptarse a las necesidades de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:489
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:512
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:427
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:564
msgid ""
"If everything seems correct on the journal entry draft, post the journal "
"entries."
msgstr ""
"Si todo parece correcto en el borrador del asiento contable, publica los "
"asientos contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:499
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:574
msgid ""
"After the :ref:`journal entries <payroll/journal>` are validated, Odoo can "
"generate payments."
msgstr ""
"Después de que se validen los :ref:`asientos contables <payroll/journal>`, "
"Odoo puede generar pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:514
msgid ""
"No additional payroll reports unique to the Jordan payroll localization "
"exist. All reports are the standard preconfigured reports included with the "
"**Payroll** app."
msgstr ""
"No existen informes de nómina adicionales exclusivos de la localización de "
"nómina de Jordania. Todos los informes son los informes preconfigurados "
"estándar incluidos con la aplicación **Nómina**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:12
msgid ""
"The Kenya **Payroll** localization package enables payroll management that "
"complies with Kenyan statutory requirements."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de localización de **Nómina** de Kenia permite la gestión de la "
"nómina conforme a los requisitos legales de Kenia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:18
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get all the "
"features of the Kenya **Payroll** localization:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` los siguientes módulos para obtener todas "
"las características de la localización de **Nómina** de Kenia:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Kenya - Payroll`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kenia - Nómina`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:28
msgid "`l10n_ke_hr_payroll`"
msgstr "`l10n_ke_hr_payroll`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:29
msgid ""
"Payroll module includes all employee details, salary rules, allowances, "
"deductions, and leave management, for compliance with Kenyan laws."
msgstr ""
"El módulo de nómina incluye todos los detalles de los empleados, reglas "
"salariales, asignaciones, deducciones y gestión de permisos, para el "
"cumplimiento de las leyes de Kenia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Kenya - Payroll with Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kenia - Nómina con contabilidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:32
msgid "`l10n_ke_hr_payroll_account`"
msgstr "`l10n_ke_hr_payroll_account`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:34
msgid ":guilabel:`Documents - Kenyan Payroll`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Documentos - Nómina de Kenia`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:35
msgid "`documents_l10n_ke_hr_payroll`"
msgstr "`documents_l10n_ke_hr_payroll`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:36
msgid ""
"Employee Tax Deduction Card forms are automatically integrated to the "
"**Documents** app."
msgstr ""
"Los formularios de tarjeta de deducción fiscal de empleados se integran "
"automáticamente en la aplicación **Documentos**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:39
msgid ""
":doc:`Kenya fiscal localization documentation <../../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/kenya>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Documentación de localización fiscal de Kenia <../../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/kenya>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:42
msgid "Setting up employees"
msgstr "Configurar empleados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:44
msgid ""
"Some employee information is crucial in generating payslips and payroll "
"reports. Ensure the following fields in the various sections are configured "
"on each :doc:`employee record <../../employees/new_employee>`."
msgstr ""
"Cierta información del empleado es crucial para generar nóminas e informes "
"de nómina. Asegúrate de que los siguientes campos en las distintas secciones "
"estén configurados en cada :doc:`registro de empleado <../../employees/"
"new_employee>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:53
msgid ""
"Some personal employee information is required for payroll processing. Open "
"the *Personal* tab of the employee record, and ensure the following fields "
"are configured in the *Citizenship* section:"
msgstr ""
"Cierta información personal del empleado es necesaria para el procesamiento "
"de la nómina. Abre la pestaña *Personal* del registro del empleado y "
"asegúrate de que los siguientes campos estén configurados en la sección "
"*Ciudadanía*:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification No`: Enter the employee's government-issued "
"national identification number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de identificación`: introduce el número de identificación "
"nacional emitido por el gobierno del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`KRA PIN`: Enter the employee's 11-digit alphanumeric PIN. This is "
"used when generating payslip, P9, and P10 reports."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`KRA PIN`: introduce el PIN alfanumérico de 11 dígitos del "
"empleado. Se utiliza al generar informes de nómina, P9 y P10."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mortgage interest`: Populate the employee's mortgage interest "
"rate, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Interés hipotecario`: completa la tasa de interés hipotecario del "
"empleado, si corresponde."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`NSSF Number`: Enter the employee's 9 or 10 digit |NSSF| number. "
"This field is required for generating payslips and |NSSF| reports."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número NSSF`: introduce el número |NSSF| de 9 o 10 dígitos del "
"empleado. Este campo es obligatorio para generar nóminas e informes |NSSF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`SHIF Number`: Enter the employee's 7 or 8 digit |SHIF| number. "
"This field is required for generating |SHIF| reports."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número SHIF`: introduce el número |SHIF| de 7 u 8 dígitos del "
"empleado. Este campo es obligatorio para generar informes |SHIF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:66
msgid ""
"In the *Personal Information* section of the *Personal* tab, ensure the "
"employee's :guilabel:`Birthday` is configured."
msgstr ""
"En la sección *Información personal* de la pestaña *Personal*, asegúrate de "
"que la :guilabel:`Fecha de nacimiento` del empleado esté configurada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:69
msgid ""
"Additionally, if the employee has been legally declared a person with a "
"disability, check the :guilabel:`Disabled` box in the *Family* section. Odoo "
"automatically adjusts the |PAYE| computation in line with Kenyan tax "
"regulations."
msgstr ""
"Además, si el empleado ha sido declarado legalmente como persona con "
"discapacidad, marca la casilla :guilabel:`Discapacitado` en la sección "
"*Familia*. Odoo ajusta automáticamente el cálculo de |PAYE| en línea con las "
"regulaciones fiscales de Kenia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:76
msgid ""
"Different fields in the *Payroll* tab must be configured for :ref:`full-time "
"employees <payroll/l10n_ke/full-time>` and :ref:`secondary employers "
"<payroll/l10n_ke/secondary>`."
msgstr ""
"Diferentes campos en la pestaña *Nómina* deben configurarse "
"para :ref:`empleados de tiempo completo <payroll/l10n_ke/full-time>` "
"y :ref:`empleadores secundarios <payroll/l10n_ke/secondary>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:82
msgid "Full-time employees"
msgstr "Empleados de tiempo completo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:84
msgid ""
"In the *Payroll* tab of the employee form, create or update "
"the :doc:`employee contract <../contracts>` in the *Contract Overview* "
"section. Next, ensure the following sections and fields are configured:"
msgstr ""
"En la pestaña *Nómina* del formulario del empleado, crea o actualiza "
"el :doc:`contrato del empleado <../contracts>` en la sección *Resumen del "
"contrato*. A continuación, asegúrate de que las siguientes secciones y "
"campos estén configurados:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Must be set to :guilabel:`Kenya:Employee` to "
"access specific rules and computations as required by Kenyan laws."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de pago`: debe establecerse "
"en :guilabel:`Kenia:Empleado` para acceder a reglas y cálculos específicos "
"según lo requerido por las leyes de Kenia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pension Contribution`: Enter the employee's monthly pension "
"contribution."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución a pensión`: introduce la contribución mensual a "
"pensión del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:93
msgid ""
"The monthly tax-deductible cap for pension contributions is 30,000 Ksh per "
"month. To automate this deduction along with the |NSSF|, ensure the monthly "
"pension amount is entered in this field."
msgstr ""
"El límite mensual deducible de impuestos para contribuciones a pensión es de "
"30.000 Ksh al mes. Para automatizar esta deducción junto con el |NSSF|, "
"asegúrate de que el importe mensual de la pensión esté introducido en este "
"campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allowances`: Enter the various monthly allowances "
"for :guilabel:`Food`, :guilabel:`Airtime`, :guilabel:`Pension`, :guilabel:`Commuter`, "
"and :guilabel:`Housing` if provided. This information is automated to "
"calculate taxes based on the applicable benefit caps."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Asignaciones`: introduce las distintas asignaciones mensuales "
"para :guilabel:`Alimentos`, :guilabel:`Tiempo "
"aire`, :guilabel:`Pensión`, :guilabel:`Transporte` y :guilabel:`Vivienda` si "
"se proporcionan. Esta información se automatiza para calcular impuestos "
"según los límites de beneficios aplicables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:102
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Housing` allowance can be configured either as a set cost per "
"month (:guilabel:`/month`) or a percentage :guilabel:`(% Percentage)`."
msgstr ""
"La asignación de :guilabel:`Vivienda` puede configurarse como un coste fijo "
"por mes (:guilabel:`/mes`) o un porcentaje :guilabel:`(% Porcentaje)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Insurance`: Enter the monthly :guilabel:`Voluntary Medical "
"insurance`, :guilabel:`Life Insurance`, and :guilabel:`Education` insurance "
"costs for the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Seguro`: introduce los costes mensuales de :guilabel:`Seguro "
"médico voluntario`, :guilabel:`Seguro de vida` y seguro "
"de :guilabel:`Educación` para el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:111
msgid "Secondary employers"
msgstr "Empleadores secundarios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:113
msgid ""
"Click the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Secondary Contract` if the employee "
"has a primary contract with another employer. When checked, the *Insurance* "
"section is removed from the *Payroll* tab, as insurance is managed by the "
"primary employer."
msgstr ""
"Marca la casilla de verificación junto a :guilabel:`Contrato secundario` si "
"el empleado tiene un contrato principal con otro empleador. Cuando está "
"marcada, se elimina la sección *Seguro* de la pestaña *Nómina*, ya que el "
"seguro es gestionado por el empleador principal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:117
msgid ""
"Selecting this checkbox allows Odoo to automatically apply statutory "
"requirements in compliance with Kenyan regulations for secondary employment."
msgstr ""
"Marcar esta casilla permite a Odoo aplicar automáticamente los requisitos "
"legales en cumplimiento con las regulaciones kenianas para el empleo "
"secundario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:121
msgid "Run Kenyan payroll"
msgstr "Ejecutar nómina de Kenia"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:123
msgid ""
"Payslips are generated either :doc:`individually <../payslips>` or in a "
"group, referred to as :doc:`pay runs <../pay_runs>`."
msgstr ""
"Las nóminas se generan de forma :doc:`individual <../payslips>` o en grupo, "
"lo que se denomina :doc:`ejecuciones de nómina <../pay_runs>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:126
msgid ""
"The following sections are particularly important to consider when "
"processing payroll in Kenya."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes secciones son particularmente importantes a considerar al "
"procesar la nómina en Kenia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:129
msgid "Salary inputs"
msgstr "Datos salariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:131
msgid ""
"The *Salary Inputs* tab of a payslip includes additional benefits and "
"deductions that may vary per employee, such as :abbr:`HELB (Higher Education "
"Loans Board)` loan repayments, salary advances, fringe benefits, and other "
"salary attachments."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña *Datos salariales* de una nómina incluye beneficios adicionales y "
"deducciones que pueden variar por empleado, como los reembolsos de préstamos "
"del :abbr:`HELB (Junta de Préstamos para Educación Superior)`, anticipos "
"salariales, beneficios marginales y otros embargos salariales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:135
msgid ""
"Entries that occur consistently can be automated using :doc:`salary "
"attachments <../salary_attachments>`, and are automatically added as *salary "
"inputs*. Other inputs that are one-off items, such as a salary advance, can "
"be manually added as a salary input."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas que ocurren de forma consistente se pueden automatizar "
"mediante :doc:`embargos salariales <../salary_attachments>`, y se añaden "
"automáticamente como *datos salariales*. Otros datos que son elementos "
"únicos, como un anticipo salarial, se pueden añadir manualmente como dato "
"salarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:139
msgid ""
"To manually add a salary input, click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add "
"Inputs` button."
msgstr ""
"Para añadir manualmente un dato salarial, haz clic en el botón :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Añadir datos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:142
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:111
msgid "Salary computation tab"
msgstr "Pestaña de cálculo del salario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:144
msgid ""
"The *Salary Computation* tab contains the computations used to generate the "
"final figures displayed on the payslip, as well as the amounts posted to the "
"accounting journal entries."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña *Cálculo salarial* contiene los cálculos utilizados para generar "
"las cifras finales que se muestran en la nómina, así como los importes "
"registrados en los asientos contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:148
msgid ""
"No tax deductions are applied in the computation of income tax since they "
"are already factored in by the employee's primary employer."
msgstr ""
"No se aplican deducciones fiscales en el cálculo del impuesto sobre la "
"renta, ya que el empleador principal del empleado ya las tiene en cuenta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:154
msgid ""
"The reports in the following sections are available, including Kenya "
"specific reports. All reports can be downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Los informes en las siguientes secciones están disponibles, incluidos los "
"informes específicos de Kenia. Todos los informes se pueden descargar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:158
msgid ""
"A valid National ID number, |NSSF| number, and |NHIF|/|SHIF| number **must** "
"be configured in the *Personal* tab of the :ref:`employee's record "
"<employees/private-info>` to generate :ref:`NSSF <payroll/l10n_ke/nssf>` "
"and :ref:`SHIF/NHIF <payroll/l10n_ke/shif>` reports."
msgstr ""
"Un número de DNI válido, número |NSSF| y número |NHIF|/|SHIF| **deben** "
"estar configurados en la pestaña *Personal* del :ref:`registro del empleado "
"<employees/private-info>` para generar informes :ref:`NSSF <payroll/l10n_ke/"
"nssf>` y :ref:`SHIF/NHIF <payroll/l10n_ke/shif>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:163
msgid "Master payroll"
msgstr "Nómina maestra"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:165
msgid ""
"To generate a master payroll report by month, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --> Payslip Lines`. Next, click "
"into the search bar and click the :guilabel:`Date` drop-down menu, revealing "
"various months and quarters. Click the desired month, and the report "
"displays all payslips for that month."
msgstr ""
"Para generar un informe de nómina maestra por mes, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Informes --> Líneas de nómina`. A "
"continuación, haz clic en la barra de búsqueda y haz clic en el menú "
"desplegable :guilabel:`Fecha`, revelando varios meses y trimestres. Haz clic "
"en el mes deseado y el informe mostrará todas las nóminas de ese mes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:171
msgid "P9 report"
msgstr "Informe P9"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:173
msgid ""
"Employers in Kenya are required to provide each employee with a document "
"summarizing their total earnings, various deductions, and tax contributions "
"made that year, so that taxes can be properly calculated and paid."
msgstr ""
"Los empleadores en Kenia están obligados a proporcionar a cada empleado un "
"documento que resuma sus ingresos totales, diversas deducciones y "
"contribuciones fiscales realizadas ese año, para que los impuestos puedan "
"ser calculados y pagados correctamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:177
msgid ""
"The P9 report is what the company creates, which contains all the tax "
"information."
msgstr ""
"El informe P9 es lo que crea la empresa, que contiene toda la información "
"fiscal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:179
msgid ""
"Each individual employee receives a *tax deduction card*, which contains all "
"their various earnings."
msgstr ""
"Cada empleado individual recibe una *tarjeta de deducción fiscal*, que "
"contiene todos sus diversos ingresos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:181
msgid "The various *tax deduction cards* together make up the P9 report."
msgstr ""
"Las diversas *tarjetas de deducción fiscal* en conjunto conforman el informe "
"P9."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:184
msgid ""
"All payslips for the desired year must have a status of :guilabel:`Done` to "
"generate the P9 report."
msgstr ""
"Todos los recibos de nómina del año deseado deben tener un "
"estado :guilabel:`Hecho` para generar el informe P9."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:187
msgid ""
"To generate the P9 report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> P9 Report`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a *Tax "
"Deduction card* form loads, and an :icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`Eligible "
"Employees` smart button appears at the top, displaying `0` (zero)."
msgstr ""
"Para generar el informe P9, navega a :menuselection:`Nómina --> Informes --> "
"Informe P9`. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo`, se cargará un "
"formulario de *Tarjeta de deducción de impuestos* y aparecerá un botón "
"inteligente :icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`Empleados elegibles` en la parte "
"superior, mostrando `0` (cero)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:191
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select the :guilabel:`Year` in the corresponding "
"field. Update the :guilabel:`Description`, if needed, then "
"click :guilabel:`Populate`. The :icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`Eligible "
"Employees` smart button updates with the number of employees included in the "
"report for that year."
msgstr ""
"Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona el :guilabel:`Año` en el campo "
"correspondiente. Actualiza la :guilabel:`Descripción`, si es necesario, y "
"luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Rellenar`. El botón inteligente :icon:`fa-"
"users` :guilabel:`Empleados elegibles` se actualiza con el número de "
"empleados incluidos en el informe para ese año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:196
msgid ""
"To view the employees and generate the individual cards, click the :icon:`fa-"
"users` :guilabel:`Eligible Employees` smart button, and a list of all "
"employees appears. Select all the employees by clicking the checkbox next "
"to :guilabel:`Employee` at the top, then click the :guilabel:`Generate "
"Reports (#)` button."
msgstr ""
"Para ver los empleados y generar las tarjetas individuales, haz clic en el "
"botón inteligente :icon:`fa-users` :guilabel:`Empleados elegibles`, y "
"aparecerá una lista de todos los empleados. Selecciona todos los empleados "
"haciendo clic en la casilla junto a :guilabel:`Empleado` en la parte "
"superior, y luego haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Generar informes (#)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:201
msgid ""
"Once the reports are processed, each corresponding report appears in "
"the :guilabel:`PDF File` column of the employee list. All successfully "
"generated reports have a :guilabel:`State` of :guilabel:`Generated PDF`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que se procesan los informes, cada informe correspondiente aparece "
"en la columna :guilabel:`Archivo PDF` de la lista de empleados. Todos los "
"informes generados con éxito tienen un :guilabel:`Estado` de :guilabel:`PDF "
"generado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:205
msgid ""
"Next, select where the document is stored using the drop-down menu in "
"the :guilabel:`Document` column. Once a destination is selected, "
"the :guilabel:`State` of the PDF changes to :guilabel:`Posted PDF`."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, selecciona dónde se almacena el documento usando el menú "
"desplegable en la columna :guilabel:`Documento`. Una vez que se selecciona "
"un destino, el :guilabel:`Estado` del PDF cambia a :guilabel:`PDF publicado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:209
msgid ""
"To download and view any of the PDF files, click on the file link, and "
"select where to save the file."
msgstr ""
"Para descargar y ver cualquiera de los archivos PDF, haz clic en el enlace "
"del archivo y selecciona dónde guardar el archivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:215
msgid "SHIF (NHIF) report"
msgstr "Informe SHIF (NHIF)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:217
msgid ""
"A |SHIF| report is required by Kenya's |SHA| and details each employee's "
"contributions and benefits."
msgstr ""
"Un informe |SHIF| es requerido por |SHA| de Kenia y detalla las "
"contribuciones y beneficios de cada empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:220
msgid "In 2025, Kenya switched from the |NHIF| to the |SHIF|."
msgstr "En 2025, Kenia cambió de |NHIF| a |SHIF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:222
msgid ""
"To create the |SHIF| report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Reporting --> SHIF (NHIF) report`, and a *SHIF (NHIF) Report* pop-up window "
"loads. Only two fields must be configured: the :guilabel:`Month` "
"and :guilabel:`Year` fields. The current month and year populate the "
"corresponding dates by default, but can be modified using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Para crear el informe |SHIF|, navega a :menuselection:`Nómina --> Informes --"
"> Informe SHIF (NHIF)`, y se cargará una ventana emergente de *Informe SHIF "
"(NHIF)*. Solo deben configurarse dos campos: los campos :guilabel:`Mes` "
"y :guilabel:`Año`. El mes y año actuales rellenan las fechas "
"correspondientes por defecto, pero pueden modificarse usando el menú "
"desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:227
msgid ""
"All relevant payslips for the selected time period appear in the window in a "
"list view. Each entry displays the :guilabel:`Payslip "
"Name`, :guilabel:`Employee`, :guilabel:`Identification No`, :guilabel:`SHIF "
"Number`, and :guilabel:`SHIF Amount`."
msgstr ""
"Todos los recibos de nómina relevantes para el período seleccionado aparecen "
"en la ventana en vista de lista. Cada entrada muestra el :guilabel:`Nombre "
"del recibo`, :guilabel:`Empleado`, :guilabel:`Número de "
"identificación`, :guilabel:`Número SHIF` e :guilabel:`Importe SHIF`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:231
msgid ""
"Any individual payslip can be removed from the report by clicking "
"the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Delete)` icon at the end of the row."
msgstr ""
"Cualquier recibo individual puede eliminarse del informe haciendo clic en el "
"icono :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(Eliminar)` al final de la fila."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:234
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Export XLSX` button, and the report is generated."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Exportar XLSX`, y se generará el informe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:237
msgid ""
"All payslips for the selected month must have a status of :guilabel:`Done` "
"to generate the SHIF report."
msgstr ""
"Todos los recibos de nómina del mes seleccionado deben tener un "
"estado :guilabel:`Hecho` para generar el informe SHIF."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:241
msgid ""
"|SHIF| excel reports can be uploaded directly to |SHIF| (|NHIF|) portals."
msgstr ""
"Los informes de |SHIF| en Excel pueden cargarse directamente en los portales "
"de |SHIF| (|NHIF|)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:244
msgid ""
"|SHIF| reports are not applicable to employees under a secondary employer "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"Los informes |SHIF| no son aplicables a empleados bajo un contrato de "
"empleador secundario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:249
msgid "NSSF report"
msgstr "Informe NSSF"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:251
msgid ""
"An |NSSF| report logs all the necessary information regarding employee "
"payments and contributions to the |NSSF|."
msgstr ""
"Un informe |NSSF| registra toda la información necesaria sobre pagos de "
"empleados y contribuciones al |NSSF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:255
msgid ""
"Tier 11 |NSSF| and voluntary pension can be remitted to either |NSSF| or a "
"third party insurance, and must be defined on the employee's contract."
msgstr ""
"El nivel 11 de |NSSF| y la pensión voluntaria pueden remitirse a |NSSF| o a "
"un seguro de terceros, y deben definirse en el contrato del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:258
msgid ""
"On the employee contract, in the :guilabel:`Pension Remit To` field, select "
"either :guilabel:`NSSF` or :guilabel:`Insurance`."
msgstr ""
"En el contrato del empleado, en el campo :guilabel:`Pension Remit To`, "
"selecciona :guilabel:`NSSF` o :guilabel:`Insurance`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:261
msgid ""
"To access this report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting "
"--> NSSF Report`, and an *NSSF Report* pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder a este informe, ve a :menuselection:`Nómina --> Informes --> "
"NSSF Report`, y se carga una ventana emergente *NSSF Report*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:264
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Month` and :guilabel:`Year` fields are automatically "
"populated with the current month and year. If needed, these dates can be "
"modified."
msgstr ""
"Los campos :guilabel:`Month` y :guilabel:`Year` se completan automáticamente "
"con el mes y año actuales. Si es necesario, estas fechas se pueden modificar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:267
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically populates the various fields for employees with generated "
"entries for the selected time period."
msgstr ""
"Odoo completa automáticamente los diversos campos para los empleados con "
"entradas generadas para el período de tiempo seleccionado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:270
msgid ""
"To generate |NSSF| reports for an employee, the employee **must** have the "
"following fields configured in the *Citizenship* section of "
"the :ref:`Personal <payroll/l10n_ke/personal>` tab of their employee record:"
msgstr ""
"Para generar informes |NSSF| para un empleado, el empleado **debe** tener "
"los siguientes campos configurados en la sección *Citizenship* de la "
"pestaña :ref:`Personal <payroll/l10n_ke/personal>` de su ficha de empleado:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:274
msgid ":guilabel:`Identification No`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Identification No`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:275
msgid ":guilabel:`NSSF Number`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NSSF Number`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:276
msgid ":guilabel:`NHIF Number` or :guilabel:`SHIF Number`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`NHIF Number` o :guilabel:`SHIF Number`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:278
msgid ""
"To generate the report, click the :guilabel:`Export XLSX` button, select the "
"location to save the file, then click :guilabel:`Save`. The report is "
"exported, and stored in the selected location."
msgstr ""
"Para generar el informe, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Export XLSX`, "
"selecciona la ubicación para guardar el archivo y luego haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Save`. El informe se exporta y se almacena en la ubicación "
"seleccionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:282
msgid ""
"All payslips for the selected month must have a status of :guilabel:`Done` "
"to generate the |NSSF| report."
msgstr ""
"Todas las nóminas del mes seleccionado deben tener un "
"estado :guilabel:`Done` para generar el informe |NSSF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:286
msgid ""
"|NSSF| reports are not applicable to employees under a secondary employer "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"Los informes |NSSF| no son aplicables a empleados con un contrato de "
"empleador secundario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/kenya.rst:289
msgid "|NSSF| excel reports can be uploaded directly to |NSSF| portals."
msgstr ""
"Los informes de Excel |NSSF| se pueden cargar directamente en los portales |"
"NSSF|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico.rst:11
