#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:104
msgid ":guilabel:`Account Number`: Enter a valid |IBAN|."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Número de cuenta`: introduce un |IBAN| válido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short name`: Enter a 3 to 4 character alphabetic code uniquely "
"identifying the bank, used as a shorthand instead of the full bank name "
"(e.g., *NBO* for National Bank of Oman, or *HSBC* for HSBC Middle East)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre corto`: introduce un código alfabético de 3 o 4 caracteres "
"que identifique de forma única al banco, utilizado como abreviatura en lugar "
"del nombre completo del banco (por ejemplo, *NBO* para National Bank of Oman "
"o *HSBC* para HSBC Middle East)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/oman.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`BIC/SWIFT`: Enter an 8 or 11-character alphanumeric code, **not** "
