#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:87
msgid ""
"Select the correct :guilabel:`Nationality (Country)` for the employee, using "
"the drop-down menu. The selected nationality determines the GOSI rate."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la :guilabel:`Nacionalidad (País)` correcta para el empleado "
"usando el menú desplegable. La nacionalidad seleccionada determina la tasa "
"GOSI."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:93
msgid ""
"The employee's *bank account* is their :abbr:`IBAN (International Bank "
"Account Number)`, which is how employees receive their salary according "
"to :abbr:`WPS (Wages Protection System)` regulations."
msgstr ""
"La *cuenta bancaria* del empleado es su :abbr:`IBAN (Número Internacional de "
"Cuenta Bancaria)`, que es la forma en que los empleados reciben su salario "
"según las regulaciones del :abbr:`WPS (Sistema de Protección de Salarios)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:96
msgid ""
"Payroll **cannot** be processed for employees without a *trusted* :ref:`bank "
"account <employees/private-contact>`. If no trusted bank account is set, a "
"warning appears on the **Payroll** dashboard and an error occurs when "
"attempting to run payroll."
msgstr ""
"La nómina **no puede** procesarse para empleados sin una :ref:`cuenta "
"bancaria <employees/private-contact>` *de confianza*. Si no se establece "
"ninguna cuenta bancaria de confianza, aparece una advertencia en el tablero "
"de **Nómina** y se produce un error al intentar ejecutar la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract`: The Validity of the compensation conditions can be "
"updated depending on the needs."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contrato`: la validez de las condiciones de compensación puede "
"actualizarse según las necesidades."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select :abbr:`KSA (Kingdom of Saudi "
"Arabia)` :guilabel:`Employee` for this field. This defines when the employee "
"is paid, their default working schedule, and the work entry type it applies "
"to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de pago`: Selecciona :abbr:`KSA (Reino de Arabia "
"Saudita)` :guilabel:`Empleado` para este campo. Esto define cuándo se le "
"paga al empleado, su horario de trabajo predeterminado y el tipo de entrada "
"de trabajo al que se aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:156
msgid "Saudi payroll information section"
msgstr "Sección de información de nómina saudí"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:158
msgid ""
"Enter the employee's unique 10-digit :guilabel:`Saudi National / IQAMA ID` "
"number in this field. This number is issued to Saudi citizens by "
"the :guilabel:`Ministerial Agency of Civil Affairs`, and is used for "
"exporting WPS reports."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el número único de 10 dígitos del :guilabel:`ID Nacional Saudí / "
"IQAMA` del empleado en este campo. Este número es emitido a los ciudadanos "
"saudíes por la :guilabel:`Agencia Ministerial de Asuntos Civiles` y se "
"utiliza para exportar informes WPS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:162
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Annual Leave Balance` field is not editable, and displays the "
"employee's available annual vacation days."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Saldo de vacaciones anuales` no es editable y muestra "
"los días de vacaciones anuales disponibles del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:168
msgid ""
"This section determines the various benefits the employee receives. Enter "
"the monthly Saudi riyal amount the employee receives from the company "
"for :guilabel:`Housing`, :guilabel:`Transportation`, and :guilabel:`Other` "
"costs."
msgstr ""
"Esta sección determina los diversos beneficios que recibe el empleado. "
"Introduce el importe mensual en riales saudíes que el empleado recibe de la "
"empresa para costes de :guilabel:`Vivienda`, :guilabel:`Transporte` "
"y :guilabel:`Otros`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:172
msgid ""
"Enter the annual amount paid by the company for a Saudi :guilabel:`Iqama` "
"(`iqama` is the Arabic word for `residence permit`). An :guilabel:`Iqama` is "
"an official residency and identification card, similar to a visa, and it "
"is . It is required for **all** foreign nationals to have a "
"valid :guilabel:`Iqama` to work, live, and access various services in Saudi "
"Arabia."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el importe anual pagado por la empresa por una :guilabel:`Iqama` "
"saudí (`iqama` es la palabra árabe para `permiso de residencia`). "
"Una :guilabel:`Iqama` es una tarjeta oficial de residencia e identificación, "
"similar a una visa. Es obligatorio que **todos** los extranjeros tengan "
"una :guilabel:`Iqama` válida para trabajar, vivir y acceder a diversos "
"servicios en Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:177
msgid ""
"Enter the annual amount the employer pays for the "
"employee's :guilabel:`Medical Insurance` in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el importe anual que el empleador paga por el :guilabel:`Seguro "
"médico` del empleado en el campo correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:180
msgid ""
"If the employee needs a :guilabel:`Work Permit`, enter the annual fees the "
"company pays."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado necesita un :guilabel:`Permiso de trabajo`, introduce las "
"tasas anuales que paga la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:183
msgid "End of service provision section"
msgstr "Sección de provisión de fin de servicio"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:185
msgid ""
"In Saudi Arabia, each employee earns a percentage of their annual salary for "
"each year they have worked with a company. This amount is computed based on "
"their salary. When they leave the company, they receive this compensation in "
"one lump sum."
msgstr ""
"En Arabia Saudita, cada empleado gana un porcentaje de su salario anual por "
"cada año que ha trabajado en una empresa. Este importe se calcula en función "
"de su salario. Cuando deja la empresa, recibe esta compensación en un único "
"pago global."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:189
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Number of Days` the employee earns in annual "
"compensation, in the corresponding field. The company sets this amount aside "
"every year, so it is available when the employee leaves."
msgstr ""
"Introduce el :guilabel:`Número de días` que el empleado gana en compensación "
"anual en el campo correspondiente. La empresa reserva este importe cada año "
"para que esté disponible cuando el empleado se marche."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:195
msgid ""
"Several sections within the **Payroll** app installs a Salary Structure, "
"Structure Type, Rules, and Parameters specific to Saudi Arabia. "
"Additionally, some other configurations are required to run Saudi Arabia "
"payroll."
msgstr ""
"Varias secciones dentro de la aplicación **Nómina** instalan una estructura "
"salarial, tipo de estructura, reglas y parámetros específicos de Arabia "
"Saudita. Además, se requieren algunas otras configuraciones para ejecutar la "
"nómina de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:204
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll --> Configuration --> Settings` to "
"access the **Payroll** app settings required for Saudi Arabia."
msgstr ""
"Ve a :menuselection:`Nómina --> Configuración --> Ajustes` para acceder a "
"los ajustes de la aplicación **Nómina** requeridos para Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:207
msgid ""
"First, the company bank account must be configured to pay employees, per WPS "
"regulations. Click into the drop-down space beneath "
"the :guilabel:`Establishment Bank Account` field, and "
"click :guilabel:`Create...`. This opens a :guilabel:`Create Establishment's "
"Bank Account` pop-up window. :ref:`Configure the company's bank account  "
"<employees/private-contact>`, and ensure it is marked as *trusted*. "
"Click :guilabel:`Save` to save the information and close the window."
msgstr ""
"Primero, debe configurarse la cuenta bancaria de la empresa para pagar a los "
"empleados según las regulaciones WPS. Haz clic en el espacio desplegable "
"debajo del campo :guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria del establecimiento` y haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Crear...`. Esto abre una ventana emergente :guilabel:`Crear "
"cuenta bancaria del establecimiento`. :ref:`Configura la cuenta bancaria de "
"la empresa  <employees/private-contact>` y asegúrate de que esté marcada "
"como *de confianza*. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar` para guardar la "
"información y cerrar la ventana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:213
msgid ""
"Next, enter the company's :guilabel:`MoL Establishment ID`. This ID number "
"is provided by Saudi Arabia's Ministry of Labor."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, introduce el :guilabel:`ID de establecimiento del MoL` de la "
"empresa. Este número de identificación lo proporciona el Ministerio de "
"Trabajo de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:216
msgid ""
"Finally, select the :doc:`time off type <../../time_off/time_off_types>` "
"that is used to calculate Finally, select the :doc:`time off type <../../"
"time_off/time_off_types>` that is used to calculate the :guilabel:`Annual "
"Leave Balance` set in the :ref:`employee's profile <payroll/"
"saudi_payroll_info>`."
msgstr ""
"Por último, selecciona el :doc:`tipo de ausencia <../../time_off/"
"time_off_types>` que se utiliza para calcular Por último, selecciona el "
":doc:`tipo de ausencia <../../time_off/time_off_types>` que se utiliza para "
"calcular el :guilabel:`Saldo de vacaciones anuales` establecido en el "
":ref:`perfil del empleado <payroll/saudi_payroll_info>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:224
msgid ""
"When the **l10n_sa_hr_payroll** module is :ref:`installed <payroll/"
"saudi_apps>`, a new :guilabel:`Salary Structure` gets "
"installed, :guilabel:`KSA Employee`. This structure includes "
"two :guilabel:`Structure Types`, :guilabel:`Saudi Arabia: Monthly Pay`, "
"and :guilabel:`SA Salary Advance And Loan Structure`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el módulo **l10n_sa_hr_payroll** está :ref:`instalado <payroll/"
"saudi_apps>`, se instala una nueva :guilabel:`Estructura "
"salarial`, :guilabel:`Empleado KSA`. Esta estructura incluye "
"dos :guilabel:`Tipos de estructura`, :guilabel:`Arabia Saudita: Pago "
"mensual` y :guilabel:`Estructura de adelanto salarial y préstamo SA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:229
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:362
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Salary Structure` contains all the individual :ref:`salary "
"rules <payroll/usa_apps>` that informs the **Payroll** app how to calculate "
"employee payslips."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`Estructura Salarial` contiene todas las :ref:`reglas "
"salariales <payroll/usa_apps>` individuales que informan a la aplicación "
"**Nómina** cómo calcular las nóminas de los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:232
msgid "The Saudi Arabia salary structure in the salary structures list."
msgstr ""
"La estructura salarial de Arabia Saudita en la lista de estructuras "
"salariales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:240
msgid ""
"To view the salary rules that inform the salary structure what to do, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structures` "
"and expand the :guilabel:`KSA Employee` group to reveal the two available "
"structure types. Click :guilabel:`Saudi Arabia: Monthly Pay` to view the "
"detailed salary rules for that structure type."
msgstr ""
"Para ver las reglas salariales que informan a la estructura salarial qué "
"hacer, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> "
"Estructuras` y expande el grupo :guilabel:`Empleado KSA` para mostrar los "
"dos tipos de estructura disponibles. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Arabia Saudita: "
"Pago mensual` para ver las reglas salariales detalladas para ese tipo de "
"estructura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:248
msgid ""
"Each rule defines how pay is calculated, taking into account factors such as "
"allowances, deductions, and company contributions."
msgstr ""
"Cada regla define cómo se calcula el salario, teniendo en cuenta factores "
"como asignaciones, deducciones y contribuciones de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:265
msgid "The Saudi Arabia payroll localization comes with four rule parameters:"
msgstr ""
"La localización de nómina de Arabia Saudita incluye cuatro parámetros de "
"regla:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Saudi GOSI Company Contribution`: This rule parameter determines "
"the calculation of the GOSI contributions the employer must make for Saudi "
"Arabia employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución de la empresa al GOSI saudí`: Este parámetro de "
"regla determina el cálculo de las contribuciones al GOSI que el empleador "
"debe realizar para los empleados de Arabia Saudita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:269
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-Saudi GOSI Company Contribution`: This rule parameter "
"determines the calculation of the GOSI contributions the employer must make "
"for each non-Saudi Arabian employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución de la empresa al GOSI no saudí`: Este parámetro de "
"regla determina el cálculo de las contribuciones al GOSI que el empleador "
"debe realizar para cada empleado no saudí."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:271
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Saudi GOSI Employee Contribution`: This rule parameter determines "
"the calculation of the GOSI contributions the employee must make, and is "
"deducted from their pay."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribución del empleado al GOSI saudí`: Este parámetro de regla "
"determina el cálculo de las contribuciones al GOSI que el empleado debe "
"realizar, y se deduce de su salario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:273
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Saudi Arabia Overtime Rate`:  This rule parameter determines the "
"overtime rate for employees."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tasa de horas extras de Arabia Saudita`: Este parámetro de regla "
"determina la tasa de horas extras para los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:277
msgid ""
"Odoo adds updated rule parameters for the current calendar year. It is "
"**not** recommended to edit rule parameters **unless a national or "
"provincial parameter has changed**, and is different from the rule "
"parameters created by Odoo. Check with all local and national regulations "
"*before* making any changes to rule parameters."
msgstr ""
"Odoo añade parámetros de regla actualizados para el año calendario actual. "
"**No** se recomienda editar los parámetros de regla **a menos que un "
"parámetro nacional o provincial haya cambiado** y sea diferente de los "
"parámetros de regla creados por Odoo. Consulta todas las regulaciones "
"locales y nacionales *antes* de realizar cualquier cambio en los parámetros "
"de regla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:285
msgid "Run Saudi Arabia payroll"
msgstr "Ejecutar nómina de Arabia Saudita"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:309
msgid ""
"The process of running payroll includes different actions that need to be "
"executed to ensure that the amount that the employee receives as their net "
"salary is correct, any deductions or allocations are correct, and the "
"computation of hours worked reflects the employee's actual hours worked, "
"among others."
msgstr ""
"El proceso de ejecutar la nómina incluye diferentes acciones que deben "
"realizarse para garantizar que el monto que el empleado recibe como salario "
"neto sea correcto, que las deducciones o asignaciones sean correctas y que "
"el cálculo de las horas trabajadas refleje las horas reales trabajadas del "
"empleado, entre otros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:321
msgid ""
"Next, check the various totals (gross pay, allowances, contributions, etc.), "
"then click :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` to update the salary calculations, if "
"there were edits. If everything is correct, click :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, verifica los diferentes totales (salario bruto, "
"asignaciones, contribuciones, etc.), luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Calcular "
"hoja` para actualizar los cálculos salariales si hubo ediciones. Si todo es "
"correcto, haz clic en :guilabel:`Validar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:329
msgid "Annual leave provision calculation"
msgstr "Cálculo de la provisión para vacaciones anuales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:331
msgid ""
"Annual leave provisions are used for calculating the annual leave provision "
"accumulated each month. It does not affect the total amount paid to the "
"employee, it is for internal use by the company."
msgstr ""
"Las provisiones para vacaciones anuales se utilizan para calcular la "
"provisión para vacaciones anuales acumulada cada mes. No afecta al importe "
"total pagado al empleado; es para uso interno de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:334
msgid ""
"It is calculated by dividing the employee's monthly salary (Monthly Salary = "
"Wage + Allowances) by 30 to get the daily salary."
msgstr ""
"Se calcula dividiendo el salario mensual del empleado (salario mensual = "
"sueldo + complementos) entre 30 para obtener el salario diario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:337
msgid "The monthly provision is then calculated as:"
msgstr "A continuación, la provisión mensual se calcula de la siguiente manera:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:339
msgid ""
"\\text{Monthly Provision} = \\left(\\text{Daily Salary} \\times "
"\\text{Eligible Leave Days}\\right) \\div 12"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Provisión mensual} = \\left(\\text{Salario diario} \\times \\text"
"{Días de vacaciones correspondientes}\\right) \\div 12"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:344
msgid ""
"When the employee takes a leave, the payout for that leave is taken from the "
"already provisioned amount and a payout line is automatically calculated and "
"added in the payslip lines."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el empleado disfruta de una ausencia, el pago correspondiente se "
"descuenta del importe ya aprovisionado y se calcula y añade automáticamente "
"una línea de pago en las líneas de la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:348
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:329
msgid "Employer other costs"
msgstr "Otros costes del empleador"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:350
msgid ""
"Other than the employee's salary, there are additional employer costs that "
"need to be accounted for. These include medical insurance, work permits, and "
"employee's Iqama."
msgstr ""
"Aparte del salario del empleado, existen costes adicionales del empleador "
"que deben contabilizarse. Entre ellos se incluyen el seguro médico, los "
"permisos de trabajo y el iqama del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:353
msgid ""
"These costs are defined as yearly values on the employee's record under the "
"*Payroll* tab, and are recognized on a monthly basis as other employer "
"expenses. They are computed on the employee's payslip, but do not affect the "
"net payable to the employee and do not appear on the payslip PDF shared with "
"the employee."
msgstr ""
"Estos costes se definen como importes anuales en el registro del empleado, "
"en la pestaña *Nómina*, y se reconocen mensualmente como otros gastos del "
"empleador. Se calculan en la nómina del empleado, pero no afectan al neto a "
"pagar al empleado ni aparecen en el PDF de la nómina que se comparte con él."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:359
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:352
msgid "Employee net cost"
msgstr "Coste neto del empleado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:361
msgid ""
"To allow payroll officers to track the total employee cost beyond the "
"employee's net salary, the employee's net cost is computed automatically "
"upon each generated payslip and includes both direct and indirect costs. "
"Direct costs represent the employee's payable amount, while indirect costs "
"include other employer costs, as well as contributions such as |GOSI|."
msgstr ""
"Para que los responsables de nóminas puedan realizar el seguimiento del "
"coste total del empleado más allá de su salario neto, el coste neto del "
"empleado se calcula automáticamente en cada nómina generada e incluye tanto "
"los costes directos como los indirectos. Los costes directos representan el "
"importe a pagar al empleado, mientras que los indirectos incluyen otros "
"costes del empleador, así como aportaciones como |GOSI|."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:366
msgid ""
"Although these amounts are calculated and available in the system for "
"internal reporting and analysis, they do not appear on the payslip PDF "
"generated for the employee."
msgstr ""
"Aunque estos importes se calculan y están disponibles en el sistema para "
"informes y análisis internos, no aparecen en el PDF de la nómina que se "
"genera para el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:370
msgid ""
"If an employee has a net payable salary of 10,500 SAR and the following "
"indirect costs:"
msgstr ""
"Si un empleado tiene un salario neto a pagar de 10 500 SAR y los siguientes "
"costes indirectos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:372
msgid "Medical insurance of 20,000 SAR a year (1,666.67 SAR a month)."
msgstr "Seguro médico de 20 000 SAR al año (1666,67 SAR al mes)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:373
msgid "GOSI company contribution of 1,057.5 SAR."
msgstr "Aportación de la empresa a la GOSI de 1057,5 SAR."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:375
msgid "The net cost is: 10,500 + 1,666.67 + 1,057.5  =  13,224.17 SAR"
msgstr "El coste neto es: 10 500 + 1666,67 + 1057,5 = 13 224,17 SAR"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:380
msgid ""
"The accounting process when running payroll has two "
"components: :ref:`creating journal entries <payroll/journal_saudi>`, "
"and :ref:`registering payments <payroll/register_saudi>`."
msgstr ""
"El proceso contable al ejecutar la nómina tiene dos componentes: :ref:`crear "
"asientos contables <payroll/journal_saudi>` y :ref:`registrar pagos <payroll/"
"register_saudi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:398
msgid ""
"Fifteen accounts from the Saudi Arabia :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` are "
"included with the payroll localization:"
msgstr ""
"Quince cuentas del :abbr:`plan contable` de Arabia Saudita están incluidas "
"con la localización de nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:401
msgid "`400003 Basic Salary`: Tracks the basic wages paid to employees."
msgstr ""
"`400003 Salario básico`: Rastrea los salarios básicos pagados a los "
"empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:402
msgid ""
"`400004 Housing Allowance`: Captures housing allowance payments provided to "
"employees."
msgstr ""
"`400004 Asignación de vivienda`: Captura los pagos de asignación de vivienda "
"proporcionados a los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:403
msgid ""
"`400005 Transportation Allowance`: Captures transportation allowance "
"payments to employees."
msgstr ""
"`400005 Asignación de transporte`: Captura los pagos de asignación de "
"transporte a los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:404
msgid ""
"`400012 Staff Other Allowances`: Covers employee allowances that do not fit "
"standard categories."
msgstr ""
"`400012 Otras asignaciones del personal`: Cubre las asignaciones de "
"empleados que no encajan en categorías estándar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:405
msgid ""
"`106012 Prepaid Employee Expenses`: Logged as prepaid assets for employer-"
"paid items that are *not* wages (for example, `Iqama` fees and medical "
"insurance) and expensed as consumed."
msgstr ""
"`106012 Gastos prepagados de empleados`: Registrados como activos prepagados "
"para conceptos pagados por el empleador que *no* son salarios (por ejemplo, "
"tasas de `Iqama` y seguro médico) y se reconocen como gasto cuando se "
"consumen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:407
msgid ""
"`201006 Leave Days Provision`: Accrues the cost of paid leave; the balance "
"is reduced when leave is taken, and any leave not taken may be paid out at "
"end of service."
msgstr ""
"`201006 Provisión de días de vacaciones`: Acumula el costo de las vacaciones "
"pagadas; el saldo se reduce cuando se toman las vacaciones, y cualquier "
"vacación no tomada puede pagarse al final del servicio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:409
msgid ""
"`201022 GOSI Employee Payable`: Holds amounts payable for social insurance "
"contributions to the GOSI, including both employee and employer portions."
msgstr ""
"`201022 GOSI empleado por pagar`: Mantiene los montos por pagar por las "
"contribuciones al seguro social al GOSI, incluyendo las porciones del "
"empleado y del empleador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:411
msgid ""
"`202001 End of Service Provision`: Accumulates the end-of-service benefit "
"monthly so the amount can be paid (partially or fully) when the employee "
"leaves, per service length and reason."
msgstr ""
"`202001 Fin de la provisión de servicios`: Acumula mensualmente la "
"prestación por fin de servicio para que el importe pueda pagarse (parcial o "
"totalmente) cuando el empleado se vaya, según la duración del servicio y el "
"motivo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:413
msgid ""
"`400007 Leave Salary`: Records salaries actually paid to employees while on "
"paid leave."
msgstr ""
"`400007 Salario de licencia`: Registra los salarios efectivamente pagados a "
"los empleados durante las licencias pagadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:414
msgid ""
"`400008 End of Service Indemnity`: Captures company expenses set aside to "
"fund end-of-service benefits (expense-side counterpart to the provision)."
msgstr ""
"`400008 Indemnización por fin de servicio`: Captura los gastos de la empresa "
"reservados para financiar las prestaciones por fin de servicio (contraparte "
"del gasto a la provisión)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:416
msgid ""
"`400009 Medical Insurance`: Accounts for employer expenses related to "
"employee medical insurance premiums."
msgstr ""
"`400009 Seguro médico`: Contabiliza los gastos del empleador relacionados "
"con las primas del seguro médico de los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:418
msgid ""
"`400010 Life Insurance`: Tracks employer expenses for life/occupational "
"insurance or the employer's portion of social insurance."
msgstr ""
"`400010 Seguro de vida`: Rastrea los gastos del empleador por el seguro de "
"vida/ocupacional o la parte del empleador del seguro social."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:420
msgid ""
"`400014 Visa Expenses`: Used to track employer costs for non-Saudi Arabian "
"employees' visas and related processing/renewal fees."
msgstr ""
"`400014 Gastos de visa`: Se utiliza para rastrear los costos del empleador "
"por las visas de los empleados no saudíes y las tarifas de procesamiento/"
"renovación relacionadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:422
msgid ""
"`400074 Salary Deductions`: Reflects deductions applied to employee salaries "
"(e.g., advances, fines, statutory deductions)."
msgstr ""
"`400074 Deducciones salariales`: Refleja las deducciones aplicadas a los "
"salarios de los empleados (p. ej., anticipos, multas, deducciones legales)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:424
msgid ""
"`201002 Payables`: Shows amounts payable to employees as salaries (unpaid "
"salary liability at period end)."
msgstr ""
"`201002 Cuentas por pagar`: Muestra los importes a pagar a los empleados "
"como salarios (pasivo salarial no pagado al final del período)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:437
msgid ""
"After the :ref:`journal entries <payroll/journal_saudi>` are validated, Odoo "
"can generate payments."
msgstr ""
"Después de que los :ref:`asientos contables <payroll/journal_saudi>` sean "
"validados, Odoo puede generar los pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:440
msgid ""
"To generate payments from payslips,employees **must** have a *trusted* bank "
"account. If the employee's bank account is *not* marked as `trusted`, WPS "
"files **cannot** be generated through Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Para generar pagos desde las nóminas, los empleados **deben** tener una "
"cuenta bancaria *de confianza*. Si la cuenta bancaria del empleado *no* está "
"marcada como `de confianza`, los archivos WPS **no** pueden generarse a "
"través de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:450
msgid "Close payroll"
msgstr "Cerrar nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:455
msgid "Sick leaves"
msgstr "Bajas médicas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:457
msgid ""
"Sick leave rules define how the employee's payslip is affected when the "
"employee takes sick leave."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas de baja médica definen cómo se ve afectada la nómina del empleado "
"cuando este disfruta de una baja médica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:459
msgid "There are three sick leave cases:"
msgstr "Existen tres casos de baja médica:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:461
msgid ""
"Fully paid sick leave: Employees are entitled to 30 days per calendar year."
msgstr ""
"Baja médica totalmente remunerada: los empleados tienen derecho a 30 días "
"por año natural."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:462
msgid ""
"75% paid sick leave: Employees are entitled to 60 additional days after the "
"first 30 fully paid sick leave days."
msgstr ""
"Baja médica remunerada al 75 %: los empleados tienen derecho a 60 días "
"adicionales tras los primeros 30 días de baja médica totalmente remunerada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:464
msgid ""
"Unpaid sick leave: Any sick leave beyond the first 90 days is considered "
"unpaid."
msgstr ""
"Baja médica no remunerada: cualquier baja médica que supere los primeros 90 "
"días se considera no remunerada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:467
msgid ""
"The sick leave entitlement limits mentioned above are calculated within a "
"one-year period. This period starts from the date of the employee's first "
"sick leave, and any subsequent sick leave taken during that period is "
"counted toward the employee's entitlement."
msgstr ""
"Los límites de derecho a baja médica mencionados anteriormente se calculan "
"dentro de un período de un año. Este período comienza a partir de la fecha "
"de la primera baja médica del empleado, y cualquier baja médica posterior "
"que se tome durante ese período computa para su derecho."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:471
msgid ""
"The sick leave compensation is calculated using the following formula, where "
"the gross monthly salary is the employee's basic salary plus all allowances "
"defined on the employee's contract:"
msgstr ""
"La indemnización por baja médica se calcula mediante la siguiente fórmula, "
"donde el salario bruto mensual es el salario base del empleado más todos los "
"complementos definidos en su contrato:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:474
msgid ""
"\\text{Sick Leave Amount} = \\left(\\frac{\\text{Gross Monthly Salary}}"
"{30}\\right) \\times \\text{Number of Sick Leave Days} \\times "
"\\text{Percentage}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Importe de la baja médica} = \\left(\\frac{\\text{Salario bruto "
"mensual}}{30}\\right) \\times \\text{Número de días de baja médica} \\times "
"\\text{Porcentaje}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:480
msgid ""
"There is a single sick leave time off type, *Sick Time Off*. The system "
"automatically tracks the total number of sick leave days taken by the "
"employee and applies the corresponding percentage based on the accumulated "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Existe un único tipo de ausencia por baja médica: *Baja por enfermedad*. El "
"sistema registra automáticamente el número total de días de baja médica "
"disfrutados por el empleado y aplica el porcentaje correspondiente según el "
"saldo acumulado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:485
msgid "End of employee collaboration"
msgstr "Fin de la relación laboral del empleado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:487
msgid ""
"At the end of an employee's service with the company, they may be entitled "
"to an *End of Service Benefit* (EOS) depending on:"
msgstr ""
"Al término de la relación laboral de un empleado con la empresa, este puede "
"tener derecho a una *prestación por fin de servicio* (EOS) en función de:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:490
msgid "The duration of their service."
msgstr "El tiempo de servicio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:491
msgid "The reason for the termination of the employment relationship."
msgstr "El motivo de la finalización de la relación laboral."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:493
msgid ""
"The reason for the termination can fall under one of the following "
"categories:"
msgstr ""
"El motivo de la finalización puede pertenecer a una de las siguientes "
"categorías:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:496
msgid "End of contract / retirement"
msgstr "Fin de contrato / jubilación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:498
msgid ""
"If the employee's service duration is between one and five years, the "
"employee is entitled to half of their latest monthly salary for each year of "
"service."
msgstr ""
"Si el tiempo de servicio del empleado es de entre uno y cinco años, tiene "
"derecho a la mitad de su último salario mensual por cada año de servicio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:501
msgid ""
"For each year beyond the fifth year, the employee is entitled to one full "
"monthly salary per year."
msgstr ""
"Por cada año transcurrido tras el quinto año, el empleado tiene derecho a un "
"salario mensual completo por año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:504
msgid "Resignation"
msgstr "Dimisión"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:506
msgid ""
"If the employee resigns after completing between two and five years of "
"service, they are entitled to one third of the |EOS| amount that would "
"normally be granted in the case of an *End of Contract*."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado dimite tras haber completado entre dos y cinco años de "
"servicio, tiene derecho a un tercio del importe de |EOS| que normalmente se "
"concedería en caso de *Fin de contrato*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:510
msgid ""
"If an employee worked for three years and resigned, the |EOS| is first "
"computed as if the termination reason was *End of Contract*, then the "
"employee receives one third of that amount."
msgstr ""
"Si un empleado trabaja durante tres años y dimite, primero se calcula el "
"|EOS| como si el motivo de rescisión fuera *Fin de contrato* y, a "
"continuación, el empleado recibe un tercio de dicho importe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:514
msgid "Fired"
msgstr "Enviado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:516
msgid ""
"If the employee is dismissed, they are not entitled to an |EOS| regardless "
"of their service duration."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado es despedido, no tiene derecho a |EOS| independientemente de "
"la duración de su servicio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:520
msgid "Termination Without a valid legal reason"
msgstr "Rescisión sin motivo legal justificado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:522
msgid ""
"As defined under Article 77 of the Saudi Labor Law, if the employment "
"contract does not define a compensation amount for unlawful termination by "
"either party, the affected party is entitled to compensation as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Tal como se define en el artículo 77 de la legislación laboral saudí, si el "
"contrato de trabajo no define un importe de indemnización por rescisión "
"improcedente por cualquiera de las partes, la parte afectada tiene derecho a "
"una indemnización de la siguiente manera:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:526
msgid ""
"For indefinite-term contracts, the compensation is equal to half of the "
"employee's monthly salary for each year of service."
msgstr ""
"Para contratos indefinidos, la indemnización equivale a la mitad del salario "
"mensual del empleado por cada año de servicio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:528
msgid ""
"For fixed-term contracts, the compensation is equal to the employee's wage "
"for the remaining contract duration."
msgstr ""
"Para contratos de duración determinada, la indemnización equivale al salario "
"del empleado correspondiente al periodo restante del contrato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:531
msgid ""
"In addition to the |EOS|, the employee is also entitled to receive "
"compensation for any unused annual leave balance."
msgstr ""
"Además de |EOS|, el empleado también tiene derecho a recibir una "
"compensación por cualquier saldo pendiente de vacaciones anuales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:534
msgid ""
"The unused leave compensation is computed by multiplying the employees daily "
"wage by the number of remaining unused days from the *Annual Leave* time off "
"type."
msgstr ""
"La compensación por vacaciones no disfrutadas se calcula multiplicando el "
"salario diario del empleado por el número de días pendientes no disfrutados "
"del tipo de permiso *Vacaciones anuales*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:537
msgid ""
"An |EOS| provision must also be recognized to account for the future "
"liability payable to the employee at the end of their service with the "
"company. Unlike the |EOS| benefit itself, the provision is accrued "
"progressively and is included in the employee's payslips from the start of "
"their contract."
msgstr ""
"También debe reconocerse una provisión para |EOS| para contabilizar el "
"pasivo futuro que se pagará al empleado al finalizar su servicio en la "
"empresa. A diferencia de la propia prestación de |EOS|, la provisión se "
"acumula progresivamente y se incluye en las nóminas del empleado desde el "
"inicio de su contrato."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:542
msgid ""
"Similar to the |EOS| benefit, the provision is calculated differently "
"depending on the employee's length of service:"
msgstr ""
"De manera similar a la prestación de |EOS|, la provisión se calcula de forma "
"diferente según la antigüedad del empleado:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:545
msgid ""
"For employees with less than 5 years of service: (Monthly wage / 12) × 0.5"
msgstr ""
"Para empleados con menos de 5 años de servicio: (Salario mensual / 12) × 0,5"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:546
msgid "For employees with more than 5 years of service: (Monthly wage / 12)"
msgstr "Para empleados con más de 5 años de servicio: (Salario mensual / 12)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:548
msgid ""
"The provision is always computed using the scenario that results in the "
"highest expected expense, which is when the reason is `End of Contract`."
msgstr ""
"La provisión se calcula siempre con el escenario que suponga el mayor gasto "
"previsto, es decir, cuando el motivo sea `Fin de contrato`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:551
msgid ""
"In cases where the actual termination reason results in a lower entitlement, "
"an adjustment line is automatically added on the payslip lines to account "
"for the difference between the provisioned amount and the actual amount due."
msgstr ""
"En los casos en que el motivo real de rescisión suponga un derecho menor, se "
"añade automáticamente una línea de ajuste en la nómina para compensar la "
"diferencia entre el importe dotado y el importe real devengado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:556
msgid "Advanced leave pay"
msgstr "Anticipo de vacaciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:558
msgid ""
"Employees can request an advance payment of their salary when going on paid "
"leave, especially when the leave spans multiple months."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados pueden solicitar un anticipo de su salario al disfrutar de un "
"permiso retribuido, sobre todo si las vacaciones abarcan varios meses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:561
msgid ""
"The advance payslip includes the employee's salary for the days worked in "
"the current month, and the salary for the leave period. When the leave "
"extends beyond the current month, the system automatically calculates the "
"additional days needed to be compensated and adds them as extra inputs on "
"the payslip."
msgstr ""
"La nómina de anticipo incluye el salario del empleado correspondiente a los "
"días trabajados en el mes en curso y el salario del periodo de ausencia. "
"Cuando la ausencia se extiende más allá del mes en curso, el sistema calcula "
"automáticamente los días adicionales que deben compensarse y los añade como "
"entradas adicionales en la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:566
msgid ""
"In the following month, any amount already paid in advance is automatically "
"deducted from the employee's salary through a salary input line to avoid "
"double payment."
msgstr ""
"En el mes siguiente, cualquier importe pagado por adelantado se descuenta "
"automáticamente del salario del empleado a través de una línea de entrada "
"salarial para evitar pagos dobles."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:569
msgid ""
"To generate an advance leave payslip, go to the approved employee's time off "
"request for the time off type `Annual Leave`, then click :guilabel:`Create "
"Advance Leave Pay`."
msgstr ""
"Para generar una nómina de anticipo de vacaciones, ve a la solicitud de "
"tiempo personal aprobada del empleado para el tipo de tiempo personal "
"`Vacaciones anuales` y, a continuación, haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear pago de "
"anticipo de vacaciones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:573
msgid "Employee loans and advances"
msgstr "Préstamos y anticipos de empleados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:575
msgid ""
"Employees are able to request :ref:`loans <payroll/loans>` or :ref:`advances "
"<payroll/advances>` against their salaries. *Loans* are handled by creating "
"salary adjustments, whereas *advances* are created and managed manually."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados pueden solicitar :ref:`préstamos <payroll/loans>` "
"o :ref:`anticipos <payroll/advances>` contra sus salarios. Los *préstamos* "
"se gestionan creando ajustes salariales, mientras que los *anticipos* se "
"crean y gestionan manualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:582
msgid "Employee loans"
msgstr "Préstamos de empleados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:584
msgid ""
"Employees can take out *loans* against their salary and repay the loan with "
"automatic deductions from future paychecks. These loans are handled "
"by :ref:`creating a salary adjustment <payroll/salary_adjust_saudi>` to log "
"the total loan amount and set up a repayment plan, and :ref:`creating a "
"payslip for the total loan amount <payroll/loan_payslip_saudi>`. The "
"employee then :ref:`repays the loan <payroll/repay_saudi>` in the increments "
"configured in the salary adjustment."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados pueden solicitar *préstamos* contra su salario y devolver el "
"préstamo con deducciones automáticas de los futuros cheques de pago. Estos "
"préstamos se gestionan :ref:`creando un ajuste salarial <payroll/"
"salary_adjust_saudi>` para registrar el importe total del préstamo y "
"configurar un plan de reembolso, y :ref:`creando una nómina por el importe "
"total del préstamo <payroll/loan_payslip_saudi>`. El empleado "
"luego :ref:`devuelve el préstamo <payroll/repay_saudi>` en los incrementos "
"configurados en el ajuste salarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:593
msgid "Create a salary adjustment"
msgstr "Crear un ajuste salarial"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:595
msgid ""
"When an employee requests a loan, first a *salary adjustment* is made, where "
"the total loan amount and repayment plan is configured."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un empleado solicita un préstamo, primero se realiza un *ajuste "
"salarial*, donde se configura el importe total del préstamo y el plan de "
"reembolso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:598
msgid ""
"To create the loan and repayment schedule, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Employees --> Salary Adjustments`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New`, and a blank :guilabel:`Salary Adjustment` form loads."
msgstr ""
"Para crear el préstamo y el calendario de reembolso, navega "
"a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Empleados --> Ajustes salariales`. "
"Haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`, y se carga un formulario de :guilabel:`Ajuste "
"salarial` en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:603
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employees`: Using the drop-down menu, select the employee taking "
"out the loan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empleados`: Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona el empleado "
"que solicita el préstamo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:604
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Using the drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Loan "
"Deduction`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo`: Usando el menú desplegable, "
"selecciona :guilabel:`Deducción de préstamo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:605
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payslip Amount`: Enter the :abbr:`SAR (Saudi riyal)` amount to be "
"repaid each payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Monto de nómina`: Introduce el monto en :abbr:`SAR (rial saudí)` "
"a reembolsar en cada nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:606
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: Tick the :guilabel:`Limited` option, which reveals "
"a :guilabel:`until` (amount) :guilabel:`paid` field. First, using the "
"calendar selector, enter the date the repayment begins. Next, enter the "
"total loan amount in the field after :guilabel:`until`. Once both fields are "
"configured, Odoo calculates when the loan is fully repaid, and displays the "
"date as follows: `end in # years: (date)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duración`: Marca la opción :guilabel:`Limitado`, que muestra un "
"campo :guilabel:`hasta` (monto) :guilabel:`pagado`. Primero, usando el "
"selector de calendario, introduce la fecha en que comienza el reembolso. "
"Luego, introduce el monto total del préstamo en el campo después "
"de :guilabel:`hasta`. Una vez configurados ambos campos, Odoo calcula cuándo "
"se reembolsa completamente el préstamo y muestra la fecha de la siguiente "
"manera: `termina en # años: (fecha)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:611
msgid ":guilabel:`Note`: Enter any details about the loan in this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nota`: Introduce los detalles sobre el préstamo en este campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:613
msgid "A salary adjustment form filled out for an employee loan."
msgstr "Formulario de ajuste salarial completado para un préstamo de empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:619
msgid "Generate a loan payslip"
msgstr "Generar nómina de préstamo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:621
msgid ""
"After creating the salary adjustment, a button labeled :guilabel:`Create "
"Loan Payslip` appears above the form. Click :guilabel:`Create Loan Payslip`, "
"and Odoo automatically generates a payslip configured for the employee loan, "
"in the amount set up in the :ref:`salary adjustment <payroll/"
"salary_adjust_saudi>`."
msgstr ""
"Después de crear el ajuste salarial, aparece un botón "
"etiquetado :guilabel:`Crear nómina de préstamo` sobre el formulario. Haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Crear nómina de préstamo` y Odoo genera automáticamente "
"una nómina configurada para el préstamo del empleado, por el monto "
"establecido en el :ref:`ajuste salarial <payroll/salary_adjust_saudi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:626
msgid ""
"Review the payslip to ensure all the fields and tabs are correct. "
"The :guilabel:`Structure` should be :guilabel:`SA Salary Advance And Loan "
"Structure`. The :guilabel:`Salary Inputs` tab should list a :guilabel:`Loan "
"Deduction`, and the :guilabel:`Total` should be the full amount of the loan."
msgstr ""
"Revisa la nómina para asegurarte de que todos los campos y pestañas sean "
"correctos. La :guilabel:`Estructura` debe ser :guilabel:`Estructura de "
"anticipos y préstamos salariales SA`. La pestaña :guilabel:`Entradas "
"salariales` debe listar una :guilabel:`Deducción de préstamo` y "
"el :guilabel:`Total` debe ser el monto completo del préstamo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:630
msgid ""
"Click into the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, and enter the date the employee "
"receives the payment in the :guilabel:`Payment Date` field."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en la pestaña :guilabel:`Otra información` e introduce la fecha en "
"que el empleado recibe el pago en el campo :guilabel:`Fecha de pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:633
msgid ""
"Once the payslip form is correct, click :guilabel:`Compute Sheet`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Create Draft Entry`, and click :guilabel:`OK` in the "
"confirmation pop-up window. Next, click :guilabel:`Pay` to mark the payment "
"as paid, then click :guilabel:`Create Payment Report` to :ref:`generate the "
"WPS report <payroll/reports_saudi>`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el formulario de nómina sea correcto, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Calcular hoja`, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear asiento "
"borrador` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Aceptar` en la ventana emergente de "
"confirmación. A continuación, haz clic en :guilabel:`Pagar` para marcar el "
"pago como pagado, luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear informe de pago` "
"para :ref:`generar el informe WPS <payroll/reports_saudi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:638
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:696
msgid "A configured loan payslip."
msgstr "Nómina de préstamo configurada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:644
msgid "Loan repayment to employer"
msgstr "Reembolso de préstamo al empleador"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:646
msgid ""
"From the date set on the :ref:`salary attachment <payroll/"
"salary_adjust_saudi>`, all future paychecks have the configured repayment "
"amount taken out, to go towards the loan. Once the loan is fully paid, the "
"deductions end."
msgstr ""
"Desde la fecha establecida en el :ref:`ajuste salarial <payroll/"
"salary_adjust_saudi>`, todos los cheques de pago futuros tienen el monto de "
"reembolso configurado deducido para destinarse al préstamo. Una vez que el "
"préstamo está completamente pagado, las deducciones terminan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:651
msgid ""
"The deductions should end after the total is repaid, according to the salary "
"adjustment. To ensure payments *stop* being taken out of the employee's "
"paychecks after the loan has been repaid, open the salary adjustment record. "
"If the salary adjustment still has a status of :guilabel:`Running`, click "
"the :guilabel:`Mark as Completed` button, and the status changes "
"to :guilabel:`Closed`, and payments stop."
msgstr ""
"Las deducciones deben terminar después de que se reembolse el total, según "
"el ajuste salarial. Para asegurar que los pagos *dejen* de tomarse de los "
"cheques de pago del empleado después de que se haya reembolsado el préstamo, "
"abre el registro de ajuste salarial. Si el ajuste salarial aún tiene un "
"estado de :guilabel:`En curso`, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Marcar como "
"completado` y el estado cambia a :guilabel:`Cerrado` y los pagos se detienen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:660
msgid "Salary advances"
msgstr "Anticipos salariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:662
msgid ""
"Employees can request an advance of their salary, outside of the regular pay "
"cycle. This process is done by paying the employee with a :ref:`manually "
"created payslip <payroll/advance_slip>`, then the employee repays the "
"advance either :ref:`in full <payroll/repay_full>` in the next payslip, or "
"in :ref:`multiple payments <payroll/repay_partial>` in subsequent paychecks "
"until the total is repaid."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados pueden solicitar un anticipo de su salario fuera del ciclo "
"regular de pago. Este proceso se realiza pagando al empleado con "
"una :ref:`nómina creada manualmente <payroll/advance_slip>`, luego el "
"empleado reembolsa el anticipo :ref:`en su totalidad <payroll/repay_full>` "
"en la siguiente nómina, o en :ref:`múltiples pagos <payroll/repay_partial>` "
"en cheques de pago posteriores hasta que se reembolse el total."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:670
msgid "Create advance payslip"
msgstr "Crear nómina de anticipo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:672
msgid ""
"To issue an advanced payment, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Payslips --> Payslips`. Click the :guilabel:`New Off-Cycle` button and a "
"blank :guilabel:`Employee Payslips` form loads."
msgstr ""
"Para emitir un pago anticipado, ve a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> "
"Nóminas --> Nóminas`. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo fuera de ciclo` "
"y se carga un formulario en blanco de :guilabel:`Nóminas de empleado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:675
msgid "Configure the following fields on the payslip:"
msgstr "Configura los siguientes campos en la nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:677
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employees`: Using the drop-down menu, select the employee taking "
"out the advance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empleados`: Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona el empleado "
"que solicita el anticipo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:680
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Employee` is selected, the :guilabel:`Employee Record` "
"field populates with the most recent employee version (contract)."
msgstr ""
"Una vez seleccionado el :guilabel:`Empleado`, el campo :guilabel:`Registro "
"de empleado` se completa con la versión de empleado más reciente (contrato)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:683
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Structure`: Using the drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`SA Salary "
"Advance And Loan Structure`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estructura`: Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona :guilabel:`SA "
"Salary Advance And Loan Structure`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:685
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Period`: Set the start and end date for the payslip in the two "
"corresponding fields using the calendar selectors."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Periodo`: define las fechas de inicio y fin de la nómina en los "
"dos campos correspondientes mediante los selectores de calendario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:688
msgid ""
"Next, click into the *Salary Inputs* tab, and in the *Inputs* section, enter "
"the amount being advanced in the :guilabel:`Salary Advance` field."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, entra en la pestaña *Entradas salariales* y, en la sección "
"*Entradas*, introduce el importe que se va a anticipar en el campo "
":guilabel:`Anticipo de salario`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:691
msgid ""
"Once the payslip is configured, click :guilabel:`Compute Sheet`, then "
"click :guilabel:`Create Draft Entry`, and click :guilabel:`OK` in the "
"confirmation pop-up window. Click :guilabel:`Pay` to mark the payment as "
"paid, then click :guilabel:`Create Payment Report` to :ref:`generate the WPS "
"report <payroll/reports_saudi>`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez configurada la nómina, haz clic en :guilabel:`Calcular hoja`, luego "
"en :guilabel:`Crear asiento en borrador` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Aceptar` "
"en la ventana emergente de confirmación. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Pagar` para "
"marcar el pago como pagado y, a continuación, haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear "
"informe de pago` para :ref:`generar el informe WPS <payroll/reports_saudi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:702
msgid "Automatic repayment in full"
msgstr "Reembolso automático completo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:704
msgid ""
"When the employee's next payslip is generated (using the `Saudi Arabia: "
"Monthly Pay` structure), a line is added under the `Other Inputs` tab, "
"titled `Advanced Recovery`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se genera la siguiente nómina del empleado (usando la estructura "
"`Saudi Arabia: Monthly Pay`), se añade una línea bajo la pestaña `Other "
"Inputs`, titulada `Advanced Recovery`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:707
msgid ""
"The amount is based on the advance previously taken by the employee. If the "
"employee cannot repay the full amount in the paycheck, the repayment can be "
"broken up into :ref:`multiple payments <payroll/repay_partial>`."
msgstr ""
"El importe se basa en el anticipo previamente tomado por el empleado. Si el "
"empleado no puede reembolsar el importe completo en el cheque de pago, el "
"reembolso puede dividirse en :ref:`múltiples pagos <payroll/repay_partial>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:714
msgid "Multiple payments"
msgstr "Múltiples pagos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:716
msgid ""
"When an employee cannot repay an advance in full in a future payslip, the "
"employee can make partial payments until the advance is repaid. To do this, "
"the amount being deducted from the employee's paycheck must be manually "
"modified."
msgstr ""
"Cuando un empleado no puede reembolsar un anticipo en su totalidad en una "
"futura nómina, el empleado puede realizar pagos parciales hasta que el "
"anticipo sea reembolsado. Para hacer esto, el importe que se deduce del "
"cheque de pago del empleado debe ser modificado manualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:720
msgid ""
"Open the employee's payslip, and under the :guilabel:`Salary Inputs` tab, "
"modify the amount specified on the :guilabel:`Advanced Recovery` line."
msgstr ""
"Abre la nómina del empleado, y bajo la pestaña :guilabel:`Entradas de "
"salario`, modifica el importe especificado en la línea :guilabel:`Advanced "
"Recovery`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:723
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically calculates the remainder of the advance, and adds "
"an :guilabel:`Advanced Recovery` line for the balance in the subsequent "
"payslip. If the employee cannot pay the second payment in full, "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced Recovery` line can be edited in the following "
"payslip."
msgstr ""
"Odoo calcula automáticamente el resto del anticipo y añade una "
"línea :guilabel:`Advanced Recovery` para el saldo en la nómina subsiguiente. "
"Si el empleado no puede pagar el segundo pago en su totalidad, la "
"línea :guilabel:`Advanced Recovery` puede ser editada en la siguiente nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:728
msgid "Late attendance tracking"
msgstr "Seguimiento de retrasos en la asistencia"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:730
msgid ""
"Monitoring late arrivals is an essential aspect of attendance tracking and "
"workforce discipline. Within the attendance module, this can be handled by "
"setting up the work schedules and check-in times for each day of the week. "
"When employees check in after their expected start time, the record will be "
"flagged for the HR responsible for approval, and once approved, it will take "
"effect in the employee's next salary."
msgstr ""
"El seguimiento de las llegadas tarde es un aspecto esencial del control de "
"asistencia y de la disciplina del personal. Dentro del módulo de asistencia, "
"esto se puede gestionar configurando los horarios de trabajo y las horas de "
"entrada para cada día de la semana. Cuando los empleados registren la "
"entrada después de su hora de inicio prevista, el registro se marcará para "
"la aprobación del responsable de RR. HH. y, una vez aprobado, se aplicará en "
"el siguiente salario del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:736
msgid ""
"Once the module **Saudi Arabia Payroll - Attendance** is installed, the HR "
"manager needs to set the grace period from the payroll settings. This grace "
"period defines the amount of time an employee is allowed to be late without "
"triggering the late attendance rules."
msgstr ""
"Una vez instalado el módulo **Nómina de Arabia Saudí - Asistencias**, el "
"responsable de RR. HH. debe configurar el periodo de cortesía desde los "
"ajustes de nómina. Este periodo de cortesía define la cantidad de tiempo que "
"un empleado puede llegar tarde sin activar las reglas de retraso en la "
"asistencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:740
msgid ""
"If the grace period is not set or is exceeded, the system tracks how many "
"minutes the employee was late, and the HR manager's approval will be "
"required to confirm the lateness."
msgstr ""
"Si no se define el periodo de cortesía o se supera, el sistema registra "
"cuántos minutos ha llegado tarde el empleado y se necesitará la aprobación "
"del responsable de RR. HH. para confirmar el retraso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:743
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, on the next payslip, the number of late hours is reflected "
"on the payslip under the *Salary Inputs* tab, and a deduction is applied to "
"the employee according to the following formula:"
msgstr ""
"Una vez confirmado, en la siguiente nómina se reflejará el número de horas "
"de retraso en la pestaña *Entradas salariales* y se aplicará una deducción "
"al empleado según la siguiente fórmula:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:746
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\text{Basic Wage} \\div 30}{\\text{Number of hours per day}} "
"\\times\\text{Number of late hours}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\frac{\\text{Salario base} \\div 30}{\\text{Número de horas al día}} \\t"
"imes\\text{Número de horas de retraso}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:750
msgid ""
"If the employee is late for more than the grace period duration, then the "
"grace period duration itself will be considered as a part of the late time."
msgstr ""
"Si el empleado llega tarde más tiempo del que dura el periodo de cortesía, "
"la duración del propio periodo de cortesía también se considerará parte del "
"tiempo de retraso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:754
msgid "GOSI Integration"
msgstr "Integración con GOSI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:756
msgid ""
"The General Organization for Social Insurance (GOSI) is the government "
"entity in Saudi Arabia responsible for implementing the Social Insurance "
"Law, collecting contributions from employers, and providing insurance "
"coverage and benefits to eligible contributors and their families."
msgstr ""
"La Organización General del Seguro Social (GOSI) es la entidad gubernamental "
"de Arabia Saudí responsable de aplicar la Ley de Seguro Social, recaudar las "
"cotizaciones de los empleadores y proporcionar cobertura de seguro y "
"prestaciones a los cotizantes elegibles y a sus familias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:760
msgid ""
"The insurance system is composed of three main branches: the Annuities "
"Branch, the Occupational Hazards Branch, and the Unemployment Insurance "
"(SANED) Branch."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de seguros se compone de tres ramas principales: la rama de "
"anualidades, la rama de riesgos laborales y la rama del seguro de desempleo "
"(SANED)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:763
msgid ""
"The integration with |GOSI| enables the automatic retrieval of contribution "
"percentages for all three branches for both employees and employers. These "
"percentages are then used to compute social insurance contributions in "
"employees' payslips, ensuring accurate and compliant payroll calculations."
msgstr ""
"La integración con |GOSI| permite recuperar automáticamente los porcentajes "
"de cotización de las tres ramas, tanto para los empleados como para los "
"empleadores. A continuación, estos porcentajes se utilizan para calcular las "
"cotizaciones a la seguridad social en las nóminas de los empleados, lo que "
"garantiza cálculos de nómina precisos y conformes a la normativa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:768
msgid ""
"To set up the integration, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Under the *GOSI Integration* section, configure "
"the following fields according to the information obtained from the |GOSI| "
"portal:"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar la integración, ve a :menuselection:`Nómina --> "
"Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la sección *Integración con GOSI*, configura "
"los siguientes campos según la información obtenida del portal de |GOSI|:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:772
msgid "Registration Number"
msgstr "Número de colegiado médico"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:773
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "Clave API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:774
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "ID de cliente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:775
msgid "Client Secret"
msgstr "Client Secret"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:776
msgid "DPoP Key"
msgstr "Clave DPoP"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:777
msgid "API Mode"
msgstr "Modo API"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:780
msgid ""
"The DPoP must strictly follow the exact format provided by |GOSI|. Any "
"missing space or character will result in an error. After all details are "
"filled in and saved, the :guilabel:`Test Connection` button becomes "
"available. Clicking it validates the provided credentials. Once the "
"integration is successful, ensure that the employee's Iqama number is "
"correctly set on the employee profile under the *Payroll* tab. When properly "
"configured, the contribution percentages are retrieved for each insurance "
"branch. On the employee payslip, two salary rules are used to calculate the "
"total contributions for both the employee and the employer across all three "
"insurance branches."
msgstr ""
"El DPoP debe seguir estrictamente el formato exacto proporcionado por "
"|GOSI|. Cualquier espacio o carácter que falte provocará un error. Una vez "
"completados y guardados todos los datos, estará disponible el botón "
":guilabel:`Probar conexión`. Al hacer clic en él se validan las credenciales "
"proporcionadas. Una vez que la integración se haya completado con éxito, "
"asegúrate de que el número Iqama del empleado esté configurado correctamente "
"en el perfil del empleado, en la pestaña *Nómina*. Cuando esté bien "
"configurado, se obtendrán los porcentajes de cotización para cada rama de "
"seguro. En la nómina del empleado, se utilizan dos reglas salariales para "
"calcular las cotizaciones totales, tanto del empleado como del empleador, en "
"las tres ramas de seguro."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:790
msgid ""
"Although both employee and employer contributions are computed on the "
"payslip, only the employee's contribution is displayed on the final PDF "
"shared with the employee."
msgstr ""
"Aunque en la nómina se calculan tanto las aportaciones del empleado como las "
"del empleador, en el PDF final que se comparte con el empleado solo se "
"muestra la aportación del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:796
msgid "Nationalization % report"
msgstr "Informe del % de nacionalización"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:798
msgid ""
"Tracking the nationalization percentage is required to comply with the "
"nationalization regulations set by the Ministry of Human Resources under the "
"Nitaqat program."
msgstr ""
"El seguimiento del porcentaje de nacionalización es obligatorio para cumplir "
"con la normativa de nacionalización establecida por el Ministerio de "
"Recursos Humanos en el marco del programa Nitaqat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:801
msgid ""
"The tracking must be done at both company and department level and is based "
"on the minimum wage defined for each department, which can be configured on "
"the :doc:`department <../../employees/departments>` record."
msgstr ""
"El seguimiento debe realizarse tanto a nivel de empresa como de departamento "
"y se basa en el salario mínimo definido para cada departamento, que se puede "
"configurar en el registro del :doc:`departamento <../../employees/"
"departments>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:805
msgid ""
"The nationalization report can be accessed by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Employees --> Reporting --> Nationalization Report`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder al informe de nacionalización, ve a "
":menuselection:`Empleados --> Informes --> Informe de nacionalización`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:808
msgid ""
"The report includes filters such as the department and reference date. Based "
"on these filters, it displays the resulting nationalization percentage along "
"with a link to the employees that satisfy those chosen filters."
msgstr ""
"El informe incluye filtros como el departamento y la fecha de referencia. En "
"función de estos filtros, muestra el porcentaje de nacionalización "
"resultante junto con un enlace a los empleados que cumplen los filtros "
"seleccionados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:813
msgid "WPS reports"
msgstr "Informes WPS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:815
msgid ""
"The WPS report is a mandatory report all Saudi Arabian companies are "
"required to provide the government. The report confirms employee wages, "
"including when and how much they were paid. The WPS report can be generated "
"either per payslip or per pay run."
msgstr ""
"El informe WPS es un informe obligatorio que todas las empresas de Arabia "
"Saudita deben proporcionar al gobierno. El informe confirma los salarios de "
"los empleados, incluyendo cuándo y cuánto se les pagó. El informe WPS puede "
"generarse por nómina o por ejecución de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:820
msgid ""
"This report is structured in accordance with the technical guidelines issued "
"by the MHRSD."
msgstr ""
"Este informe está estructurado de acuerdo con las directrices técnicas "
"emitidas por el MHRSD."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:823
msgid ""
"To run the WPS report, the :guilabel:`Establishment Bank Account` "
"and :guilabel:`Ministry of Labor Establishment ID` fields **must** "
"be :ref:`configured <payroll/saudi_payroll_settings>` for the company."
msgstr ""
"Para ejecutar el informe WPS, los campos :guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria del "
"establecimiento` e :guilabel:`ID del establecimiento del Ministerio de "
"Trabajo` **deben** estar :ref:`configurados <payroll/"
"saudi_payroll_settings>` para la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:827
msgid ""
"Ensure the :guilabel:`Establishment Bank Account` has the :guilabel:`Bank "
"Establishment ID`, and :guilabel:`Bank SARIE Code` fields configured, and "
"the bank is marked as :guilabel:`Trusted`."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que la :guilabel:`Cuenta bancaria del establecimiento` tenga "
"configurados los campos :guilabel:`ID del establecimiento bancario` "
"y :guilabel:`Código SARIE del banco`, y que el banco esté marcado "
"como :guilabel:`Confiable`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:830
msgid ""
"Ensure all employees included in the report have a :guilabel:`Saudi "
"National / IQAMA ID` set on their employee profile."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que todos los empleados incluidos en el informe tengan "
"un :guilabel:`ID nacional saudí / IQAMA` establecido en su perfil de "
"empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:833
msgid ""
"First, :ref:`payslips or pay runs are generated <payroll/"
"saudi_run_payroll>`, then the :ref:`journal entries are posted <payroll/"
"journal_saudi>`."
msgstr ""
"Primero, :ref:`se generan las nóminas o ejecuciones de pago <payroll/"
"saudi_run_payroll>`, luego :ref:`se registran los asientos contables "
"<payroll/journal_saudi>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:836
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Payment Report` button on the :guilabel:`Pay Runs` "
"dashboard, the individual pay run, or an individual payslip, and a payment "
"report pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Informe de pago` en el "
"tablero :guilabel:`Ejecuciones de pago`, en la ejecución de pago individual "
"o en una nómina individual, y se carga una ventana emergente de informe de "
"pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:839
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Saudi WPS` is selected in the :guilabel:`Export Format` field, by "
"default, and the :guilabel:`Payment Date` and :guilabel:`WPS Value Date` "
"fields are both populated according to the selected payslips or pay runs."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Saudi WPS` está seleccionado en el campo :guilabel:`Formato de "
"exportación`, por defecto, y los campos :guilabel:`Fecha de pago` "
"y :guilabel:`Fecha de valor WPS` están ambos poblados según las nóminas o "
"ejecuciones de pago seleccionadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:843
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`WPS Debit Date` is an optional field, and specifies the date "
"the company physically pays the employees (transfers funds from the company "
"account to employee accounts)."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`Fecha de débito WPS` es un campo opcional y especifica la "
"fecha en que la empresa paga físicamente a los empleados (transfiere fondos "
"de la cuenta de la empresa a las cuentas de los empleados)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:846
msgid ""
"Once all fields are configured, click :guilabel:`Generate`, and the WPS "
"report is created."
msgstr ""
"Una vez configurados todos los campos, haz clic en :guilabel:`Generar` y se "
"creará el informe WPS."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Türkiye payroll localization covers salary computations for employees, "
"including both employee and employer payroll taxes. It accounts for federal "
"and state regulations."
msgstr ""
"La localización de nómina de Turquía cubre los cálculos salariales para "
"empleados, incluidos los impuestos de nómina tanto de empleados como de "
"empleadores. Contempla las regulaciones federales y estatales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:8
msgid ""
"Before configuring the Türkiye localization, refer to the "
"general :doc:`payroll <../../payroll>` documentation, which includes the "
"basic information for all localizations, as well as all universal settings "
"and fields."
msgstr ""
"Antes de configurar la localización de Turquía, consulta la documentación "
"general de :doc:`nómina <../../payroll>`, que incluye la información básica "
"para todas las localizaciones, así como todos los ajustes y campos "
"universales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:17
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get all the "
"features of the Türkiye payroll localization:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Instala <general/install>` los siguientes módulos para obtener todas "
"las funcionalidades de la localización de nómina de Turquía:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:27
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye - Payroll`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Turquía - Nómina`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:28
msgid "`l10n_tr_hr_payroll`"
msgstr "```l10n_tr_hr_payroll```"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:30
msgid ""
"Includes all salary rules, leave logic, and compensation rules compliant "
"with Türkiye labor laws."
msgstr ""
"Incluye todas las reglas salariales, lógica de permisos y reglas de "
"compensación conforme a las leyes laborales de Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:32
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye - Payroll with Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Turquía - Nómina con Contabilidad`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:33
msgid "`l10n_tr_hr_payroll_account`"
msgstr "```l10n_tr_hr_payroll_account```"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:35
msgid "l10n_tr_hr_payroll_account"
msgstr "l10n_tr_hr_payroll_account"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:36
msgid "l10n_tr_hr_payroll"
msgstr "l10n_tr_hr_payroll"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: Complete the full address, including "
"the :guilabel:`City`, :guilabel:`State`, :guilabel:`ZIP`, "
"and :guilabel:`Country`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dirección`: Completa la dirección completa, incluida "
"la :guilabel:`Ciudad`, el :guilabel:`Estado`, el :guilabel:`Código postal` y "
"el :guilabel:`País`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:50
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`: Enter the company's tax ID."
msgstr ":guilabel:`NIF`: Introduce el NIF de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:51
msgid ":guilabel:`Company ID` : Enter the business's ID number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ID de empresa`: Introduce el número de identificación de la "
"empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, :abbr:`TRY (Turkish lira)` is selected. If "
"not, select :guilabel:`TRY` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moneda`: Por defecto, se selecciona :abbr:`TRY (lira turca)`. Si "
"no es así, selecciona :guilabel:`TRY` en el menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:60
msgid ""
"Every employee being paid must have their employee profiles configured for "
"the Türkiye payroll localization. Additional fields are present after "
"configuring the database for Türkiye."
msgstr ""
"Cada empleado que reciba pago debe tener su perfil de empleado configurado "
"para la localización de nómina de Turquía. Aparecen campos adicionales "
"después de configurar la base de datos para Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract`: Ensure a contract start date is entered in the first "
"field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contrato`: Asegúrate de introducir una fecha de inicio del "
"contrato en el primer campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Net to Gross`: Leave this box unchecked if the gross salary is "
"based on a fixed gross and a dynamically computed net (Gross to Net). "
"Activate this option if the gross salary is based on a fixed net and a "
"dynamically computed gross (Net to Gross)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Neto a bruto`: Deja esta casilla sin marcar si el salario bruto "
"se basa en un bruto fijo y un neto calculado dinámicamente (Bruto a neto). "
"Activa esta opción si el salario bruto se basa en un neto fijo y un bruto "
"calculado dinámicamente (Neto a bruto)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wage`: If :guilabel:`Net to Gross` is unchecked, this field "
"displays :guilabel:`Wage`. If it is checked, this field "
"displays :guilabel:`Net Wage`. Enter the monthly amount earned by the "
"employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario`: Si :guilabel:`Neto a bruto` está sin marcar, este campo "
"muestra :guilabel:`Salario`. Si está marcado, este campo "
"muestra :guilabel:`Salario neto`. Introduce el importe mensual que gana el "
"empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Type`: May affect the working hours for the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de empleado`: Puede afectar a las horas de trabajo del "
"empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Type`: Determines how the employee is paid and "
"classified, such as :guilabel:`Permanent`, :guilabel:`Temporary`, "
"or :guilabel:`Student`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de contrato`: Determina cómo se paga y clasifica al "
"empleado, como :guilabel:`Indefinido`, :guilabel:`Temporal` "
"o :guilabel:`Estudiante`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select :guilabel:`Türkiye: Employee` for this "
"field. This defines when the employee is paid, their default working "
"schedule, and the work entry type it applies to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de pago`: Selecciona :guilabel:`Turquía: Empleado` para "
"este campo. Esto define cuándo se paga al empleado, su horario de trabajo "
"predeterminado y el tipo de entrada de trabajo al que se aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:140
msgid ""
"Several sections within the **Payroll** app install a Salary Structure, "
"Structure Type, Rules, and Parameters specific to Türkiye."
msgstr ""
"Varias secciones de la aplicación **Nómina** instalan una estructura "
"salarial, un tipo de estructura, reglas y parámetros específicos de Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:146
msgid ""
"When the **l10n_tr_payroll** module is :ref:`installed <payroll/"
"turkey_apps>`, a new :guilabel:`Salary Structure` gets "
"installed, :guilabel:`Türkiye: Regular Pay`. This structure includes "
"one :guilabel:`Structure Type`, :guilabel:`Türkiye: Employee`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el módulo **l10n_tr_payroll** está :ref:`instalado <payroll/"
"turkey_apps>`, se instala una nueva :guilabel:`Estructura "
"salarial`, :guilabel:`Turquía: Pago regular`. Esta estructura incluye "
"un :guilabel:`Tipo de estructura`, :guilabel:`Turquía: Empleado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:150
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Salary Structure` contains all the individual :ref:`salary "
"rules <payroll/turkey_rules>` that informs the **Payroll** app how to "
"calculate employee payslips."
msgstr ""
"La :guilabel:`Estructura salarial` contiene todas las :ref:`reglas "
"salariales <payroll/turkey_rules>` individuales que informan a la aplicación "
"**Nómina** sobre cómo calcular las nóminas de los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:153
msgid "The Türkiye salary structure in the salary structures list."
msgstr ""
"La estructura salarial de Turquía en la lista de estructuras salariales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:161
msgid ""
"To view the salary rules that inform the salary structure what to do, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structures` "
"and expand the :guilabel:`Türkiye: Employee` group to reveal "
"the :guilabel:`Türkiye: Monthly Pay` structure type. "
"Click :guilabel:`Türkiye: Monthly Pay` to view the detailed salary rules."
msgstr ""
"Para ver las reglas salariales que informan a la estructura salarial qué "
"hacer, navega a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> "
"Estructuras` y expande el grupo :guilabel:`Turquía: Empleado` para revelar "
"el tipo de estructura :guilabel:`Turquía: Pago mensual`. Haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Turquía: Pago mensual` para ver las reglas salariales "
"detalladas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:166
msgid "The top portion of the Türkiye salary rules."
msgstr "La parte superior de las reglas salariales de Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:169
msgid ""
"Each rule defines how pay is calculated, taking into account factors such as "
"commissions, bonuses, taxes, and insurance."
msgstr ""
"Cada regla define cómo se calcula el pago, teniendo en cuenta factores como "
"comisiones, bonificaciones, impuestos y seguros."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:180
msgid ""
"Most rules pull information stored in the parameters module to get the rate "
"of the rule (a percentage) and the cap (a monetary amount)."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de las reglas extraen información almacenada en el módulo de "
"parámetros para obtener la tasa de la regla (un porcentaje) y el límite (un "
"monto monetario)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:188
msgid ""
"Ensure the following rules parameters are up to date with current rules and "
"regulations:"
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que los siguientes parámetros de reglas estén actualizados con "
"las normas y regulaciones vigentes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:190
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye Minimum Wage`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Salario mínimo de Turquía`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:191
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye SSI Base Amount Ceiling`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Límite máximo del monto base del SSI de Turquía`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:192
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye Tax Exemption Amount`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Monto de exención fiscal de Turquía`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:193
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye Stamp Tax Percentage`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Porcentaje del impuesto de timbre de Turquía`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:194
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye Tax Bracket Rates`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tasas de tramos fiscales de Turquía`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:195
msgid ":guilabel:`Türkiye SSI Company Contribution`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Contribución de la empresa al SSI de Turquía`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:198
msgid ""
"The minimum wage is updated, and is different from the one added by default "
"in Odoo. To update this, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Rule Parameters`, then click the rule "
"parameter :guilabel:`Türkiye Minimum Wage`. Click :guilabel:`Add a line` and "
"add the new :guilabel:`Parameter Value` (minimum wage), and reference the "
"date the change goes into effect."
msgstr ""
"El salario mínimo se actualiza y es diferente del agregado por defecto en "
"Odoo. Para actualizar esto, navega a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> "
"Configuración --> Parámetros de reglas`, luego haz clic en el parámetro de "
"regla :guilabel:`Salario mínimo de Turquía`. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Añadir "
"una línea` y agrega el nuevo :guilabel:`Valor del parámetro` (salario "
"mínimo), y referencia la fecha en que el cambio entra en vigor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:204
msgid ""
"Odoo adds updated rule parameters for the current calendar year. It is "
"**not** recommended to edit rule parameters **unless a parameter has "
"changed**, and is different from the rule parameters created by Odoo. Check "
"with all local and national regulations *before* making any changes to rule "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Odoo agrega parámetros de reglas actualizados para el año calendario actual. "
"**No** se recomienda editar los parámetros de reglas **a menos que un "
"parámetro haya cambiado** y sea diferente de los parámetros de reglas "
"creados por Odoo. Consulta todas las regulaciones locales y nacionales "
"*antes* de realizar cualquier cambio en los parámetros de reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:210
msgid "Türkiye taxes"
msgstr "Impuestos de Turquía"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:212
msgid ""
"The following sections explain in detail the various employer and employee "
"taxes specific to Türkiye."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes secciones explican en detalle los diversos impuestos del "
"empleador y del empleado específicos de Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:218
msgid ""
"Social insurance rules calculate the contribution amounts that are to be "
"paid by the employer and employee to the :abbr:`SSI (Social Security "
"Institution)`. This is **only** available for Türkiye employees."
msgstr ""
"Las reglas de seguro social calculan los montos de contribución que deben "
"pagar el empleador y el empleado al :abbr:`SSI (Institución de Seguridad "
"Social)`. Esto está disponible **solo** para empleados de Turquía."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:222
msgid "Social insurance consists of two main categories:"
msgstr "El seguro social consta de dos categorías principales:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:224
msgid ""
"**Social Insurance**: Employers contribute 15% of their employee's salaries "
"to the :abbr:`SSI (Social Security Institution)`, while employees contribute "
"14% of their salaries, which is deducted from their payslips."
msgstr ""
"**Seguro social**: Los empleadores contribuyen con el 15% de los salarios de "
"sus empleados al :abbr:`SSI (Institución de Seguridad Social)`, mientras que "
"los empleados contribuyen con el 14% de sus salarios, que se deduce de sus "
"nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:227
msgid ""
"**Unemployment Insurance**: Employers contribute 2% of their employee's "
"salaries to the :abbr:`SSI (Social Security Institution)`, while employees "
"contribute 1% of their salary, which is deducted from their payslips."
msgstr ""
"**Seguro de desempleo**: Los empleadores contribuyen con el 2% de los "
"salarios de sus empleados al :abbr:`SSI (Institución de Seguridad Social)`, "
"mientras que los empleados contribuyen con el 1% de su salario, que se "
"deduce de sus nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:232
msgid ""
"Employer and employee contributions for both categories are calculated "
"according to a salary maximum that is revised each year. Therefore, it is "
"necessary to check the corresponding :ref:`rule parameters <payroll/"
"turkey_rule-parameters>` to ensure all taxes are current."
msgstr ""
"Las contribuciones del empleador y del empleado para ambas categorías se "
"calculan según un salario máximo que se revisa cada año. Por lo tanto, es "
"necesario verificar los :ref:`parámetros de regla <payroll/turkey_rule-"
"parameters>` correspondientes para asegurar que todos los impuestos estén "
"actualizados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:239
msgid ""
"Employees in Türkiye are subject to a progressive income tax system, where "
"tax rates increase with higher annual income levels."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados en Turquía están sujetos a un sistema de impuesto sobre la "
"renta progresivo, donde las tasas impositivas aumentan con niveles de "
"ingresos anuales más altos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:242
msgid ""
"To calculate the deductible tax amount for the current month, the following "
"is done:"
msgstr ""
"Para calcular el monto de impuesto deducible del mes actual, se hace lo "
"siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:244
msgid ""
"**Compute year-to-date gross amount**: This serves as the base amount for "
"calculating the employee's taxable salary."
msgstr ""
"**Calcular el monto bruto acumulado del año**: Esto sirve como el monto base "
"para calcular el salario imponible del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:246
msgid ""
"**Determine year-to-date taxable amount**: The taxable amount is compared to "
"progressive tax brackets to compute the year-to-date tax amount due."
msgstr ""
"**Determinar el monto imponible acumulado del año**: El monto imponible se "
"compara con los tramos impositivos progresivos para calcular el monto de "
"impuesto acumulado del año adeudado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:248
msgid ""
"**Subtract prior month's tax**: The amount taxed in previous months is "
"subtracted from the year-to-date tax to obtain the pre-exemption tax amount "
"due for the current month."
msgstr ""
"**Restar el impuesto del mes anterior**: El monto gravado en meses "
"anteriores se resta del impuesto acumulado del año para obtener el monto de "
"impuesto antes de exención adeudado para el mes actual."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:250
msgid ""
"**Deduct exemption amount**: The exemption amount is deducted from the pre-"
"exemption tax to determine the final tax due amount post-exemptions."
msgstr ""
"**Deducir el monto de exención**: El monto de exención se deduce del "
"impuesto antes de exención para determinar el monto final de impuesto "
"adeudado después de exenciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:256
msgid ""
"As of 2025, and depending on the annual income of the employee, the "
"following rates apply:"
msgstr ""
"A partir de 2025, y dependiendo del ingreso anual del empleado, se aplican "
"las siguientes tasas:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:265
msgid "0.00 - 158,000.00"
msgstr "0.00 - 158,000.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:267
msgid "158,000.00 - 330,000.00"
msgstr "158,000.00 - 330,000.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:268
msgid "27%"
msgstr "27%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:269
msgid "330,000.00 - 800,000.00"
msgstr "330,000.00 - 800,000.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:270
msgid "35%"
msgstr "35%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:271
msgid "800,000.00 - 4,300,000.00"
msgstr "800,000.00 - 4,300,000.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:272
msgid "40%"
msgstr "40%"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:273
msgid "above 4,300,000.00"
msgstr "más de 4,300,000.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:276
msgid ""
"Tax brackets are applied progressively. This means each portion of an "
"employee's income is taxed at its respective rate within each bracket, "
"rather than their entire income being taxed at the highest rate they fall "
"into."
msgstr ""
"Los tramos impositivos se aplican de forma progresiva. Esto significa que "
"cada porción del ingreso de un empleado se grava a su tasa respectiva dentro "
"de cada tramo, en lugar de que todo su ingreso se grave a la tasa más alta "
"en la que se encuentra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:281
msgid ""
"Turkish employees benefit from a monthly personal income tax **exemption**, "
"which is adjusted each year. For 2025, the exemption amount is TRY 3,315.70 "
"per month, from January through July."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados turcos se benefician de una **exención** mensual del impuesto "
"sobre la renta personal, que se ajusta cada año. Para 2025, el monto de "
"exención es de TRY 3,315.70 por mes, de enero a julio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:285
msgid "Stamp Tax"
msgstr "Impuesto de timbre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:287
msgid ""
"Stamp tax is applied to gross salary payments in Türkiye. The standard rate "
"is 0.759% (i.e. 7.59 per thousand), which is withheld from the employee's "
"gross wage and remitted to the tax authority :abbr:`GIB (Gelir İdaresi "
"Başkanliği,)` by the employer."
msgstr ""
"El impuesto de timbre se aplica a los pagos de salario bruto en Turquía. La "
"tasa estándar es de 0.759% (es decir, 7.59 por mil), que se retiene del "
"salario bruto del empleado y se remite a la autoridad tributaria :abbr:`GIB "
"(Gelir İdaresi Başkanlığı,)` por el empleador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:291
msgid ""
"The base amount for the stamp tax is the total gross salary amount "
"(including bonuses or extras)."
msgstr ""
"El importe base para el impuesto de timbre es el importe total del salario "
"bruto (incluidos bonos o extras)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:294
msgid ""
"Turkish employees receive a personal stamp tax **exemption**, the value of "
"which is updated annually. As of 2025, the exemption amount is TRY 197.38 "
"per month, from January through July. This applies to gross earnings up to "
"the legal minimum wage level before calculating stamp tax."
msgstr ""
"Los empleados turcos reciben una **exención** personal del impuesto de "
"timbre, cuyo valor se actualiza anualmente. A partir de 2025, el importe de "
"la exención es de 197,38 TRY por mes, de enero a julio. Esto se aplica a las "
"ganancias brutas hasta el nivel del salario mínimo legal antes de calcular "
"el impuesto de timbre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:299
msgid "Net to gross"
msgstr "Neto a bruto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:301
msgid ""
"On an employee record, if the option :guilabel:`Net to Gross` is enabled in "
"the :ref:`contract section <payroll/turkey_contract>` of the payroll tab, "
"the net salary is fixed, and specified in the :guilabel:`Net Wage` field, "
"while the gross wage is recalculated each month, and increases throughout "
"the year."
msgstr ""
"En un registro de empleado, si la opción :guilabel:`Neto a bruto` está "
"habilitada en la :ref:`sección de contrato <payroll/turkey_contract>` de la "
"pestaña de nómina, el salario neto es fijo y se especifica en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Salario neto`, mientras que el salario bruto se recalcula "
"cada mes y aumenta a lo largo del año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:306
msgid ""
"The gross wage is what tax calculations are based on, so for these "
"employees, the monthly *net* wage does **not** change, but the monthly "
"*gross* amount is recalculated each month, changing the taxes with it."
msgstr ""
"El salario bruto es en lo que se basan los cálculos de impuestos, así que "
"para estos empleados, el salario *neto* mensual **no** cambia, pero el "
"importe *bruto* mensual se recalcula cada mes, cambiando los impuestos con "
"él."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:310
msgid ""
"In this scenario, the least amount of taxes are paid in the beginning of the "
"year, and taxes increase as the year progresses."
msgstr ""
"En este escenario, se paga la menor cantidad de impuestos al inicio del año, "
"y los impuestos aumentan a medida que el año avanza."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:314
msgid ""
"On January 31st, an employee's year-to-date total income is ₺10,000. The "
"income tax is calculated based on the ₺10,000, which in this example is "
"₺800. In February, the employee's year-to-date gross is ₺20,000, and the "
"taxes are calculated based on that figure, for a total of ₺2,000."
msgstr ""
"El 31 de enero, el ingreso total acumulado del año de un empleado es de "
"₺10.000. El impuesto sobre la renta se calcula en base a los ₺10.000, que en "
"este ejemplo es ₺800. En febrero, el bruto acumulado del año del empleado es "
"de ₺20.000, y los impuestos se calculan en base a esa cifra, para un total "
"de ₺2.000."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:318
msgid ""
"Since the employee already paid ₺800 in January, the taxes due for February "
"are ₺1,200 because the employee already paid ₺800 toward that total (₺2,000 "
"- ₺800 = ₺1,200)."
msgstr ""
"Dado que el empleado ya pagó ₺800 en enero, los impuestos debidos para "
"febrero son ₺1.200 porque el empleado ya pagó ₺800 hacia ese total (₺2.000 - "
"₺800 = ₺1.200)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:322
msgid "Gross to net"
msgstr "Bruto a neto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:324
msgid ""
"On an employee record, if the option :guilabel:`Net to Gross` is **not** "
"enabled in the :ref:`contract section <payroll/turkey_contract>` of the "
"payroll tab, the gross salary is calculated based on the :guilabel:`Wage` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"En un registro de empleado, si la opción :guilabel:`Neto a bruto` **no** "
"está habilitada en la :ref:`sección de contrato <payroll/turkey_contract>` "
"de la pestaña de nómina, el salario bruto se calcula en base al "
"campo :guilabel:`Salario`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:328
msgid ""
"The gross wage then has all the salary rules computed, to determine the "
"*net* wage. The taxes are then computed based on the gross wage. In this "
"scenario, unlike with net to gross, taxes are more consistent and do not "
"change that much, from month to month."
msgstr ""
"El salario bruto entonces tiene todas las reglas salariales calculadas para "
"determinar el salario *neto*. Los impuestos se calculan entonces en base al "
"salario bruto. En este escenario, a diferencia del neto a bruto, los "
"impuestos son más consistentes y no cambian tanto de mes a mes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:333
msgid ""
"The gross from net calculation depends on the salary rules defined in "
"the :guilabel:`Türkiye: Monthly Pay` salary structure. Changes made to those "
"rules affect the computed amount."
msgstr ""
"El cálculo de bruto desde neto depende de las reglas salariales definidas en "
"la estructura salarial :guilabel:`Turquía: pago mensual`. Los cambios "
"realizados en esas reglas afectan el importe calculado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:337
msgid "Run Türkiye payroll"
msgstr "Ejecutar nómina de Turquía"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:383
msgid ""
"The accounting process when running payroll has two "
"components: :ref:`creating journal entries <payroll/journal-tr>` "
"and :ref:`registering payments <payroll/register-tr>`."
msgstr ""
"El proceso contable al ejecutar la nómina tiene dos componentes: :ref:`crear "
"asientos contables <payroll/journal-tr>` y :ref:`registrar pagos <payroll/"
"register-tr>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:406
msgid ""
"After the :ref:`journal entries <payroll/journal-tr>` are validated, Odoo "
"can generate payments."
msgstr ""
"Después de que los :ref:`asientos contables <payroll/journal-tr>` se "
"validan, Odoo puede generar pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/turkey.rst:409
msgid ""
"To generate payments from payslips, employees **must** have a *trusted* bank "
"account. If the employee's bank account is *not* marked as `trusted`, "
"payments **cannot** be generated through Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Para generar pagos desde nóminas, los empleados **deben** tener una cuenta "
"bancaria *de confianza*. Si la cuenta bancaria del empleado *no* está "
"marcada como de confianza, **no** se pueden generar pagos a través de Odoo."

