#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Nationality (Country)`: The nationality affects an employee's "
"payslips, whether they are nationals or expats."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nacionalidad (país)`: La nacionalidad afecta las nóminas de un "
"empleado, ya sea que sean nacionales o expatriados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification Number`: Used to extract the :ref:`WPS report "
"<payroll/l10n_ae/wps-reports>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Número de identificación`: Se utiliza para extraer "
