"fiscal_localizations/united_states>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Configura la localización fiscal de Estados Unidos <../../../finance/"
"fiscal_localizations/united_states>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax ID`: Enter the company's :abbr:`EIN (Employer Identification "
"Number)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ID fiscal`: Introduce el :abbr:`EIN (número de identificación del "
"empleador)` de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:129
msgid ":guilabel:`Company ID` : Enter the business's state ID number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ID de la empresa`: Introduce el número de ID estatal del negocio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: By default, :abbr:`USD (US Dollars)` is selected. If "
"not, select :guilabel:`USD` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moneda`: Por defecto, está seleccionado :abbr:`USD (dólares "
"estadounidenses)`. Si no es así, selecciona :guilabel:`USD` del menú "
"desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:136
msgid "Ensure the information is accurate, as it is used when creating W-2s."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que la información sea precisa, ya que se usa al crear los W-2."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:141
msgid ""
"Every employee being paid must have their employee profiles configured for "
"the United States payroll localization. Additional fields are present after "
"configuring the database for the United States."
msgstr ""
"Cada empleado que reciba pago debe tener su perfil de empleado configurado "
"para la localización de nómina de Estados Unidos. Hay campos adicionales "
"presentes después de configurar la base de datos para Estados Unidos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:150
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Work Address` for the employee in the *Location* "
"section of the *Work* tab."
msgstr ""
"Introduce la :guilabel:`Dirección laboral` del empleado en la sección "
"*Ubicación* de la pestaña *Trabajo*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:162
msgid ""
"These accounts are used to pay the employee, via an automation through a "
"NACHA payment file. Payroll **cannot** be processed for employees without a "
"*trusted* :ref:`bank account <employees/private-contact>`. If no trusted "
"bank account is set, a warning appears on the **Payroll** dashboard and an "
"error occurs when attempting to run payroll."
msgstr ""
"Estas cuentas se utilizan para pagar al empleado, mediante una "
"automatización a través de un archivo de pago NACHA. La **nómina no puede** "
"procesarse para empleados sin una :ref:`cuenta bancaria <employees/private-"
"contact>` *de confianza*. Si no hay una cuenta bancaria de confianza "
"configurada, aparece una advertencia en el tablero de **Nómina** y se "
"produce un error al intentar ejecutar la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:167
msgid ""
"Ensure there is a valid :guilabel:`SSN No` entered in "
"the :guilabel:`Citizenship` section . The last four digits of the :abbr:`SSN "
"(Social Security Number)` number appears on the employee's payslips."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que haya un :guilabel:`Núm. SSN` válido ingresado en la "
"sección :guilabel:`Ciudadanía`. Los últimos cuatro dígitos del "
"número :abbr:`SSN (Número de Seguro Social)` aparecen en las nóminas del "
"empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:195
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contract Type`: Determines how the employee is paid and "
"classified, such as :guilabel:`Salary-exempt`, :guilabel:`Salary-"
"nonexempt`, :guilabel:`Hourly`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de contrato`: determina cómo se paga y clasifica al "
"empleado, como :guilabel:`Salario-exento`, :guilabel:`Salario-no "
"exento`, :guilabel:`Por hora`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:199
msgid ""
"This field is visible on payslips. Some states require payslips to state if "
"the employee is exempt or non-exempt from overtime. Ensure the selection "
"follows the state laws."
msgstr ""
"Este campo es visible en las nóminas. Algunos estados requieren que las "
"nóminas indiquen si el empleado está exento o no exento de horas extra. "
"Asegúrate de que la selección siga las leyes estatales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Category`: Select :guilabel:`United States: Employee` for "
"this field. This defines when the employee is paid, their default working "
"schedule, and the work entry type it applies to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría de pago`: selecciona :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: "
"Empleado` para este campo. Esto define cuándo se le paga al empleado, su "
"horario de trabajo predeterminado y el tipo de entrada de trabajo al que se "
"aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:228
msgid "W-2 form section"
msgstr "Sección del formulario W-2"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:230
msgid ""
"A W-2 is an annual tax form that reports an employee's wages, taxes, and "
"benefits. Employees use it to file their tax returns. The options below "
"correspond to checkboxes in *box 13* of the W-2 form. Select any that apply "
"to the employee."
msgstr ""
"Un W-2 es un formulario fiscal anual que reporta los salarios, impuestos y "
"beneficios de un empleado. Los empleados lo usan para presentar sus "
"declaraciones de impuestos. Las opciones siguientes corresponden a las "
"casillas de verificación en la *casilla 13* del formulario W-2. Selecciona "
"las que apliquen al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:234
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Statutory Employee`: Tick this box if the employee is exempt from "
"income tax, but subject to :abbr:`FICA (Federal Insurance Contributions "
"Act)` taxes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empleado estatutario`: Marca esta casilla si el empleado está "
"exento del impuesto sobre la renta, pero sujeto a los impuestos :abbr:`FICA "
"(Ley Federal de Contribuciones al Seguro)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:236
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Retirement Plan`: Tick this box if the employee is an active "
"contributor to an employer-sponsored retirement plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plan de jubilación`: Marca esta casilla si el empleado es un "
"contribuyente activo a un plan de jubilación patrocinado por el empleador."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:238
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Third-Party Sick Pay`: Tick this box if the employee is covered "
"under a plan where sick pay benefits may be provided by a third party (e.g., "
"an insurance company) during the year."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago por enfermedad de terceros`: Marca esta casilla si el "
"empleado está cubierto bajo un plan donde los beneficios por pago por "
"enfermedad pueden ser proporcionados por un tercero (p. ej., una compañía de "
"seguros) durante el año."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:242
msgid "W-4 form section"
msgstr "Sección del formulario W-4"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:244
msgid ""
"A W-4 is an :abbr:`IRS (Internal Revenue Services)` form that determines an "
"employee's federal tax withholding, which the employer remits directly to "
"the :abbr:`IRS (Internal Revenue Services)`."
msgstr ""
"Un W-4 es un formulario del :abbr:`IRS (Servicio de Rentas Internas)` que "
"determina la retención de impuestos federales de un empleado, la cual el "
"empleador remite directamente al :abbr:`IRS (Servicio de Rentas Internas)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:247
msgid "Configure any relevant fields for the employee in this section."
msgstr "Configura cualquier campo relevante para el empleado en esta sección."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:250
msgid "Tax filing section"
msgstr "Sección de declaración de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:252
msgid ""
"An employee's marital status impacts their payroll taxes. Configure the "
"following fields regarding their status and withholdings."
msgstr ""
"El estado civil de un empleado impacta sus impuestos de nómina. Configura "
"los siguientes campos respecto a su estado y retenciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Federal Tax Status`: Using the drop-down menu, select the "
"employee's *federal* filing status. The options "
"are :guilabel:`Single`, :guilabel:`Married/RDP filing "
"jointly`, :guilabel:`Married/RDP filing separately`, :guilabel:`Head of "
"household`, or :guilabel:`Qualifying surviving spouse/RDP with child`. This "
"typically comes from the employee's W-4 form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estado`: Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona el estado de "
"declaración *federal* del empleado. Las opciones son :guilabel:`Soltero`, "
":guilabel:`Casado/RDP declarando conjuntamente`, :guilabel:`Casado/RDP "
"declarando por separado`, :guilabel:`Jefe de familia`, o :guilabel:`Cónyuge "
"sobreviviente calificado/RDP con hijo`. Esto típicamente proviene del "
"formulario W-4 del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:259
msgid ""
":guilabel:`State Tax Status`: Using the drop-down menu, select the "
"employee's *state* filing status, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estado fiscal`: Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona el estado "
"de declaración *estatal* del empleado, si aplica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:263
msgid "The federal and state statuses do **not** need to match."
msgstr "Los estados federal y estatal **no** necesitan coincidir."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:266
msgid ""
"As of 2025, these states do **not** collect state income tax: Alaska, "
"Florida, Nevada, New Hampshire, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Washington, "
"and Wyoming. If a payroll localization exists for these states, there are "
"**no** corresponding state options in the :guilabel:`State Tax Status` "
"field, and it can be left blank."
msgstr ""
"A fecha de 2025, estos estados **no** recaudan el impuesto sobre la renta "
"estatal: Alaska, Florida, Nevada, Nuevo Hampshire, Dakota del Sur, "
"Tennessee, Texas, Washington y Wyoming. Si existe una localización de nómina "
"para estos estados, **no** habrá opciones estatales correspondientes en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Estado fiscal estatal` y se puede dejar en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:271
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Allowance`: Enter the total annual amount to be "
"withheld from the employee's pay for the year, for state taxes. Only fill "
"this out if the employee lives in a state with state income tax."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Asignación de retención`: Ingresa el monto anual total a ser "
"retenido del pago del empleado para el año, para impuestos estatales. Solo "
"completa esto si el empleado vive en un estado con impuesto estatal sobre la "
"renta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:274
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Extra Withholding`: Enter the total *extra* annual amount (not "
"including the :guilabel:`Withholding Allowance` amount) to be withheld from "
"the employee's pay for the year, for state taxes, if the employee lives in a "
"state with state income tax."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Retención adicional`: Ingresa el monto anual *adicional* total "
"(sin incluir el monto de :guilabel:`Asignación de retención`) a ser retenido "
"del pago del empleado para el año, para impuestos estatales, si el empleado "
"vive en un estado con impuesto estatal sobre la renta."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:278
msgid "The tax filing section of the employee form, filled out."
msgstr ""
"La sección de declaración de impuestos del formulario del empleado, "
"cumplimentada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:282
msgid "Common benefits"
msgstr "Beneficios comunes"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:284
msgid ""
"The following sections of benefits are considered common ones offered by US "
"employers. This information needs to be populated with the information "
"selected by the employee."
msgstr ""
"Las siguientes secciones de beneficios se consideran comunes ofrecidos por "
"empleadores estadounidenses. Esta información necesita ser completada con la "
"información seleccionada por el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:288
msgid ""
"The benefits listed in this section are considered the most commonly offered "
"by companies. If other employee benefits exist that require regular paycheck "
"deductions, they can be added as *inputs*."
msgstr ""
"Los beneficios listados en esta sección se consideran los más comúnmente "
"ofrecidos por las empresas. Si existen otros beneficios para empleados que "
"requieren deducciones regulares del cheque de pago, pueden agregarse como "
"*entradas*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:293
msgid "Pre-tax deductions"
msgstr "Deducciones antes de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:295
msgid ""
"Pre-tax benefits lower the employee's gross wage, which decreases the base "
"amount for tax calculations. These are displayed at the beginning of the "
"payslip before the gross wage is stipulated."
msgstr ""
"Los beneficios antes de impuestos reducen el salario bruto del empleado, lo "
"que disminuye la base para los cálculos de impuestos. Estos se muestran al "
"principio de la nómina antes de que se estipule el salario bruto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:300
msgid "Retirement plans section"
msgstr "Sección de planes de jubilación"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:302
msgid ""
"This section is where the employee and employer 401(k) contributions are "
"configured. Fill out the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"Esta sección es donde se configuran las contribuciones del empleado y del "
"empleador al 401(k). Completa los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:305
msgid ""
":guilabel:`401(k)`: Enter the amount of money taken out of the employee's "
"payslip each pay period. This can be entered either as a percentage (%) of "
"the payslip amount, or a specific dollar amount per payslip ($/slip)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`401(k)`: Introduce la cantidad de dinero que se descuenta de la "
"nómina del empleado en cada período de pago. Esto puede introducirse como un "
"porcentaje (%) del monto de la nómina, o una cantidad específica en dólares "
"por nómina ($/nómina)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:308
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Matching Amount`: Enter the matching amount the employer "
"contributes to the employee's 401(k), as compared to the employee's "
"contributions. This field can also be configured as either a percentage (%) "
"of the employee's contribution, or a specific dollar amount ($/slip)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Monto de Contrapartida`: Introduce el monto de contrapartida que "
"el empleador aporta al 401(k) del empleado, en comparación con las "
"contribuciones del empleado. Este campo también puede configurarse como un "
"porcentaje (%) de la contribución del empleado, o una cantidad específica en "
"dólares ($/nómina)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:311
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Matching Yearly Cap`: If there is a limit to the employer's "
"contribution, enter it as a percentage of the employee's annual salary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Límite Anual de Contrapartida`: Si hay un límite para la "
"contribución del empleador, introdúcelo como un porcentaje del salario anual "
"del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:315
msgid ""
"A company allows employees to contribute to a 401(k) retirement plan, and "
"matches 50% of the employee's contributions, up to $5,000 USD a year. The "
"employee earns $50,000 USD a year, and contributes 20% of their pay to their "
"401(k), which is $10,000 USD."
msgstr ""
"Una empresa permite a los empleados contribuir a un plan de jubilación "
"401(k), y aporta el 50% de las contribuciones del empleado, hasta $5,000 USD "
"al año. El empleado gana $50,000 USD al año y contribuye el 20% de su pago a "
"su 401(k), lo que equivale a $10,000 USD."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:319
msgid ""
"To configure this, enter `20.00` in the :guilabel:`401(k)` field, `50.00` in "
"the :guilabel:`Matching Amount` field, and `20.00` in "
"the :guilabel:`Matching Yearly Cap` field."
msgstr ""
"Para configurar esto, introduce `20.00` en el campo :guilabel:`401(k)`, "
"`50.00` en el campo :guilabel:`Monto de Contrapartida`, y `20.00` en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Límite Anual de Contrapartida`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:322
msgid "An employee's retirement configurations."
msgstr "Configuraciones de jubilación de un empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:326
msgid "Health benefits section"
msgstr "Sección de beneficios de salud"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:328
msgid ""
"This section is where the employee's health contributions are configured. "
"Populate each of the fields with the corresponding amount deducted from "
"*each paycheck* for the employee."
msgstr ""
"Esta sección es donde se configuran las contribuciones de salud del "
"empleado. Completa cada uno de los campos con el monto correspondiente "
"deducido de *cada cheque de pago* para el empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:331
msgid ""
"The health benefits section for an employee, filled out with payslip "
"deductions."
msgstr ""
"La sección de beneficios de salud para un empleado, completada con "
"deducciones de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:335
msgid "Other benefits section"
msgstr "Sección de otros beneficios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:337
msgid ""
"This section currently only houses a :guilabel:`Commuter` benefit field. "
"Enter the amount being deducted per paycheck, for applicable commuter "
"benefits."
msgstr ""
"Esta sección actualmente solo contiene un campo de "
"beneficio :guilabel:`Transporte`. Introduce el monto que se deduce por "
"cheque de pago, para los beneficios de transporte aplicables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:341
msgid "Post-tax deductions section"
msgstr "Sección de deducciones después de impuestos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:343
msgid ""
"These types of benefits count as deductions *after* taxes are calculated. "
"They appear towards the end of the payslip before the net amount is "
"displayed. Currently, only one field, :guilabel:`ROTH 401(k)` appears in "
"this section. Enter either a percentage (%) of the payslip amount, or a "
"specific dollar amount per payslip ($/slip) being deducted from the "
"employee's pay, and deposited into a ROTH 401(k) account."
msgstr ""
"Estos tipos de beneficios cuentan como deducciones *después* de que se "
"calculan los impuestos. Aparecen hacia el final de la nómina antes de que se "
"muestre el monto neto. Actualmente, solo un campo, :guilabel:`ROTH 401(k)`, "
"aparece en esta sección. Introduce un porcentaje (%) del monto de la nómina, "
"o una cantidad específica en dólares por nómina ($/nómina) que se deduce del "
"pago del empleado y se deposita en una cuenta ROTH 401(k)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:352
msgid ""
"Several sections within the **Payroll** app installs a Salary Structure, "
"Structure Type, Rules, and Parameters specific to the United States."
msgstr ""
"Varias secciones dentro de la aplicación **Nómina** instalan una Estructura "
"Salarial, Tipo de Estructura, Reglas y Parámetros específicos para Estados "
"Unidos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:358
msgid ""
"When the **l10n_us_hr_payroll** module is :ref:`installed <payroll/"
"usa_apps>`, a new :guilabel:`Salary Structure` gets "
"installed, :guilabel:`United States: Regular Pay`. This structure includes "
"one :guilabel:`Structure Type`, :guilabel:`United States: Regular Pay`."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el módulo **l10n_us_hr_payroll** está :ref:`instalado <payroll/"
"usa_apps>`, se instala una nueva :guilabel:`Estructura "
"Salarial`, :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: Pago Regular`. Esta estructura incluye "
"un :guilabel:`Tipo de Estructura`, :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: Pago Regular`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:373
msgid ""
"To view the salary rules that inform the salary structure what to do, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structures` "
"and expand the :guilabel:`United States: Employee` group to reveal "
"the :guilabel:`United States: Regular Pay` structure type. "
"Click :guilabel:`United States: Regular Pay` to view the detailed salary "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"Para ver las reglas salariales que informan a la estructura salarial qué "
"hacer, navega a :menuselection:`aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> "
"Estructuras` y expande el grupo :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: Empleado` para "
"revelar el tipo de estructura :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: Pago Regular`. Haz "
"clic en :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: Pago Regular` para ver las reglas "
"salariales detalladas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:381
msgid ""
"Each rule defines how pay is calculated, taking into account factors such as "
"commissions, bonuses, taxes, and insurance. The *logic* behind "
"the :guilabel:`United States: Regular Pay` rules is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Cada regla define cómo se calcula el pago, teniendo en cuenta factores como "
"comisiones, bonificaciones, impuestos y seguros. La *lógica* detrás de las "
"reglas :guilabel:`Estados Unidos: Pago Regular` es la siguiente:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:385
msgid ""
"The first four rules listed reflects all sources of income, including the "
"basic wage listed on the contract (:guilabel:`Basic Salary`), plus any "
"allowances, such as :guilabel:`Commissions`, :guilabel:`Tips`, "
"and :guilabel:`Bonuses`."
msgstr ""
"Las primeras cuatro reglas listadas reflejan todas las fuentes de ingresos, "
"incluido el salario básico indicado en el contrato (:guilabel:`Salario "
"Básico`), más cualquier asignación, "
"como :guilabel:`Comisiones`, :guilabel:`Propinas` "
"y :guilabel:`Bonificaciones`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:389
msgid "The basic salary rules for the US localization."
msgstr "Las reglas de salario básico para la localización de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:392
msgid ""
"Adding up these inputs is how the gross salary (:guilabel:`Gross Pay`) is "
"calculated. This amount is the base amount used to calculate payroll taxes."
msgstr ""
"Sumar estos valores es cómo se calcula el salario bruto (:guilabel:`Pago "
"Bruto`). Esta cantidad es el monto base utilizado para calcular los "
"impuestos sobre la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:395
msgid ""
"The next set of rules are the various pre-tax benefits and taxable income, "
"such as :guilabel:`Medical` insurance contributions and :guilabel:`Commuter "
"Benefits`. After the employee's :guilabel:`Gross Pay` is calculated, Odoo "
"deducts all the pre-tax benefits listed on the employee's contract to "
"determine the employee's :guilabel:`Taxable Income`."
msgstr ""
"El siguiente conjunto de reglas son los diversos beneficios antes de "
"impuestos e ingresos imponibles, como las contribuciones al "
"seguro :guilabel:`Médico` y los :guilabel:`Beneficios de Transporte`. "
"Después de que se calcula el :guilabel:`Pago Bruto` del empleado, Odoo "
"deduce todos los beneficios antes de impuestos listados en el contrato del "
"empleado para determinar los :guilabel:`Ingresos Imponibles` del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:400
msgid "The pre-tax rules for the US localization."
msgstr "Las reglas antes de impuestos para la localización de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:403
msgid ""
"Next, all the various tax rules are listed where both federal and state "
"payroll withholdings are outlined. First, federal tax rules are listed, then "
"any state rules (if any) are listed."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, se listan todas las diversas reglas fiscales donde se "
"detallan las retenciones de nómina tanto federales como estatales. Primero "
"se listan las reglas fiscales federales, luego se listan las reglas "
"estatales (si las hay)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:406
msgid "The federal tax rules for the US localization."
msgstr "Las reglas fiscales federales para la localización de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:410
msgid ""
"The rule for federal withholdings for `Worker's Compensation` appears "
"*after* several state-specific withholdings are listed, and does **not** "
"appear in the above image, but are listed in the rules."
msgstr ""
"La regla para las retenciones federales de `Compensación de Trabajadores` "
"aparece *después* de que se listan varias retenciones específicas del "
"estado, y **no** aparece en la imagen anterior, pero están listadas en las "
"reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:414
msgid "The last rules listed are the post-tax employee deductions."
msgstr ""
"Las últimas reglas listadas son las deducciones del empleado después de "
"impuestos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:416
msgid "The post-tax rules for the US localization."
msgstr "Las reglas después de impuestos para la localización de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:419
msgid ""
"The *Other Inputs* tab contains anything else affecting payroll. This "
"includes items to be added to the payslip, such as :guilabel:`Tips`, and "
"other deductions, such as :guilabel:`Child Support`."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña :guilabel:`Otros Datos` contiene cualquier otra cosa que afecte "
"la nómina. Esto incluye elementos que se agregarán a la nómina, como "
":guilabel:`Propinas`, y otras deducciones, como :guilabel:`Manutención de "
"Hijos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:422
msgid "The other inputs for the US localization."
msgstr "Los otros datos para la localización de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:425
msgid ""
"The employee's net salary is the amount the employee receives from the "
"employer. The formula to calculate the net salary is:"
msgstr ""
"El salario neto del empleado es la cantidad que el empleado recibe del "
"empleador. La fórmula para calcular el salario neto es:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:428
msgid ""
"\\text{Gross Salary} + \\text{Allowances} - \\text{Payroll Taxes} - "
"\\text{General Deductions}"
msgstr ""
"\\text{Salario bruto} + \\text{Prestaciones} - \\text{Impuestos de nómina} - "
"\\text{Deducciones generales}"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:432
msgid ""
"Additionally, an extra section exists in payroll calculation for the US "
"called `Employer Deductions`, and it breaks down the payments the employer "
"must make as their portion of payroll taxes."
msgstr ""
"Además, existe una sección adicional en el cálculo de nómina para EE. UU. "
"llamada `Deducciones del empleador`, que desglosa los pagos que el empleador "
"debe realizar como su parte de los impuestos de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:436
msgid "The employer deduction rules for the US localization."
msgstr "Las reglas de deducción del empleador para la localización de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:440
msgid ""
"The rule for employer deductions for `Worker's Compensation` appears *after* "
"several state-specific employer deductions are listed, and does **not** "
"appear in the above image, but are listed in the rules."
msgstr ""
"La regla para deducciones del empleador para `Compensación del trabajador` "
"aparece *después* de que se enumeran varias deducciones del empleador "
"específicas del estado, y **no** aparece en la imagen anterior, pero están "
"listadas en las reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:451
msgid ""
"The wage base for Social Security tax calculations has a cap for 2025, "
"accounted for in the `US: FICA OASDI Cap` parameter."
msgstr ""
"La base salarial para los cálculos del impuesto de Seguro Social tiene un "
"tope para 2025, contabilizado en el parámetro `US: FICA OASDI Cap`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:463
msgid ""
"The Unemployment tax of a company is different from the one added by default "
"in Odoo. To update this, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Rule Parameters`, then, filter the results by :abbr:`FUTA "
"(Federal Unemployment Tax Act)`, or the name of the state that needs "
"editing, and edit the corresponding rate from the list."
msgstr ""
"El impuesto de desempleo de una empresa es diferente del que se agrega por "
"defecto en Odoo. Para actualizarlo, navega a :menuselection:`aplicación "
"Nómina --> Configuración --> Parámetros de reglas`, luego, filtra los "
"resultados por :abbr:`FUTA (Ley Federal del Impuesto de Desempleo)`, o el "
"nombre del estado que necesita editarse, y edita la tasa correspondiente de "
"la lista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:469
msgid ""
"Odoo adds updated rule parameters for the current calendar year. It is "
"**not** recommended to edit rule parameters **unless a federal or state "
"parameter has changed**, and is different from the rule parameters created "
"by Odoo. Check with all local and national regulations *before* making any "
"changes to rule parameters."
msgstr ""
"Odoo agrega parámetros de reglas actualizados para el año calendario actual. "
"**No** se recomienda editar los parámetros de reglas **a menos que un "
"parámetro federal o estatal haya cambiado**, y sea diferente de los "
"parámetros de reglas creados por Odoo. Verifica todas las regulaciones "
"locales y nacionales *antes* de realizar cualquier cambio en los parámetros "
"de reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:475
msgid "Run US payroll"
msgstr "Ejecutar nómina de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:477
msgid ""
"Before running paypoll, the payroll officer must validate "
"employee :doc:`work entries <../work_entries>` to confirm pay accuracy and "
"catch errors. This includes checking that all time off is approved and any "
"overtime is appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Antes de ejecutar la nómina, el responsable de nómina debe validar "
"las :doc:`entradas de trabajo <../work_entries>` de los empleados para "
"confirmar la precisión del pago y detectar errores. Esto incluye verificar "
"que todas las ausencias estén aprobadas y que cualquier hora extra sea "
"apropiada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:519
msgid ""
"In the United States, payroll taxes and wage reporting are generally based "
"on the date wages are *paid*, **not** when the work was performed. For this "
"reason, Odoo uses the payment date as the reference date for U.S. Payroll "
"when calculating salary rules, applying tax parameters and annual limits, "
"and determining year-to-date amounts. This helps ensure payroll calculations "
"align with U.S. tax and reporting requirements."
msgstr ""
"En Estados Unidos, los impuestos sobre la nómina y la declaración de "
"salarios se basan por lo general en la fecha en que se *pagan* los salarios, "
"**no** en la que se realizó el trabajo. Por esta razón, Odoo toma la fecha "
"de pago como fecha de referencia para la nómina de EE. UU. al calcular las "
"reglas salariales, aplicar los parámetros fiscales y límites anuales, y "
"determinar los importes acumulados en lo que va de año. Esto ayuda a "
"garantizar que los cálculos de la nómina se ajusten a los requisitos "
"fiscales y de información de EE. UU."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:528
msgid ""
"The accounting process when running payroll has two "
"components: :ref:`creating journal entries <payroll/journal>`, "
"and :ref:`registering payments <payroll/register>`."
msgstr ""
"El proceso contable al ejecutar la nómina tiene dos componentes: :ref:`crear "
"asientos contables <payroll/journal>`, y :ref:`registrar pagos <payroll/"
"register>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:546
msgid ""
"Four accounts from the US :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` are included with "
"the payroll localization:"
msgstr ""
"Cuatro cuentas del :abbr:`plan de cuentas` de EE. UU. están incluidas con la "
"localización de nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:549
msgid ""
"`611000 Salaries & Wages`: Records gross salary and the employer's portion "
"of payroll expenses. Also groups values from rules without specific accounts "
"(e.g., company-specific benefits)."
msgstr ""
"`611000 Salarios y sueldos`: Registra el salario bruto y la porción del "
"empleador de los gastos de nómina. También agrupa valores de reglas sin "
"cuentas específicas (p. ej., beneficios específicos de la empresa)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:551
msgid ""
"`230100 Employee Payroll Taxes`: Withheld taxes from employees, which the "
"employer must file and pay. The partner and label columns of the journal "
"entry indicate the specific tax."
msgstr ""
"`230100 Impuestos de nómina del empleado`: Impuestos retenidos a los "
"empleados, que el empleador debe presentar y pagar. Las columnas de empresa "
"y etiqueta del asiento contable indican el impuesto específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:553
msgid ""
"`230200 Employer Payroll Taxes`: Employer portion of payroll taxes to be "
"filed and paid. The partner and label columns of the journal entry indicate "
"the specific tax."
msgstr ""
"`230200 Impuestos de nómina del empleador`: Porción del empleador de los "
"impuestos de nómina a presentar y pagar. Las columnas de empresa y etiqueta "
"del asiento contable indican el impuesto específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:555
msgid "`230000 Salary Payable`: Net salary owed to the employee."
msgstr "`230000 Salario por pagar`: Salario neto adeudado al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:558
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` configuration is done by default when a "
"company is located in the US. The account codes and names can be edited to "
"suit the company's needs. If there is no :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` "
"account associated with a salary rule (used in a salary structure), Odoo "
"uses the account `Salary Expenses` to create the journal entry, regardless "
"of the nature of the move."
msgstr ""
"La configuración del :abbr:`plan de cuentas` se realiza por defecto cuando "
"una empresa se encuentra en EE. UU. Los códigos y nombres de cuenta pueden "
"editarse para adaptarse a las necesidades de la empresa. Si no hay una "
"cuenta del :abbr:`plan de cuentas` asociada con una regla salarial "
"(utilizada en una estructura salarial), Odoo utiliza la cuenta `Gastos de "
"salario` para crear el asiento contable, independientemente de la naturaleza "
"del movimiento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:577
msgid ""
"To generate payments from payslips,employee's **must** have a *trusted* bank "
"account. If the employee's bank account is *not* marked as `trusted`, NACHA "
"files **cannot** be generated through Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Para generar pagos desde nóminas, los empleados **deben** tener una cuenta "
"bancaria *de confianza*. Si la cuenta bancaria del empleado *no* está "
"marcada como `de confianza`, los archivos NACHA **no pueden** generarse a "
"través de Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:594
msgid ""
"The US localization contains several reports unique to the US, which provide "
"tax information for employees, as well as the ability to integrate with "
"outside organizations such as ADP."
msgstr ""
"La localización de EE. UU. contiene varios informes exclusivos de EE. UU. "
"que proporcionan información fiscal para empleados, así como la capacidad de "
"integrarse con organizaciones externas como ADP."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:598
msgid "W2 Report"
msgstr "Informe W2"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:600
msgid ""
"The *W2 Report* provides a CSV file that allows employees to e-file their W2 "
"report with third-party software. To access this report, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll -> Reporting -> United States -> W2`."
msgstr ""
"El *Informe W2* proporciona un archivo CSV que permite a los empleados "
"presentar electrónicamente su informe W2 con software de terceros. Para "
"acceder a este informe, navega a :menuselection:`Nómina -> Informes -> "
"Estados Unidos -> W2`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:604
msgid ""
"To create a W2 form, click :guilabel:`New`, and a blank *Create W2 Form* "
"page loads. Set the :guilabel:`Start Date` and :guilabel:`End Date` "
"(typically a calendar year), and select the :guilabel:`Company`, if in a "
"multi-company database."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un formulario W2, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y se carga una "
"página en blanco :guilabel:`Crear formulario W2`. Establece la "
":guilabel:`Fecha de inicio` y la :guilabel:`Fecha de finalización` "
"(normalmente un año natural) y selecciona la :guilabel:`Compañía`, si estás "
"en una base de datos multiempresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:608
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:630
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:652
msgid ""
"All pay runs for the time period appear in a list view. To add any missing "
"pay runs, click :guilabel:`Add a line` at the bottom of the list, and select "
"the missing files."
msgstr ""
"Todas las ejecuciones de pago del período de tiempo aparecen en una vista de "
"lista. Para añadir cualquier ejecución de pago que falte, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Añadir una línea` en la parte inferior de la lista y "
"selecciona los archivos que faltan."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:611
msgid ""
"When done, click the :guilabel:`Generate` button to create a CSV file with a "
"summary of all payroll related payments made during the specified time "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Cuando hayas terminado, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Generar` para crear "
"un archivo CSV con un resumen de todos los pagos relacionados con la nómina "
"realizados durante el período de tiempo especificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:614
msgid "The W2 report screen, with the file to download in the top half."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla del informe W2, con el archivo para descargar en la mitad "
"superior."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:618
msgid "Form 941"
msgstr "Formulario 941"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:620
msgid ""
"The *Form 941* report is meant to inform the government of the amount of "
"federal income tax, :abbr:`FICA (Federal Insurance Contributions Act)` taxes "
"(Medicare and Social Security) withheld from employee paychecks. It also "
"reports the employee's side of taxes."
msgstr ""
"El informe *Formulario 941* tiene como objetivo informar al gobierno sobre "
"la cantidad de impuesto federal sobre la renta, los impuestos :abbr:`FICA "
"(Ley de Contribuciones al Seguro Federal)` (Medicare y Seguro Social) "
"retenidos de los cheques de pago de los empleados. También informa sobre la "
"parte de impuestos del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:624
msgid ""
"To create this report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll -> Reporting -> "
"United States -> Form 941`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a "
"new :guilabel:`Form 941` report page loads. Configure the information on the "
"top portion of the form, including the :guilabel:`Company`, :guilabel:`Tax "
"Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`IRS Payment Option` (how the money is "
"being sent to the IRS), and :guilabel:`Deposit Schedule and Tax Liability` "
"(how often payments are made to the IRS)."
msgstr ""
"Para crear este informe, navega a :menuselection:`Nómina -> Informes -> "
"Estados Unidos -> Formulario 941`. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo` y "
"se carga una nueva página de informe :guilabel:`Formulario 941`. Configura "
"la información en la parte superior del formulario, incluyendo "
"la :guilabel:`Compañía`, el :guilabel:`Año fiscal`, "
"el :guilabel:`Trimestre`, la :guilabel:`Opción de pago del IRS` (cómo se "
"envía el dinero al IRS) y el :guilabel:`Programa de depósito y "
"responsabilidad fiscal` (con qué frecuencia se realizan los pagos al IRS)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:633
msgid ""
"When done, click :guilabel:`Generate`, and the report is created as a CSV "
"file, and appears on the :guilabel:`Form 941` report dashboard. Companies "
"then download and submit this report through a third party for e-filing."
msgstr ""
"Cuando hayas terminado, haz clic en :guilabel:`Generar` y el informe se crea "
"como un archivo CSV y aparece en el tablero de "
"informes :guilabel:`Formulario 941`. Las empresas luego descargan y envían "
"este informe a través de un tercero para su presentación electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:637
msgid "The 941 report screen, with the file to download in the top half."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla del informe 941, con el archivo para descargar en la mitad "
"superior."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:641
msgid "Form 940"
msgstr "Formulario 940"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:643
msgid ""
"The *Form 940* report details the annual :abbr:`FUTA (Federal Unemployment "
"Tax Act)` withheld for payroll."
msgstr ""
"El informe *Formulario 940* detalla el :abbr:`FUTA (Ley Federal del Impuesto "
"de Desempleo)` anual retenido para la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:646
msgid ""
"To create this report, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll -> Reporting -> "
"United States -> Form 940`. Click the :guilabel:`New` button, and a "
"new :guilabel:`Form 940` report page loads. Configure the information on the "
"top portion of the form, including the :guilabel:`Company`, :guilabel:`Tax "
"Year`, :guilabel:`Single State Payer`, :guilabel:`Multi State "
"Employer`, :guilabel:`Paid in Credit Reduction State`, and :guilabel:`IRS "
"Payment Option` (how the money is being sent to the IRS)."
msgstr ""
"Para crear este informe, navega a :menuselection:`Nómina -> Informes -> "
"Estados Unidos -> Formulario 940`. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo` y "
"se carga una nueva página de informe :guilabel:`Formulario 940`. Configura "
"la información en la parte superior del formulario, incluyendo "
"la :guilabel:`Compañía`, el :guilabel:`Año fiscal`, :guilabel:`Pagador de un "
"solo estado`, :guilabel:`Empleador de múltiples estados`, :guilabel:`Pagado "
"en estado de reducción de crédito` y la :guilabel:`Opción de pago del IRS` "
"(cómo se envía el dinero al IRS)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:655
msgid ""
"When done, click :guilabel:`Generate`, and the report is created as a CSV "
"file, and appears on the :guilabel:`Form 940` report dashboard. Companies "
"then download and submit this report through a third party for e-filing."
msgstr ""
"Cuando hayas terminado, haz clic en :guilabel:`Generar` y el informe se crea "
"como un archivo CSV y aparece en el tablero de "
"informes :guilabel:`Formulario 940`. Las empresas luego descargan y envían "
"este informe a través de un tercero para su presentación electrónica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:659
msgid "The 940 report screen, with the file to download in the top half."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla del informe 940, con el archivo para descargar en la mitad "
"superior."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:665
msgid "Export data to ADP"
msgstr "Exportar datos a ADP"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:667
msgid ""
"The *ADP Export* report generates a CSV file that can be submitted to ADP, "
"which then makes payments to the employees."
msgstr ""
"El informe *Exportación ADP* genera un archivo CSV que se puede enviar a "
"ADP, que luego realiza los pagos a los empleados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:670
msgid ""
"The CSV file summarizes the employee's worked hours during a specified time "
"period, correlating to their salary or hourly wage. The report is generated "
"from :doc:`work entry <../work_entries>` *after* any time off is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"El archivo CSV resume las horas trabajadas del empleado durante un período "
"de tiempo especificado, correlacionándolas con su salario o pago por hora. "
"El informe se genera a partir de :doc:`entradas de trabajo <../"
"work_entries>` *después* de que se confirme cualquier ausencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:674
msgid ""
"The export format is meant to match with the ADP format. Since companies can "
"customize their portal and may require some changes, the data is there to be "
"fed to ADP to run payroll in it."
msgstr ""
"El formato de exportación está diseñado para coincidir con el formato ADP. "
"Dado que las empresas pueden personalizar su portal y pueden requerir "
"algunos cambios, los datos están ahí para alimentar a ADP y ejecutar la "
"nómina en él."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:678
msgid ""
"To access the ADP Export report, the `United States - Payroll - Export to "
"ADP` module **must** be :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Para acceder al informe de Exportación ADP, el módulo `United States - "
"Payroll - Export to ADP` **debe** estar :ref:`instalado <general/install>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:682
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:684
msgid ""
"To export data to ADP, the company **must** have an ADP code configured in "
"the company settings. Navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. In the *US Localization* section, enter "
"the :guilabel:`ADP Code` in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"Para exportar datos a ADP, la empresa **debe** tener un código ADP "
"configurado en los ajustes de la empresa. Ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación "
"Nómina --> Configuración --> Ajustes`. En la sección *US Localization*, "
"introduce el :guilabel:`Código ADP` en el campo correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:688
msgid ""
"Next, work entry types **must** have the correct ADP code listed in "
"the :ref:`External Code field <payroll/new-work-entry-type>` for each work "
"entry type that is being referenced."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, los tipos de entradas de trabajo **deben** tener el código "
"ADP correcto indicado en el :ref:`campo Código externo <payroll/new-work-"
"entry-type>` para cada tipo de entrada de trabajo al que se haga referencia."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:691
msgid ""
"Lastly, every employee **must** have an ADP code entered on their employee "
"form. To add this code, open the :menuselection:`Employees` app, click an "
"employee record, and click into the *Payroll* tab. In the *ADP Information* "
"section, enter the :guilabel:`ADP Code` in the corresponding field."
msgstr ""
"Por último, cada empleado **debe** tener un código ADP introducido en su "
"formulario de empleado. Para añadir este código, abre la aplicación "
":menuselection:`Empleados`, haz clic en el registro de un empleado y accede "
"a la pestaña *Nómina*. En la sección *Información de ADP*, introduce el "
":guilabel:`Código ADP` en el campo correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:695
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`ADP Code` is how ADP identifies that particular employee, and "
"is typically a six-digit number."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`código ADP` es la forma en la que ADP identifica a ese "
"empleado particular y usualmente es un número de seis dígitos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:699
msgid "Export data"
msgstr "Exportar datos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:701
msgid ""
"Once :doc:`work entries <../work_entries>` have been verified, the "
"information is exported to a CSV file, which is uploaded into ADP."
msgstr ""
"Una vez verificadas las :doc:`entradas de trabajo <../work_entries>`, la "
"información se exporta a un archivo CSV que se sube a ADP."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:704
msgid ""
"To export the data, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Reporting --"
"> ADP Export`, then click :guilabel:`New`. Next, enter the :guilabel:`Start "
"Date` and :guilabel:`End Date` for the work entries using the calendar pop-"
"over."
msgstr ""
"Para exportar los datos, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> "
"Informes --> Exportación de ADP` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo`. A "
"continuación, introduce la :guilabel:`Fecha de inicio` y la :guilabel:`Fecha "
"de fin` para las entradas de trabajo mediante la ventana emergente del "
"calendario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:708
msgid ""
"Then, enter a :guilabel:`Batch ID` in the corresponding field. The "
"recommendation for this field is to enter the date in a `YY-MM-DD` format, "
"followed by any other characters to distinguish that specific pay run, such "
"as a department name."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, introduce un :guilabel:`ID de lote` en el campo "
"correspondiente. Se recomienda introducir en este campo la fecha en formato "
"`YY-MM-DD`, seguida de cualquier otro carácter que distinga ese "
"procesamiento de nóminas específico, como el nombre de un departamento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:712
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Batch Description` in the corresponding field. This "
"should be short and descriptive, but distinct from the name of the pay run."
msgstr ""
"Introduce una :guilabel:`Descripción del lote` en el campo correspondiente. "
"Debe ser breve y descriptiva, pero diferente del nombre del procesamiento de "
"nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:715
msgid ""
"Ensure the correct company populates the :guilabel:`Company` field. Change "
"the selected company with the drop-down menu, if needed."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrese de que en el campo :guilabel:`Empresa` esté la empresa correcta. "
"Cambie la empresa seleccionada en el menú desplegable, si necesita."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:718
msgid ""
"Lastly, add the employee's work entry information to the list. "
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` and an *Add: Employee* pop-up window loads. The "
"list can be :doc:`filtered <../../../essentials/search>` to find the "
"employees to add to the list."
msgstr ""
"Por último, añade la información de la entrada de trabajo del empleado a la "
"lista. Haz clic en :guilabel:`Añadir una línea` y se abrirá la ventana "
"emergente *Añadir: Empleado*. Puedes :doc:`filtrar <../../../essentials/"
"search>` la lista para encontrar a los empleados que quieras añadir."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:723
msgid ""
"Process the data export in multiple groups instead of in one large group "
"that contains all employees. This helps to meaningfully differentiate the "
"batches and makes processing more tenable, overall. The most common ways to "
"group employees is by department, or by wage type (hourly or salaried)."
msgstr ""
"Procese la exportación de datos en varios grupos en lugar de en un grupo "
"largo que contenga a todos los empleados. Esto ayuda a diferenciar entre los "
"lotes y hace que el procesamiento sea más sostenible en general. Las formas "
"más comunes de agrupar empleados es por departamento, o por tipo de salario "
"(por hora o sueldo)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:728
msgid ""
"Select the employees to add to the list by clicking the box to the left of "
"their name. Once all desired employees have been selected, click "
"the :guilabel:`Select` button in the corner, and the employees appear in the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona los empleados que quieras añadir a la lista marcando la casilla "
"situada a la izquierda de su nombre. Cuando hayas seleccionado a todos los "
"empleados deseados, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Seleccionar` de la "
"esquina y los empleados aparecerán en la lista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:732
msgid "To create the CSV file, click the :guilabel:`Generate` button."
msgstr "Para crear el archivo CSV, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Generar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/united_states.rst:735
msgid ":ref:`ACH - electronic transfers <l10n_us/ach-electronic-transfers>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACH: transferencias electrónicas <l10n_us/ach-electronic-transfers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Payslips* are individual records of payment, containing all the details of "
"how the pay was calculated (hours, deductions, other inputs, etc.), and "
"generated by payroll officers through the **Payroll** app. Payslips can be "
"created and processed individually, or multiple payslips can be processed at "
"one time, in a single batch, referred to in Odoo as :doc:`pay runs "
"<pay_runs>`."
msgstr ""
"*Las nóminas* son registros individuales de pago que contienen todos los "
"detalles sobre cómo se calculó el importe (horas, deducciones, otras "
"entradas, etc.) y que los responsables de nóminas generan mediante la "
"aplicación **Nómina**. Las nóminas se pueden crear y procesar "
"individualmente, o se pueden procesar varias nóminas a la vez en un solo "
"lote, lo que en Odoo se conoce como :doc:`lotes de nóminas <pay_runs>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:13
msgid "Create a payslip"
msgstr "Crear una nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:15
msgid ""
"To create a new payslip, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Payslips --> Payslips`, and the *Employee Payslips* dashboard loads. Click "
"the :guilabel:`New Off-Cycle` button in the corner, and a blank payslip form "
"loads. Fill out the following information on the payslip form:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear una nueva nómina, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> "
"Nóminas --> Nóminas` y se cargará el tablero de *Nóminas de los empleados*. "
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo fuera de ciclo` de la esquina y se "
"cargará un formulario de nómina en blanco. Completa la siguiente información "
"en el formulario de nómina:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:19
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Select the employee being paid using the drop-down "
"menu. This field is **required**. Once a selection is made, other fields may "
"auto-populate according to the employee record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empleado`: selecciona al empleado al que se le va a pagar "
"mediante el menú desplegable. Este campo es **obligatorio**. Una vez hecha "
"la selección, otros campos pueden completarse automáticamente según el "
"registro del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:24
msgid ""
"It is recommended to **only** create payslips for employees that are already "
"in the database. If there is no current employee record, and therefore no "
"employee contract, it is recommended to create the new employee in the "
"**Employees** application *before* creating payslips for that employee. "
"Refer to the :doc:`new employee <../employees/new_employee>` documentation "
"for instructions on how to add an employee."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda crear nóminas **solo** para empleados que ya estén en la base "
"de datos. Si no existe un registro de empleado actual (y por lo tanto no hay "
"contrato de empleado), se recomienda crear el nuevo empleado en la "
"aplicación **Empleados** *antes* de crear nóminas para ese empleado. "
"Consulta la documentación de :doc:`nuevo empleado <../employees/new_employee>"
"` para obtener instrucciones sobre cómo añadir un empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee Record`: The date the current contract began for the "
"selected employee automatically populates this field. This field is "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Registro del empleado`: la fecha de inicio del contrato actual "
"del empleado seleccionado completa automáticamente este campo. Este campo es "
"**obligatorio**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:34
msgid ""
"All employees are **required** to have a contract in order to generate "
"payslips. Additionally, *only one* contract can be in the running stage for "
"each employee. Therefore the current contract start date populates this "
"field, and it is **not** recommended to make changes to this field."
msgstr ""
"Es **obligatorio** que todos los empleados tengan un contrato para poder "
"generar nóminas. Además, *solo un* contrato puede estar en vigor para cada "
"empleado. Por lo tanto, la fecha de inicio del contrato actual completa este "
"campo y **no** se recomienda modificarlo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Run`: Select the pay run this new payslip should be added to, "
"if applicable, using the drop-down menu. For individual payslips not related "
"to a pay run, leave this field blank."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lote de nóminas`: selecciona en el menú desplegable el lote de "
"nóminas al que se debe añadir esta nueva nómina, si corresponde. En el caso "
"de las nóminas individuales no asociadas a un lote de nóminas, deja este "
"campo en blanco."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:41
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Structure`: The structure linked to the employee's contract auto-"
"populates this field by default. If desired, use the drop-down menu to "
"select a different structure."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estructura`: la estructura vinculada al contrato del empleado "
"completa automáticamente este campo de forma predeterminada. Si lo deseas, "
"usa el menú desplegable para seleccionar una estructura diferente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Period`: The start and end dates of the pay period. The first and "
"last days of the *current* month auto-populate the two :guilabel:`Period` "
"fields by default. The dates can be changed, if desired."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Periodo`: las fechas de inicio y fin del periodo de pago. El "
"primer y último día del mes *actual* completan automáticamente los dos "
"campos :guilabel:`Periodo` por defecto. Puedes cambiar las fechas si lo "
"deseas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:47
msgid ""
"To change the start or end date, click on the first date in "
"the :guilabel:`Period` field to reveal a pop-up calendar. Navigate to the "
"desired month, and click on the desired day to select that specific date. "
"These fields are **required**."
msgstr ""
"Para cambiar la fecha de inicio o de fin, haz clic en la primera fecha del "
"campo :guilabel:`Periodo` para abrir un calendario emergente. Navega hasta "
"el mes deseado y haz clic en el día correspondiente para seleccionar esa "
"fecha en concreto. Estos campos son **obligatorios**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:52
msgid ""
"If modifications to auto-populated fields are made, it is recommended to "
"check with the accounting department to ensure every entry that affects the "
"**Accounting** app is correct."
msgstr ""
"Si realizas modificaciones en los campos completados automáticamente, te "
"recomendamos consultar con el departamento de contabilidad para asegurarte "
"de que cada apunte que afecte a la aplicación **Contabilidad** sea correcto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:55
msgid ""
"The top fields for a new payslip all filled out for a September payslip."
msgstr ""
"Los campos superiores de una nueva nómina cumplimentados para una nómina de "
"septiembre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:61
msgid "Worked days tab"
msgstr "Pestaña Días trabajados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:63
msgid ""
"The *Worked Days* tab lists the number of days and hours the employee worked "
"during the :guilabel:`Period` specified at the top portion of the payslip "
"form. This tab is automatically populated with all the individual attendance "
"records for the time period, including both worked time and any time off "
"taken."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña *Días trabajados* muestra el número de días y horas que el "
"empleado ha trabajado durante el :guilabel:`Periodo` especificado en la "
"parte superior del formulario de la nómina. Esta pestaña se completa "
"automáticamente con todos los registros individuales de asistencia del "
"periodo, tanto el tiempo trabajado como las ausencias disfrutadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:68
msgid "Each individual entry lists:"
msgstr "Cada entrada individual muestra:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:70
msgid "The :guilabel:`Type` of entry"
msgstr "El :guilabel:`Tipo` de entrada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:71
msgid "A :guilabel:`Description`"
msgstr "Una :guilabel:`Descripción`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:72
msgid "The number of :guilabel:`Days` worked"
msgstr "El número de :guilabel:`Días` trabajados"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:73
msgid "The total :guilabel:`Hours`"
msgstr "El total de :guilabel:`Horas`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:74
msgid "The :guilabel:`Amount` earned"
msgstr "El :guilabel:`Importe` devengado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:76
msgid ""
"Additional records **cannot** be created for the *Worked Days* tab as it is "
"auto-populated according to the employee's attendance records or working "
"schedule on their :ref:`employee record <employees/work-info-tab>`."
msgstr ""
"**No** puedes crear registros adicionales en la pestaña *Días trabajados*, "
"ya que se completa automáticamente según los registros de asistencia o el "
"horario de trabajo del empleado en su :ref:`registro de empleado <employees/"
"work-info-tab>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:80
msgid "The attendance and time off entries in the worked days tab."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas de asistencia y ausencias en la pestaña de días trabajados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:84
msgid ""
"Adjusting work entries can be done on the *Work Entry* :doc:`dashboard "
"<work_entries>` or in the :doc:`Attendances app <../attendances>`."
msgstr ""
"Puedes ajustar las entradas de trabajo en el :doc:`tablero <work_entries>` "
"de *Entradas de trabajo* o en la :doc:`aplicación Asistencias <../"
"attendances>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:90
msgid "Salary inputs tab"
msgstr "Pestaña Entradas de salario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:92
msgid ""
"The *Salary Inputs* tab automatically lists all running :doc:`salary "
"adjustments <salary_attachments>` and other additional inputs such as tips, "
"bonuses, etc."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña *Entradas de salario* muestra automáticamente todos los "
":doc:`ajustes salariales <salary_attachments>` activos y otras entradas "
"adicionales como propinas, bonificaciones, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:95
msgid "Each salary input lists:"
msgstr "Cada entrada de salario muestra:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:97
msgid "The :guilabel:`Type` of input"
msgstr "El :guilabel:`Tipo` de entrada"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:98
msgid "The :guilabel:`Note` related to it"
msgstr "La :guilabel:`Nota` correspondiente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:99
msgid "The :guilabel:`Amount`"
msgstr "El :guilabel:`Importe`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:101
msgid ""
"To manually add an additional salary input, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"and a blank line appears in the tab. Select the :guilabel:`Type` using the "
"drop-down menu. Add any relevant :guilabel:`Notes` to the corresponding "
"field, then enter the :guilabel:`Amount`."
msgstr ""
"Para añadir manualmente una entrada salarial adicional, haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Agregar una línea` y aparecerá una línea en blanco en la pestaña. "
"Selecciona el :guilabel:`Tipo` mediante el menú desplegable. Añade las "
":guilabel:`Notas` pertinentes en el campo correspondiente y, a continuación, "
"introduce el :guilabel:`Importe`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:105
msgid "The salary inputs tab with a salary attachment and commission added."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña de entradas salariales con un embargo salarial y una comisión "
"añadidos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:113
msgid ""
"The *Salary Computation* tab calculates each individual salary rule. This "
"includes everything from the employee's salary to all the deductions and "
"allowances associated with the installed :doc:`payroll localization "
"<payroll_localizations>`, such as taxes, expenses, benefit contributions, "
"and any other items."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña *Cálculo del salario* calcula cada regla salarial individual. "
"Esto incluye desde el salario del empleado hasta todas las deducciones y "
"complementos asociados a la :doc:`localización de nómina "
"<payroll_localizations>` instalada, tales como impuestos, gastos, "
"aportaciones a prestaciones y cualquier otro elemento."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:118
msgid ""
"When the payslip is first created, this tab remains blank. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` button in the corner, and the *Salary "
"Computation* tab is populated."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se crea la nómina por primera vez, esta pestaña permanece vacía. Haz "
"clic en el botón :guilabel:`Calcular hoja` situado en la esquina y se "
"completará la pestaña *Cálculo del salario*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:121
msgid ""
"It is **not** possible to make edits to this tab, as the calculations are "
"based on other entries on the payslip."
msgstr ""
"**No** es posible realizar ediciones en esta pestaña, ya que los cálculos se "
"basan en otras entradas de la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:125
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` button does **not** disappear from view after "
"it is clicked, so the payslip can be recalculated at any point prior "
"to :ref:`processing it <payroll/payslips/process>`."
msgstr ""
"El botón :guilabel:`Calcular hoja` no desaparece de la vista después de "
"hacer clic en él, por lo que la nómina se puede recalcular en cualquier "
"momento antes de :ref:`procesarla <payroll/process>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:129
msgid ""
"If any changes need to be made to the :ref:`Worked Days <payroll/payslips/"
"worked-days>` or :ref:`Salary Inputs <payroll/payslips/salary-inputs>` tabs, "
"make the necessary changes, then click the :guilabel:`Compute Sheet` button "
"to recalculate the payslip."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas hacer algún cambio en las pestañas :ref:`Días trabajados "
"<payroll/payslips/worked-days>` o :ref:`Entradas de salario <payroll/"
"payslips/salary-inputs>`, realiza los cambios necesarios y, a continuación, "
"haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Calcular hoja` para volver a calcular la "
"nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:133
msgid "The fields filled out in the salary computation tab."
msgstr "Los campos completados en la pestaña Cálculo del salario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:137
msgid "Other info tab"
msgstr "Pestaña de Otra información"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:139
msgid ""
"The *Other Info* tab displays accounting details that are not used in the "
"*Salary Computation* tab."
msgstr ""
"La pestaña *Otra información* muestra detalles contables que no se utilizan "
"en la pestaña *Cálculo del salario*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:141
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payslip Name` is auto-populated according to the employee "
"name and the time period the payslip is for, in the following format: "
"`Salary Slip - (Employee) - (Month) (Year)`. Make any desired edits to the "
"name in this field. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Nombre de la nómina` se rellena automáticamente según el "
"nombre del empleado y el periodo al que corresponde la nómina, con el "
"siguiente formato: `Salary Slip - (Employee) - (Month) (Year)`. Haz las "
"modificaciones oportunas en el nombre dentro de este campo. Este campo es "
"**obligatorio**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:145
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Company` field is also automatically populated according to "
"the employee's record, and cannot be modified."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Empresa` también se completa automáticamente según el "
"registro del empleado y no se puede modificar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:148
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Payment Date` using the calendar selector in the "
"corresponding field. This is the date payment is issued to the employee. "
"The :guilabel:`Date Account` field is the date the payslip is recorded in "
"the accounting journals. If left blank, the validation date of the payslip "
"is used to determine when the payslip is logged in the accounting journals."
msgstr ""
"Introduce la :guilabel:`Fecha de pago` mediante el selector de calendario en "
"el campo correspondiente. Esta es la fecha en la que se emite el pago al "
"empleado. El campo :guilabel:`Fecha contable` es la fecha en la que se "
"registra la nómina en los diarios contables. Si se deja en blanco, se "
"utiliza la fecha de validación de la nómina para determinar cuándo se "
"asienta la nómina en los diarios contables."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:153
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Salary Journal` field is populated by default, and **cannot** "
"be edited. This is the accounting journal the paycheck is logged in."
msgstr ""
"El campo :guilabel:`Diario de salarios` se completa por defecto y **no se "
"puede** editar. Este es el diario contable en el que se registra el cheque "
"de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:156
msgid ""
"If there are any additional notes or information needed for the payslip, add "
"them to the :guilabel:`Add an Internal Note` field."
msgstr ""
"Si hay notas o información adicional necesaria para la nómina, añádelas al "
"campo :guilabel:`Añadir una nota interna...`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:159
msgid "The fields filled out in the other info tab."
msgstr "Los campos completados en la pestaña Otra información."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:165
msgid "Process a payslip"
msgstr "Procesar una nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:167
msgid ""
"Before processing payslips, check for possible issues concerning payroll. To "
"view all payroll issues, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Dashboard`. The **Payroll** app dashboard loads, including a *Warnings* "
"section that appears in the corner of the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Antes de procesar las nóminas, comprueba si existen posibles incidencias "
"relacionadas con la nómina. Para ver todas las incidencias de nómina, ve a "
":menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Tablero`. Se cargará el tablero de la "
"aplicación **Nómina**, que incluye una sección de *Advertencias* situada en "
"la esquina del tablero."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:171
msgid "The dashboard view of the Payroll app, with the warnings box visible."
msgstr ""
"La vista del tablero de la aplicación Nómina, con el cuadro de advertencias "
"visible."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:174
msgid ""
"Warnings are grouped by type, such as `Employees Without Running Contracts` "
"or `Employees Without Bank account Number`. Click on a warning to view all "
"entries associated with that specific issue."
msgstr ""
"Las advertencias están agrupadas por tipo, como `Empleados sin contratos "
"activos` o `Empleados sin número de cuenta bancaria`. Haga clic en una "
"advertencia para ver todas las entradas asociadas con ese problema en "
"específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:177
msgid ""
"If the warnings are not resolved at any point in the payslip processing "
"process, an error may occur. Errors appear in a pop-up window, providing "
"details for each error and how to resolve them."
msgstr ""
"Si no se resuelven las advertencias en algún punto del procesamiento de las "
"nóminas, puede producirse un error. Los errores aparecen en una ventana "
"emergente que proporciona detalles sobre cada error y cómo solucionarlo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:180
msgid ""
"After all relevant warnings are resolved, and all the necessary information "
"on the payslip is entered, the payslip can be processed. First, the payslip "
"is :ref:`validated <payroll/payslips/validate>`, then a :ref:`payment report "
"<payroll/payslips/payment-report>` is created, the journal entries "
"are :ref:`posted <payroll/payslips/post>`, and finally, the employee "
"is :ref:`paid <payroll/payslips/pay-employee>`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez resueltas todas las advertencias pertinentes y registrada toda la "
"información necesaria en la nómina, se puede procesar la nómina. En primer "
"lugar, la nómina se :ref:`valida <payroll/payslips/validate>`, después se "
"crea un :ref:`informe de pago <payroll/payslips/payment-report>`, los "
"asientos contables se :ref:`publican <payroll/payslips/post>` y, por último, "
"se :ref:`paga al empleado <payroll/payslips/pay-employee>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:189
msgid "Validate the payslip"
msgstr "Validar la nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:191
msgid ""
"Once everything on the payslip form is correct, and the payslip has "
"been :ref:`computed <payroll/payslips/computation>`, click "
"the :guilabel:`Validate` button. A *Confirmation* pop-up window appears, "
"asking :guilabel:`Are you sure you want to proceed?` Click :guilabel:`Ok` to "
"confirm."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que todo sea correcto en el formulario de la nómina y la nómina se "
"haya :ref:`calculado <payroll/payslips/computation>`, haz clic en el botón "
":guilabel:`Validar`. Aparecerá una ventana emergente de *Confirmación* que "
"te preguntará :guilabel:`¿Seguro que quieres continuar?` Haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Aceptar` para confirmar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:196
msgid ""
"Once the payslip is validated, the status changes from :guilabel:`Draft` "
"to :guilabel:`Validated`, and a :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`Journal Entry "
"(Draft)` smart button appears at the top. A PDF of the payslip appears in "
"the sidebar, if the screen is wide enough to display it."
msgstr ""
"Una vez validada la nómina, el estado cambia de :guilabel:`Borrador` a "
":guilabel:`Validado` y aparece un botón inteligente :icon:`fa-usd` "
":guilabel:`Asiento contable (Borrador)` en la parte superior. Aparece un PDF "
"de la nómina en la barra lateral si la pantalla es lo bastante ancha como "
"para mostrarlo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:201
msgid ""
"To email a PDF payslip to the employee, click the :guilabel:`Send By Email` "
"button. The email is sent, and logged in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Para enviar la nómina en formato PDF por correo electrónico al empleado, haz "
"clic en el botón :guilabel:`Enviar por correo electrónico`. El correo "
"electrónico se enviará y quedará registrado en el chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:207
msgid "Generate a payment report"
msgstr "Generar un informe de pagos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:209
msgid ""
"Once the payslip status has changed to :guilabel:`Done`, a payment report "
"must be created. A payment report is a document that contains all the "
"necessary information to transfer the pay earnings from the company's bank "
"account to the employee's bank account. These are submitted by the payroll "
"department to the appropriate institution."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el estado de la nómina cambie a :guilabel:`Hecho`, se debe crear un "
"informe de pago. Un informe de pago es un documento que contiene toda la "
"información necesaria para transferir los importes devengados desde la "
"cuenta bancaria de la empresa a la cuenta bancaria del empleado. El "
"departamento de nómina los envía a la entidad correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:214
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Create Payment Report` button and a *Generate a Payment "
"Report* pop-up window loads. Using the drop-down menu, select "
"the :guilabel:`Export Format` for the payment report. The two default "
"options available are :guilabel:`CSV` "
"and :guilabel:`NACHA`. :guilabel:`NACHA` stands for the :abbr:`National "
"Automated Clearing House Association (NACHA)`, and this selection creates a "
"compatible ACH file ,which is sent to the company's bank."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Crear informe de pago` y se abrirá una "
"ventana emergente *Generar un informe de pago*. En el menú desplegable, "
"selecciona el :guilabel:`Formato de exportación` para el informe de pago. "
"Las dos opciones predeterminadas disponibles son :guilabel:`CSV` y "
":guilabel:`NACHA`. :guilabel:`NACHA` son las siglas de la :abbr:`National "
"Automated Clearing House Association (NACHA)`, y esta selección crea un "
"archivo ACH compatible que se envía al banco de la empresa."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:221
msgid ""
"Other options may be available depending on the :doc:`payroll localization "
"<payroll_localizations>` installed in the database."
msgstr ""
"Otras opciones pueden estar disponibles dependiendo de la :doc:`localización "
"de nómina <payroll_localizations>` instalada en la base de datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:224
msgid "If :guilabel:`CSV` is selected, all other fields are hidden from view."
msgstr ""
"Si se selecciona :guilabel:`CSV`, todos los demás campos se ocultan de la "
"vista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:226
msgid ""
"Next, set the date the paycheck is issued in the :guilabel:`Payment Date` "
"field using the calendar selector. Lastly, select the "
"desired :guilabel:`Bank Journal` the paycheck is logged to using the drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""
"A continuación, establece la fecha de emisión del recibo de nómina en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Fecha de pago` mediante el selector de calendario. Por "
"último, selecciona en el menú desplegable el :guilabel:`Diario de banco` "
"deseado en el que se registrará el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:230
msgid ""
"Once the *Generate a Payment Report* pop-up window is configured, click "
"the :guilabel:`Generate` button, and the file appears on the payslip form, "
"in a new :guilabel:`Payment Report` field."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que la ventana emergente esté configurada, haz clic en el botón "
":guilabel:`Generar`, y el archivo aparece en el formulario de nómina, en un "
"nuevo campo :guilabel:`Informe de pago`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:233
msgid "The exported Payment Report file on the payslip."
msgstr "El archivo de informe de pago exportado en la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:239
msgid "Post the journal entry"
msgstr "Publicar el asiento contable"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:241
msgid ""
"Before the payment can be sent to the employee, the journal entry **must** "
"be posted."
msgstr ""
"Antes de poder enviar el pago al empleado, el asiento contable **debe** "
"estar publicado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:243
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`Journal Entry (Draft)` smart button, and "
"the journal entry loads. Click :guilabel:`Post` to post the entry, then "
"click the payslip breadcrumb to return to the payslip. The :icon:`fa-"
"usd` :guilabel:`Journal Entry (Draft)` smart button changes to :icon:`fa-"
"usd` :guilabel:`Journal Entry (Posted)`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón inteligente :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`Asiento contable "
"(Borrador)` y se cargará el asiento contable. Haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Publicar` para publicar el asiento y, a continuación, haz clic en "
"las migas de pan para volver a la nómina. El botón inteligente :icon:`fa-"
"usd` :guilabel:`Asiento contable (Borrador)` cambiará a :icon:`fa-usd` "
":guilabel:`Asiento contable (Publicado)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:251
msgid "Pay the employee"
msgstr "Pagar al empleado"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:253
msgid ""
"To pay the employee, click the :guilabel:`Pay` button in the corner. Doing "
"so reveals a *Pay* pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Para pagar al empleado, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Pagar` situado en la "
"esquina. Al hacerlo, se abrirá una ventana emergente *Pagar*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:257
msgid ""
"Employees **cannot** be paid until the :ref:`journal entry is posted "
"<payroll/payslips/post>`."
msgstr ""
"No se **puede** pagar a los empleados hasta que :ref:`se publique el asiento "
"contable <payroll/payslips/post>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:259
msgid ""
"All the necessary information is pre-populated on the form according to the "
"payslip configuration, but modifications can be made, if necessary, to any "
"of the fields *except* the :guilabel:`Amount`. This is populated according "
"to the payslip calculations, and **cannot** be modified."
msgstr ""
"Toda la información necesaria se rellena automáticamente en el formulario "
"según la configuración de la nómina, pero se pueden realizar modificaciones, "
"si es necesario, en cualquiera de los campos *excepto* :guilabel:`Importe`. "
"Este se rellena según los cálculos de la nómina y **no se puede** modificar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:263
msgid ":guilabel:`Journal`: The accounting journal the payslip is logged to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Diario`: el diario contable en el que se registra la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:264
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method`: Using the drop-down menu, select how the "
"employee is being paid. The default options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Método de pago`: usando el menú desplegable, selecciona cómo se "
"está pagando al empleado. Las opciones predeterminadas son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual Payment`: Select this if paying the employee in a method "
"*other* than :guilabel:`Check` or :guilabel:`NACHA`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago manual`: selecciona esto si pagas al empleado de una manera "
"*distinta* a :guilabel:`Cheque` o :guilabel:`NACHA`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:269
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Check`: Select this when issuing a check directly to the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cheque`: selecciona esto cuando emites un cheque directamente al "
"empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:270
msgid ""
":guilabel:`NACHA`: Select this if using the :abbr:`National Automated "
"Clearing House Association (NACHA)` to transfer the payment to the employee, "
"via direct deposit."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`NACHA`: selecciona esto si usas la :abbr:`Asociación Nacional de "
"la Cámara de Compensación Automatizada (NACHA)` para transferir el pago al "
"empleado, mediante depósito directo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:273
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Group Payments`: If the employee has multiple payslips for the "
"same time period (for example, separate payroll, reimbursement, and "
"commission checks), click the checkbox to group all payments into one "
"payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Agrupar pagos`: si el empleado tiene varias nóminas para el mismo "
"período (por ejemplo, cheques independientes para nómina, reembolsos y "
"comisiones), marca la casilla para agrupar todos los pagos en uno solo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:276
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Date`: Using the calendar selector, select the date the "
"employee is to be paid."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fecha de pago`: usando el selector de calendario, selecciona la "
"fecha en que se debe pagar al empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:278
msgid ""
"Once the *Pay* pop-up form is complete, click the :guilabel:`Create "
"Payments` button, and the payment is processed."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que se complete el formulario emergente :guilabel:`Pagar`, haz clic "
"en el botón :guilabel:`Crear Pagos` y se procesará el pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:281
msgid ""
"After the payment is processed, and there is confirmation that the checks "
"have been issued, or the funds have been directly deposited to the "
"employee's bank account, click the :guilabel:`Mark as paid` button, and the "
"payslip's status changes to :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Una vez procesado el pago y tras confirmar que se han emitido los cheques o "
"que los fondos se han ingresado directamente en la cuenta bancaria del "
"empleado, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Marcar como pagado` y el estado de "
"la nómina cambiará a :guilabel:`Pagado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:286
msgid ""
"For a payslip to be paid, the employee **must** have a bank account entered "
"in the :ref:`private information tab <employees/private-info>` of their "
"employee record, *and* the bank account must be marked "
"as :guilabel:`Trusted`."
msgstr ""
"Para que se pueda pagar una nómina, el empleado **debe** tener una cuenta "
"bancaria registrada en la :ref:`pestaña de información privada <employees/"
"private-info>` de su ficha de empleado *y* la cuenta bancaria debe estar "
"marcada como :guilabel:`De confianza`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:290
msgid ""
"If there is no bank information, or if the bank is not listed "
"as :guilabel:`Trusted`, payslips cannot be paid, and an error appears when "
"the :guilabel:`Pay` button is clicked. Edit the employee record, and add "
"banking information, or trust the bank account, as needed."
msgstr ""
"Si no hay información bancaria o si el banco no está marcado "
"como :guilabel:`Confiable`, las nóminas no se pueden pagar y aparecerá un "
"error al hacer clic en el botón :guilabel:`Pagar`. Edita el registro del "
"empleado y agrega la información bancaria o marca la cuenta bancaria como "
"confiable, según sea necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:294
msgid "The various information configured on the Pay pop-up window."
msgstr "La diversa información configurada en la ventana emergente Pagar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:298
msgid "Refund a payslip"
msgstr "Reembolsar una nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:300
msgid ""
"When refunding a payment, the refund is achieved by creating a payslip for a "
"negative amount of the original payslip."
msgstr ""
"Al reembolsar un pago, el reembolso se realiza creando una nómina por un "
"importe negativo de la nómina original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:304
msgid ""
"An employee is paid $5,000.00 USD in a paycheck, in error. When refunding "
"the payslip, a new payslip is created in the amount of $-5,000.00."
msgstr ""
"A un empleado se le pagan $5.000,00 USD en un cheque de pago por error. Al "
"reembolsar la nómina, se crea una nueva nómina por un importe de $-5.000,00."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:307
msgid ""
"If a payment needs to be refunded, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --"
"> Payslips --> Payslips`, and click on the individual payslip being "
"refunded. Click the :guilabel:`Revert` button, located in the corner of the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas reembolsar un pago, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> "
"Nóminas --> Nóminas` y haz clic en la nómina individual que se va a "
"reembolsar. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Revertir`, situado en la esquina "
"de la pantalla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:311
msgid ""
"The *Refund Payslip* dashboard loads, with both the original payslip being "
"refunded (with a status of :guilabel:`Paid`) and the newly created payslip "
"in the negative amount of the original payslip, in a list view."
msgstr ""
"Se cargará el tablero *Reembolsar nómina*, que muestra en una vista de lista "
"tanto la nómina original que se va a reembolsar (con el estado "
":guilabel:`Pagado`) como la nómina recién creada con el importe negativo de "
"la original."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:315
msgid ""
"By default, the refund payslip has a status of :guilabel:`Draft`. This "
"refund payslip is processed :ref:`in the same way a regular payslip is "
"processed <payroll/payslips/process>`."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, la nómina de reembolso tiene el estado :guilabel:`Borrador`. "
"Esta nómina de reembolso se procesa :ref:`del mismo modo que una nómina "
"normal <payroll/payslips/process>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:318
msgid "The original payslip, and the refund payslip, in a list view."
msgstr "La nómina original y la nómina de reembolso en una vista de lista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:322
msgid "Print a payslip"
msgstr "Imprimir una nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:324
msgid ""
"To print a payslip, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Payslips --> "
"Payslips`, and click on the individual payslip being printed. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Print` button in the corner of the payslip record, and a file "
"explorer window opens in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"Para imprimir una nómina, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> "
"Nóminas --> Nóminas` y haz clic en la nómina individual que quieras "
"imprimir. Haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Imprimir` situado en la esquina "
"del registro de la nómina; se abrirá una ventana del explorador de archivos "
"en una nueva pestaña."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:328
msgid ""
"The name of the file is `Payslip - (Employee).pdf` by default. Modify the "
"file name if desired, navigate to where the payslip should be saved, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, el nombre del archivo es `Payslip - (Employee)"
".pdf`. Modifica el nombre del archivo si lo deseas, navega hasta la "
"ubicación donde quieras guardar la nómina y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:331
msgid "A PDF file is downloaded to the selected location."
msgstr "Se descarga un archivo PDF en la ubicación seleccionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:334
msgid ""
"Depending on the configured settings of the browser, the file may "
"automatically download."
msgstr ""
"Según la configuración de tu navegador, es posible que el archivo se "
"descargue automáticamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:339
msgid "View all payslips"
msgstr "Ver todas las nóminas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:341
msgid ""
"To view all payslips, regardless of status, go to :menuselection:`Payroll "
"app --> Payslips --> Payslips`. The *Employee Payslips* dashboard loads, "
"displaying all payslips in a default list view."
msgstr ""
"Para ver todas las nóminas, independientemente de su estado, ve a "
":menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Nóminas --> Nóminas`. Se cargará el "
"tablero *Nóminas de los empleados*, que muestra todas las nóminas en una "
"vista de lista predeterminada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:344
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Status` for each individual payslip is displayed, indicating "
"one of the following status options:"
msgstr ""
"Se muestra el :guilabel:`Estado` de cada nómina individual, indicando una de "
"las siguientes opciones de estado:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:347
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Draft`: The payslip has not been validated yet, and edits can "
"still be made."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Borrador`: la nómina aún no se ha validado y todavía se pueden "
"realizar modificaciones."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:348
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Done`: The payslip is calculated, validated, and ready to be paid."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Hecho`: la nómina está calculada, validada y lista para ser "
"pagada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:349
msgid ":guilabel:`Paid`: The employee has been paid."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pagado`: el empleado ya recibió su pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:350
msgid ":guilabel:`Canceled`: The payslip has been canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cancelado`: la nómina ha sido cancelada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:351
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Warning`: The payslip has errors that **must** be resolved before "
"the payslip can be processed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Advertencia`: la nómina contiene errores que se **deben** "
"resolver antes de poder procesarla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:353
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Error`: The payslip is in the :guilabel:`Draft` stage, but an "
"error prevents it from being processed further."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Error`: la nómina se encuentra en la etapa :guilabel:`Borrador`, "
"pero un error impide que se siga procesando."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:356
msgid "View all payslips with their respective statuses."
msgstr "Consulta todas las nóminas con sus respectivos estados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:359
msgid ""
"Click on an individual payslip to view the details for that payslip on a "
"separate page. Using the breadcrumb menu, click :guilabel:`Employee "
"Payslips` to go back to the list view of all payslips."
msgstr ""
"Haga clic en un recibo de nómina individual para ver los detalles en una "
"página por separado. Use el menú de migas de pan y haga clic "
"en :guilabel:`Recibos de nómina del empleado` para volver a la vista de "
"lista de todos los recibos de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:363
msgid "Export payslips"
msgstr "Exportar nóminas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:365
msgid ""
"All or a select number of payslips can be exported to an Excel spreadsheet."
msgstr ""
"Se pueden exportar todas las nóminas o una selección de ellas a una hoja de "
"cálculo de Excel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:368
msgid "All payslips"
msgstr "Todos los recibos de nómina"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:370
msgid ""
"To export **all** payslips, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> "
"Payslips --> Payslips`. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, "
"then click :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Export All` in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Para exportar **todas** las nóminas, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación "
"Nómina --> Nóminas --> Nóminas`. Haz clic en el icono :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(Acciones)` y, a continuación, haz clic en :icon:`fa-upload` "
":guilabel:`Exportar todo` en el menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:374
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:389
msgid ""
"In the file explorer window that loads, select the desired location for the "
"file, update the default `Pay Slip (hr.payslip).xlsx` file name if desired, "
"and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"En la ventana del explorador de archivos que se abre, selecciona la "
"ubicación deseada para el archivo, modifica el nombre predeterminado `Pay "
"Slip (hr.payslip).xlsx` si lo deseas y haz clic en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:378
msgid "Select payslips"
msgstr "Seleccionar nóminas"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:380
msgid ""
"To export only specific payslips, first click the checkbox to the left of "
"each individual payslip on the *Employee Payslips* dashboard to select the "
"payslip. As payslips are selected, a :guilabel:`# Selected` smart button "
"appears, indicating the number of selected payslips."
msgstr ""
"Para exportar solo nóminas específicas, primero marca la casilla de "
"verificación situada a la izquierda de cada nómina en el tablero *Nóminas de "
"los empleados*. A medida que se seleccionan las nóminas, aparece el botón "
"inteligente :guilabel:`# seleccionado`, que indica el número de nóminas "
"seleccionadas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payslips.rst:384
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button at the top of the page, "
"click :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Export`, and an *Export Data* pop-up "
"window loads. :ref:`Configure <essentials/export_import_data/export-data>` "
"the *Export Data* pop-up window, then click :guilabel:`Export` to export the "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el botón :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Acciones` de la parte "
"superior de la página, haz clic en :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Exportar` y "
"se abrirá una ventana emergente *Exportar datos*. :ref:`Configura "
"<essentials/export_import_data/export-data>` la ventana emergente *Exportar "
"datos* y luego haz clic en :guilabel:`Exportar` para exportar los datos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:3
msgid "Salaries"
msgstr "Salarios"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo, salaries are calculated and determined by six factors: "
"salary :ref:`structure types <payroll/salaries/structure-types>`, "
"salary :ref:`structures <payroll/salaries/structures>`, :doc:`rules "
"<salary_rules>`, :ref:`rule parameters <payroll/salary_rules/rule-"
"parameters>`, :ref:`rule categories <payroll/salary_rules/rule-categories>`, "
"and :ref:`salary input types <payroll/salaries/salary-input-types>`. "
"Together, these determine how each employee's pay is calculated."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, los salarios se calculan y determinan mediante seis factores: "
":ref:`tipos de estructuras <payroll/salaries/structure-types>` salariales, "
":ref:`estructuras <payroll/salaries/structures>` salariales, :doc:`reglas "
"<salary_rules>`, :ref:`parámetros de reglas <payroll/salary_rules/rule-"
"parameters>`, :ref:`categorías de reglas <payroll/salary_rules/rule-"
"categories>` y :ref:`tipos de entrada salarial <payroll/salaries/salary-"
"input-types>`. Juntos determinan cómo se calcula el salario de cada empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:12
msgid ""
"Each *structure type* contains one or more *structures* within it. Each "
"*structure* contains a set of *rules*, and every *rule* uses *parameters* "
"and *categories* to define how specific amounts are calculated. Additional "
"salary inputs, such as bonuses or deductions, can also be included to adjust "
"the final salary."
msgstr ""
"Cada *tipo de estructura* contiene una o más *estructuras*. Cada "
"*estructura* contiene un conjunto de *reglas*, y cada *regla* utiliza "
"*parámetros* y *categorías* para definir cómo se calculan los importes "
"específicos. También se pueden incluir entradas salariales adicionales, como "
"primas o deducciones, para ajustar el salario final."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:17
msgid ""
"When payslips are calculated, Odoo calculates the employee's worked time "
"from their :doc:`work entries <work_entries>`, then applies the relevant "
"structure, rules, and parameters from the employee's assigned structure type "
"to determine their total pay."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se calculan las nóminas, Odoo calcula el tiempo trabajado del "
"empleado a partir de sus :doc:`entradas de trabajo <work_entries>`, y luego "
"aplica la estructura, reglas y parámetros relevantes del tipo de estructura "
"asignado al empleado para determinar su pago total."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:24
msgid "Structure types"
msgstr "Tipos de estructura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:26
msgid ""
"In Odoo, a *structure type* groups related salary structures. When a "
"contract specifies a structure type, **only** the structures within that "
"type are used to calculate the employee's pay. Each structure type houses "
"individual structures within them, each containing a set of rules for "
"processing a timesheet entry."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, un *tipo de estructura* agrupa estructuras salariales relacionadas. "
"Cuando un contrato especifica un tipo de estructura, **solo** se utilizan "
"las estructuras dentro de ese tipo para calcular el pago del empleado. Cada "
"tipo de estructura contiene estructuras individuales, cada una con un "
"conjunto de reglas para procesar una entrada de parte de horas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:31
msgid ""
"Structure types define key aspects of payroll configuration, including how "
"often employees are paid, their working hours, the default salary structure, "
"and whether wages are fixed (salary-based) or variable (hourly-based)."
msgstr ""
"Los tipos de estructura definen aspectos clave de la configuración de "
"nómina, incluida la frecuencia con la que se paga a los empleados, sus horas "
"de trabajo, la estructura salarial predeterminada y si los salarios son "
"fijos (basados en salario) o variables (basados en horas)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:36
msgid ""
"A structure type called `Employee` contains two different structures within "
"it: a `Regular Pay` structure which includes all the separate rules for "
"processing regular pay, and an `End of Year Bonus` structure, which includes "
"the rules **only** for the end of year bonus. Both belong to the same "
"`Employee` structure type."
msgstr ""
"Un tipo de estructura llamado `Empleado` contiene dos estructuras "
"diferentes: una estructura `Pago Regular` que incluye todas las reglas "
"separadas para procesar el pago regular, y una estructura `Bonificación de "
"Fin de Año`, que incluye las reglas **solo** para la bonificación de fin de "
"año. Ambas pertenecen al mismo tipo de estructura `Empleado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:41
msgid ""
"View existing *structure types* by navigating to :menuselection:`Payroll app "
"--> Configuration --> Structure Types`."
msgstr ""
"Consulta los *tipos de estructura* existentes navegando "
"a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Tipos de "
"Estructura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:44
msgid ""
"Two default structure types are preconfigured in Odoo: :guilabel:`Employee` "
"and :guilabel:`Worker`."
msgstr ""
"Dos tipos de estructura predeterminados están preconfigurados en "
"Odoo: :guilabel:`Empleado` y :guilabel:`Trabajador`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:46
msgid ""
"Typically, :guilabel:`Employee` is used for salaried employees, which is why "
"the :guilabel:`Wage Type` is set to :guilabel:`Fixed "
"Wage`. :guilabel:`Worker` is typically used for employees paid by the hour, "
"so the wage type is set to :guilabel:`Hourly Wage`."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, :guilabel:`Empleado` se utiliza para empleados con salario "
"fijo, motivo por el cual el :guilabel:`Tipo de salario` se establece en "
":guilabel:`Salario fijo`. Por lo general, :guilabel:`Trabajador` se utiliza "
"para empleados que cobran por horas, por lo que el tipo de salario se "
"establece en :guilabel:`Salario por horas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:51
msgid ""
"If using a country-specific :doc:`payroll localization "
"<payroll_localizations>`, it is recommended to use the structure in the "
"corresponding country localization document."
msgstr ""
"Si utilizas :doc:`localizaciones de nómina <payroll_localizations>` "
"específicas de país, se recomienda usar la estructura en el documento de "
"localización del país correspondiente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:54
msgid "List of all currently configured structure types available to use."
msgstr ""
"Lista de todos los tipos de estructura configurados disponibles para su uso."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:60
msgid "New structure type"
msgstr "Nuevo tipo de estructura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:62
msgid ""
"If the default structure types do not meet the company's needs, go "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structure Types` and "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create a custom structure type."
msgstr ""
"Si los tipos de estructura predeterminados no satisfacen las necesidades de "
"la empresa, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> "
"Tipos de Estructura` y haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` para crear un tipo de "
"estructura personalizado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:66
msgid ""
"When creating a new salary structure type, ensure all local and national "
"laws are accounted for. Confirm with the accounting department when "
"configuring payroll structures, to ensure all requirements are met."
msgstr ""
"Al crear un nuevo tipo de estructura salarial, asegúrate de que se tengan en "
"cuenta todas las leyes locales y nacionales. Confirma con el departamento de "
"contabilidad al configurar estructuras de nómina para garantizar que se "
"cumplan todos los requisitos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:70
msgid "Proceed to enter the following information in the fields:"
msgstr "Procede a introducir la siguiente información en los campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Structure Type`: Enter the name for the new structure type, such "
"as `Employee` or `Worker`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de Estructura`: Introduce el nombre del nuevo tipo de "
"estructura, como `Empleado` o `Trabajador`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country`: Select the country that the new structure type applies "
"to from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`País`: Selecciona el país al que se aplica el nuevo tipo de "
"estructura desde el menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Wage Type`: Select the wage type for the structure:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de Salario`: Selecciona el tipo de salario para la "
"estructura:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Wage`: For salaried employees who receive the same wage "
"every pay period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario Fijo`: Para empleados asalariados que reciben el mismo "
"salario en cada período de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hourly Wage`: For employees paid based on hours worked during a "
"pay period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salario por Hora`: Para empleados pagados según las horas "
"trabajadas durante un período de pago."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:81
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scheduled Pay`: Select the typical pay schedule for the new "
"structure type using the drop-down menu. This indicates how often this "
"specific type of structure is paid out."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pago programado`: Selecciona la frecuencia de pago habitual para "
"el nuevo tipo de estructura en el menú desplegable. Esto indica con qué "
"frecuencia se liquida este tipo específico de estructura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours`: Select the working hours for the new structure "
"type using the drop-down menu. All available working hours for the currently "
"selected company appear in the drop-down menu. The default working hours are "
"the :guilabel:`Standard 40 hours/week` option. If the needed working hours "
"do not appear in the list, a :ref:`new set of working hours can be created "
"<payroll/salaries/new-working-hours>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Horas de trabajo`: Selecciona las horas de trabajo para el nuevo "
"tipo de estructura en el menú desplegable. En el menú desplegable aparecen "
"todas las horas de trabajo disponibles para la empresa seleccionada "
"actualmente. La opción predeterminada es :guilabel:`Estándar 40 horas/"
"semana`. Si las horas de trabajo necesarias no aparecen en la lista, se "
"puede :ref:`crear un nuevo horario de trabajo <payroll/salaries/new-working-"
"hours>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pay Structure`: Select the pay structure that falls within the "
"new structure type using the drop-down menu. This is used as the default "
"option when generating payslips."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estructura salarial`: Selecciona la estructura salarial "
"correspondiente al nuevo tipo de estructura en el menú desplegable. Se "
"utiliza como opción predeterminada al generar nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Entry Type`: Select the work entry type used to create all "
"work entries for the employee."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de entrada de trabajo`: Selecciona el tipo de entrada de "
"trabajo utilizado para crear todas las entradas de trabajo del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:93
msgid "New structure type form to fill out when creating a new structure type."
msgstr ""
"Nuevo formulario de tipo de estructura a completar al crear un nuevo tipo de "
"estructura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:99
msgid "New working hours"
msgstr "Nuevas horas de trabajo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:101
msgid ""
"To make new working hours, type the name for the new working hours in "
"the :guilabel:`Working Hours` field on the new structure type form, then "
"click :guilabel:`Create and edit`. A *Create Working Hours* pop-up window "
"loads. The form has two sections: a general information section, and a "
"*Working Hours* tab listing all the individual working hours by day and "
"time. When the form is completed, click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Para crear un nuevo horario, escribe el nombre para las nuevas horas de "
"trabajo en el campo :guilabel:`Horas de trabajo` del formulario del nuevo "
"tipo de estructura y, a continuación, haz clic en :guilabel:`Crear y "
"editar`. Se abrirá la ventana emergente *Crear horas de trabajo*. El "
"formulario tiene dos secciones: una sección de información general y una "
"pestaña *Horas de trabajo* que detalla todas las horas de trabajo "
"individuales por día y hora. Cuando hayas completado el formulario, haz clic "
"en :guilabel:`Guardar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:107
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Type in the name for the new working hours. This should be "
"descriptive and clear to understand, such as `Standard 20 Hours/Week`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre`: Escribe el nombre para las nuevas horas de trabajo. Debe "
"ser descriptivo y fácil de entender, como `Estándar 20 horas/semana`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Schedule Type`: Select whether the hours are :guilabel:`Flexible` "
"or :guilabel:`Fully Fixed` by clicking the corresponding radio button. "
"Selecting :guilabel:`Flexible` hides the *Working Hours* tab and some other "
"fields in the general information section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo de horario`: Selecciona si las horas son "
":guilabel:`Flexible` o :guilabel:`Totalmente fijas` haciendo clic en el "
"botón de selección correspondiente. Al seleccionar :guilabel:`Flexible` se "
"oculta la pestaña *Horas de trabajo* y algunos otros campos de la sección de "
"información general."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Define Amount of Hours per day`: Enable this option to base the "
"schedule on a set amount of expected hours by day, instead of set start and "
"end times for each day. When this option is modified, a *Confirmation* pop-"
"up window appears. Click :guilabel:`Confirm` on the pop-up to make the "
"change."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Definir cantidad de horas al día`: Activa esta opción para basar "
"el horario en una cantidad determinada de horas previstas al día, en lugar "
"de horas fijas de inicio y fin para cada día. Al modificar esta opción, "
"aparece una ventana emergente de *Confirmación*. Haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Confirmar` en la ventana emergente para aplicar el cambio."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Full Time Equivalent`: The number of hours per week an employee "
"needs to work to be considered a full-time employee. Typically, this is "
"approximately 40 hours, and this number affects what types of benefits an "
"employee can receive, based on their employment status (full-time vs. part-"
"time). This field is **not** able to be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Equivalente a tiempo completo`: El número de horas semanales que "
"un empleado debe trabajar para considerarse a tiempo completo. Suele ser de "
"aproximadamente 40 horas y este número influye en el tipo de beneficios que "
"puede recibir un empleado según su situación laboral (a tiempo completo "
"frente a tiempo parcial). Este campo **no** se puede modificar."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Work Time Rate`: This percentage is auto-generated based on the "
"configured times in the *Working Hours* tab, compared to the :guilabel:`Full "
"Time Equivalent`. This number should be between `0.00%` and `100%`, so if "
"the percentage is above `100%`, it is an indication that the working times "
"may need adjustment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Porcentaje de tiempo de trabajo`: Este porcentaje se genera "
"automáticamente a partir de las horas configuradas en la pestaña *Horas de "
"trabajo*, en comparación con el :guilabel:`Equivalente a tiempo completo`. "
"Este número debe situarse entre el `0.00%` y el `100%`, por lo que si el "
"porcentaje supera el `100%`, indica que es necesario ajustar los horarios de "
"trabajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company that can use the new default working "
"hours using the drop-down menu. Leave this field blank if the hours are "
"available for all companies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Compañía`: Selecciona en el menú desplegable la compañía que "
"puede utilizar el nuevo horario laboral predeterminado. Deja este campo en "
"blanco si el horario está disponible para todas las compañías."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Timezone`: Select the time zone to be used for the new working "
"hours using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Zona horaria`: Selecciona en el menú desplegable la zona horaria "
"que se utilizará para el nuevo horario de trabajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`2 Week's Calendar`: Enable this checkbox to switch from a one-"
"week calendar to a two-week calendar. When this option is modified, a "
"*Confirmation* pop-up window appears. Click :guilabel:`Switch` on the pop-up "
"to make the change. When enabled, the presented tabs change from a single "
"*Working Hours* tab to two tabs: *Week 1 Working Hours* and *Week 2 Working "
"Hours*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Calendario de 2 semanas`: Marca esta casilla para cambiar de un "
"calendario de una semana a uno de dos semanas. Al modificar esta opción, "
"aparece una ventana emergente de *Confirmación*. Haz clic en "
":guilabel:`Cambiar` en la ventana emergente para aplicar el cambio. Al "
"activarla, las pestañas mostradas pasan de una única pestaña *Horas de "
"trabajo* a dos pestañas: *Horas de trabajo de la semana 1* y *Horas de "
"trabajo de la semana 2*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:134
msgid ""
"Switching the calendar between either method removes **all** current work "
"entries."
msgstr ""
"Cambiar el calendario entre cualquiera de los dos métodos elimina **todas** "
"las entradas de trabajo actuales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:136
msgid ""
"*Working Hours* tab: This tab is where each day's specific working hours are "
"listed, including breaks. When a new working schedule is created, the "
"*Working Hours* tab is pre-populated with a default 40-hour week, with each "
"day divided into three timed sections."
msgstr ""
"Pestaña *Horas de trabajo*: en esta pestaña se enumeran las horas de trabajo "
"específicas de cada día, incluidos los descansos. Al crear un nuevo horario "
"laboral, la pestaña *Horas de trabajo* se rellena previamente con una semana "
"predeterminada de 40 horas, con cada día dividido en tres franjas horarias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:140
msgid ""
"Each day includes a morning shift (8:00-12:00), a lunch break (12:00-13:00), "
"and an afternoon shift (13:00-17:00), configured using a 24-hour time format."
msgstr ""
"Cada día incluye un turno de mañana (8:00-12:00), una pausa para la comida "
"(12:00-13:00) y un turno de tarde (13:00-17:00), configurados en formato de "
"24 horas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:143
msgid ""
"The average daily working hours are automatically calculated based on the "
"schedule and appear in the :guilabel:`Avg` field, along with "
"the :guilabel:`Total` hours for the week."
msgstr ""
"La media diaria de horas de trabajo se calcula automáticamente a partir del "
"horario y aparece en el campo :guilabel:`Media`, junto con el "
":guilabel:`Total` de horas de la semana."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:146
msgid ""
"To adjust any of these entries, click the desired field and modify the "
"information using the drop-down menus or type the information in directly."
msgstr ""
"Para ajustar cualquiera de estas entradas, haz clic en el campo deseado y "
"modifica la información mediante los menús desplegables o escríbela "
"directamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:149
msgid ""
"Ensure the :guilabel:`Work Entry Type` field is configured for each line. "
"This ensures the **Payroll** app properly calculates all work entries."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de configurar el campo :guilabel:`Tipo de entrada de trabajo` en "
"cada línea. Esto garantiza que la aplicación **Nómina** calcule "
"correctamente todas las entradas de trabajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:153
msgid ""
"Working hours are company-specific, and cannot be shared between companies."
msgstr ""
"Los horarios laborales son específicos de la empresa y no se pueden "
"compartir entre empresas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:156
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`2 Week's Calendar` option is enabled, ensure the various "
"working hours for both tabs (*Week 1 Working Hours* and *Week 2 Working "
"Hours*) are correctly configured."
msgstr ""
"Si la opción :guilabel:`Calendario de 2 semanas` está activada, asegúrate de "
"que las distintas horas de trabajo de ambas pestañas (*Horas de trabajo de "
"la semana 1* y *Horas de trabajo de la semana 2*) estén configuradas "
"correctamente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:159
msgid "A new working schedule for interns that work a fifteen-hour week."
msgstr ""
"Un nuevo horario de trabajo para becarios con una jornada de quince horas "
"semanales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:165
msgid "Structures"
msgstr "Estructuras"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:167
msgid ""
"*Salary structures* are the different situations in which an employee could "
"be paid within a specific *structure*, and are specifically defined by "
"various rules."
msgstr ""
"Las *estructuras salariales* son las diferentes situaciones en las que se "
"puede pagar a un empleado dentro de una *estructura* específica, y se "
"definen específicamente por varias reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:170
msgid ""
"The number of structures a company needs for each structure type depends on "
"how many different ways employees are paid, and how their pay is calculated. "
"A common example of an additional structure is a `Bonus`."
msgstr ""
"El número de estructuras que una empresa necesita para cada tipo de "
"estructura depende de cuántas formas diferentes se paga a los empleados y "
"cómo se calcula su pago. Un ejemplo común de una estructura adicional es "
"`Bonificación`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:174
msgid ""
"To view all the various structures for each structure type, go "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Structures`."
msgstr ""
"Para ver todas las diversas estructuras para cada tipo de estructura, ve "
"a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Estructuras`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:177
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`structure type <payroll/salaries/structure-types>` lists the "
"various structures associated with it. Each structure contains a set of "
"rules that define it."
msgstr ""
"Cada :ref:`tipo de estructura <payroll/salaries/structure-types>` enumera "
"las distintas estructuras asociadas a él. Cada estructura contiene un "
"conjunto de reglas que la definen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:180
msgid ""
"Odoo comes with two salary structures preconfigured: :guilabel:`Regular "
"Pay`, housed within the :guilabel:`Employee` structure type, "
"and :guilabel:`Worker Pay`, housed within the :guilabel:`Worker` salary "
"structure type."
msgstr ""
"Odoo incluye dos estructuras salariales preconfiguradas: :guilabel:`Salario "
"regular`, ubicada dentro del tipo de estructura :guilabel:`Empleado`, y "
":guilabel:`Salario de trabajador`, ubicada dentro del tipo de estructura "
"salarial :guilabel:`Trabajador`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:184
msgid ""
"Click on a structure to view its :guilabel:`Salary Rules`. These rules "
"define how the payslip will be computed for the employee."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en una estructura para ver sus :guilabel:`Reglas salariales`. Estas "
"reglas definen cómo se calculará la nómina del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:188
msgid ""
"After installing a :doc:`payroll localization <payroll_localizations>`, "
"relevant structures are installed and appear in this list."
msgstr ""
"Después de instalar una :doc:`localización de nómina "
"<payroll_localizations>`, se instalan las estructuras relevantes y aparecen "
"en esta lista."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:191
msgid ""
"Salary structure details for Regular Pay, listing all the specific Salary "
"Rules."
msgstr ""
"Detalles de la estructura salarial para un pago regular, enumerando todas "
"las reglas salariales específicas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:197
msgid "Salary input types"
msgstr "Tipos de entrada de salario"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:199
msgid ""
"When creating payslips, it is sometimes necessary to add other entries for "
"specific circumstances, like tips, commissions, expenses, or deductions. "
"These other inputs can be found by navigating to :menuselection:`Payroll app "
"--> Configuration --> Salary Input Types`. All universal and localization-"
"specific salary input types appear in the list."
msgstr ""
"Al crear nóminas, a veces es necesario añadir otras entradas para "
"circunstancias específicas, como propinas, comisiones, gastos o deducciones. "
"Estas otras entradas se pueden encontrar en :menuselection:`Aplicación "
"Nómina --> Configuración --> Tipos de entrada de salario`. En la lista "
"aparecen todos los tipos de entrada de salario universales y específicos de "
"cada localización."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:204
msgid ""
"A list of salary input types for payroll that can be selected when creating "
"a new entry for\n"
"a payslip."
msgstr ""
"Una lista de tipos de entrada de salario para nómina que se pueden "
"seleccionar al crear una nueva entrada para\n"
"una nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:208
msgid ""
"If a new input type is needed that does not appear on the list, click "
"the :guilabel:`New` button to create a new salary input type. Enter "
"the :guilabel:`Description`, the :guilabel:`Code`, and select which "
"structure it applies to in the :guilabel:`Availability in Structure` field."
msgstr ""
"Si necesitas un nuevo tipo de entrada que no aparece en la lista, haz clic "
"en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo` para crearlo. Introduce la "
":guilabel:`Descripción`, el :guilabel:`Código` y selecciona a qué estructura "
"se aplica en el campo :guilabel:`Disponibilidad en la estructura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:212
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Available in adjustments` checkbox if the input should "
"be a salary adjustment."
msgstr ""
"Activa la casilla :guilabel:`Disponible en ajustes` si la entrada debe ser "
"un ajuste salarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salaries.rst:215
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Code` is used in the salary rules to compute payslips. If "
"the :guilabel:`Availability in Structure` field is left blank, it indicates "
"that the new input type is available for all payslips and is not exclusive "
"to a specific structure."
msgstr ""
"El :guilabel:`código` se utiliza en las reglas salariales para calcular las "
"nóminas. Si el campo :guilabel:`Disponibilidad en estructura` está vacío, "
"esto indica que el nuevo tipo de entrada está disponible para todos los "
"recibos de nómina y no pertenece solo a una estructura en específico."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:3
msgid "Salary adjustments"
msgstr "Ajustes salariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:5
msgid ""
"Salary adjustments are portions of earnings taken directly out of a payslip "
"for a specific purpose, whether voluntary or required."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes salariales son porciones de ingresos tomadas directamente de una "
"nómina para un propósito específico, ya sea voluntario o requerido."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:8
msgid ""
"When the deduction is voluntary, they are typically considered *deductions*. "
"When the deduction is court-ordered, or involuntary, it is sometimes "
"referred to as a *wage garnishment*. In Odoo, these are all universally "
"called *salary adjustments*."
msgstr ""
"Cuando la deducción es voluntaria, normalmente se consideran *deducciones*. "
"Cuando la deducción es ordenada por un tribunal, o involuntaria, a veces se "
"denomina *embargo salarial*. En Odoo, estas se llaman universalmente "
"*ajustes salariales*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:12
msgid ""
"Note that salary adjustments can also be used to give recurring amounts of "
"money to employees, like a bonus divided into multiple payments."
msgstr ""
"Ten en cuenta que los ajustes salariales también se pueden usar para dar "
"cantidades recurrentes de dinero a los empleados, como un bono dividido en "
"múltiples pagos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:18
msgid "Salary adjustment types"
msgstr "Tipos de ajuste salarial"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:20
msgid ""
"To view the currently configured salary adjustment types, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --> Salary Input Types`, "
"and the *Salary Input Types* dashboard loads. This displays *all* other "
"salary inputs, not only the various salary adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Para ver los tipos de ajuste salarial configurados actualmente, ve a "
":menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Configuración --> Tipos de entrada "
"salarial` y se cargará el tablero de *Tipos de entrada salarial*. Aquí se "
"muestran *todas* las demás entradas salariales, no solo los distintos "
"ajustes salariales."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:24
msgid ""
"The three default salary adjustment types and uses that appear in this list "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"Los tres tipos de ajuste salarial predeterminados y sus usos que aparecen en "
"esta lista son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attachment of Salary`: Used primarily for voluntary regular "
"payments from the employee's wages, such as paying into a savings program, "
"charity contributions, union dues, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Embargo de salario`: Se utiliza principalmente para pagos "
"periódicos voluntarios a partir del salario del empleado, como aportaciones "
"a un plan de ahorro, donaciones benéficas, cuotas sindicales, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Assignment of Salary`: Used primarily for legally enforceable "
"orders requiring part of an employee's wages to be paid to another party. "
"This is typically used when repaying debts, court-ordered judgments, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cesión de salario`: Se utiliza principalmente para órdenes "
"judicialmente vinculantes que exigen el pago de una parte del salario del "
"empleado a un tercero. Se suele utilizar para pagar deudas, resoluciones "
"judiciales, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Child Support`: Used for any child support payments."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pensión alimenticia`: Se utiliza para los pagos de pensiones "
"alimenticias."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:33
msgid ""
"Each salary adjustment type displays the :guilabel:`Description` of the "
"adjustment type and the :guilabel:`Code` used when calculating payslips. If "
"it is restricted to a specific salary structure, it is listed in "
"the :guilabel:`Availability in Structure` column."
msgstr ""
"Cada tipo de ajuste salarial muestra la :guilabel:`Descripción` del tipo de "
"ajuste y el :guilabel:`Código` utilizado al calcular las nóminas. Si está "
"restringido a una estructura salarial específica, se indica en la columna "
":guilabel:`Disponibilidad en la estructura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:37
msgid "The default salary adjustment types."
msgstr "Los tipos de ajuste salarial predeterminados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:41
msgid "Create new salary adjustment types"
msgstr "Crear nuevos tipos de ajuste salarial"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:44
msgid ""
"Upon installation of the **Payroll** application, the preconfigured default "
"salary adjustment types are linked to a variety of rules that are linked to "
"various salary structures, as well as the installed :ref:`localization "
"package <fiscal_localizations/packages>`."
msgstr ""
"Al instalar la aplicación **Nómina**, los tipos de ajuste salarial "
"predeterminados preconfigurados están vinculados a una variedad de reglas "
"que se vinculan a varias estructuras salariales, así como al :ref:`paquete "
"de localización <fiscal_localizations/packages>` instalado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:48
msgid ""
"It is **not** recommended to alter or modify **any** of the preconfigured "
"salary adjustment types, especially if they have been previously used on "
"payslips in the database. Doing so may affect various salary rules and can "
"prevent the creation of payslips."
msgstr ""
"**No** se recomienda modificar ni alterar **ninguno** de los tipos de ajuste "
"salarial preconfigurados, sobre todo si ya se han utilizado previamente en "
"nóminas dentro de la base de datos. De lo contrario, se podrían ver "
"afectadas varias reglas salariales y se podría impedir la creación de "
"nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:52
msgid ""
"A new salary adjustment type *can* be created, but this should only be done "
"when absolutely necessary. A salary adjustment type **must** be linked to a "
"salary rule to be considered in the salary computation."
msgstr ""
"Se *puede* crear un nuevo tipo de ajuste salarial, pero esto solo debe "
"hacerse cuando sea absolutamente necesario. Un tipo de ajuste salarial "
"**debe** estar vinculado a una regla salarial para ser considerado en el "
"cálculo del salario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:56
msgid ""
"To make a new type of salary adjustment, navigate to :menuselection:`Payroll "
"app --> Configuration --> Salary Input Types`. Click the :guilabel:`New` "
"button on the *Salary Input Types* dashboard, and a blank *Salary Input "
"Types* form loads. Configure the following fields on the form:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un nuevo tipo de ajuste salarial, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación "
"Nómina --> Configuración --> Tipos de entrada de salario`. Haz clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Nuevo` en el tablero de *Tipos de entrada de salario* y se "
"cargará un formulario en blanco de *Tipos de entrada de salario*. Configura "
"los siguientes campos en el formulario:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a description for the new salary adjustment "
"type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Descripción`: Introduce una descripción para el nuevo tipo de "
"ajuste salarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Available in adjustments`: This option **must** be enabled to "
"indicate the input type is available to use as a *salary adjustment*. When "
"enabled, additional fields appear on the form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Disponible en ajustes`: Esta opción **debe** estar activada para "
"indicar que el tipo de entrada está disponible para usarse como un *ajuste "
"salarial*. Al activarla, aparecen campos adicionales en el formulario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:63
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is quantity?`: Leave this option unchecked, as it removes the "
"ability to enter a set monetary amount."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`¿Es cantidad?`: Deja esta opción desmarcada, ya que elimina la "
"posibilidad de introducir un importe monetario fijo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No end date by default`: Enable this option if the adjustment is "
"indefinite, such as an attachment to pay regular fees such as dues or "
"licenses. Do not select this if the adjustment is based on a total amount "
"that must be reached, such as a court settlement repayment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sin fecha de finalización por defecto`: Activa esta opción si el "
"ajuste es indefinido, como un embargo para pagar cuotas periódicas como "
"cuotas sindicales o licencias. No selecciones esta opción si el ajuste se "
"basa en un importe total que se debe alcanzar, como el reembolso de un "
"acuerdo judicial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Code`: Enter a code to be used in the salary rules to compute "
"payslips."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Código`: Introduce un código para utilizarlo en las reglas "
"salariales al calcular las nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:69
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Availability in Structure`: If the salary adjustment type should "
"**only** be used in a specific payroll structure, use the drop-down menu to "
"select the structure."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Disponibilidad en la estructura`: Si el tipo de ajuste salarial "
"**solo** se debe utilizar en una estructura salarial específica, utiliza el "
"menú desplegable para seleccionar la estructura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:75
msgid "Salary adjustment dashboard"
msgstr "Tablero de ajustes salariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:77
msgid ""
"To view the currently configured salary adjustments, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Employees --> Salary Adjustments`, and "
"the *Salary Adjustment* dashboard loads."
msgstr ""
"Para ver los ajustes salariales configurados actualmente, ve a "
":menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> Empleados --> Ajustes salariales` y se "
"cargará el tablero de *Ajustes salariales*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:80
msgid ""
"All salary adjustments appear in a list view. Each salary adjustment "
"displays the name of the :guilabel:`Employees`, the :guilabel:`Start Date`, "
"a descriptive :guilabel:`Note`, the salary adjustment :guilabel:`Type`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Amount`. An :guilabel:`Until` column appears as well, which "
"details when the salary adjustment ends, either a monetary amount to be "
"reached, or :guilabel:`Indefinite` if the adjustment has no end."
msgstr ""
"Todos los ajustes salariales aparecen en una vista de lista. Cada ajuste "
"salarial muestra el nombre de los :guilabel:`Empleados`, la :guilabel:`Fecha "
"de inicio`, una :guilabel:`Nota` descriptiva, el :guilabel:`Tipo` de ajuste "
"salarial y el :guilabel:`Importe`. También aparece una columna "
":guilabel:`Hasta`, que detalla cuándo finaliza el ajuste salarial, ya sea un "
"importe monetario que se debe alcanzar o :guilabel:`Indefinido` si el ajuste "
"no tiene fin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:86
msgid ""
"At the end of each line is a status tag, with a green :guilabel:`Running` "
"tag for active adjustments, or a gray :guilabel:`Closed` tag for adjustments "
"that have ended."
msgstr ""
"Al final de cada línea hay una etiqueta de estado, con una etiqueta verde "
":guilabel:`En curso` para los ajustes activos, o una etiqueta gris "
":guilabel:`Cerrado` para los ajustes que han finalizado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:89
msgid ""
"The salary adjustment dashboard with all running and closed adjustments."
msgstr ""
"El tablero de ajustes salariales con todos los ajustes en curso y cerrados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:95
msgid "Create salary adjustments"
msgstr "Crear ajustes salariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:97
msgid ""
"To create a new salary adjustment, click the :guilabel:`New` button on "
"the :ref:`Salary Adjustment dashboard <payroll/salary_attachments/"
"dashboard>`, and a blank *Salary Adjustment* form loads. Enter the following "
"information on the form:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear un nuevo ajuste salarial, haz clic en el botón :guilabel:`Nuevo` "
"en el :ref:`Tablero de ajustes salariales <payroll/salary_attachments/"
"dashboard>` y se cargará un formulario en blanco de *Ajuste salarial*. "
"Introduce la siguiente información en el formulario:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:101
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employees`: Select the desired employees using the drop-down "
"menu. Multiple employees can be listed in this field **only** if all the "
"other field values are identical."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Empleados`: Selecciona a los empleados deseados en el menú "
"desplegable. **Solo** se pueden incluir varios empleados en este campo si "
"todos los demás valores son idénticos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Select the specific :ref:`salary adjustment type <payroll/"
"salary_attachments/types>` using the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tipo`: Selecciona el :ref:`tipo de ajuste salarial <payroll/"
"salary_attachments/types>` específico en el menú desplegable."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:105
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payslip Amount`: Enter the amount taken out of each paycheck in "
"this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Importe de nómina`: Introduce el importe descontado de cada "
"cheque de pago en este campo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Negative Value`: Enable this checkbox if the salary adjustment is "
"taken into account as a negative value."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valor negativo`: Activa esta casilla si el ajuste salarial se "
"tiene en cuenta como un valor negativo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Duration`: Select the length of time for the salary adjustment. "
"The options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Duración`: Selecciona el período de tiempo para el ajuste "
"salarial. Las opciones son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`One Time`: Only one payment is taken from the employee's paycheck."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Una vez`: Solo se toma un pago del cheque de pago del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:111
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Limited`: The employee is paying a specific monetary amount in "
"total, divided up among multiple paychecks. The salary adjustment "
"automatically ends once the specified total is paid."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Limitado`: El empleado paga un importe monetario específico en "
"total, dividido en varias nóminas. El ajuste salarial finaliza "
"automáticamente una vez pagado el total especificado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unlimited`: The employee is making recurring payments towards "
"something with no end point, such as contributions to a retirement fund, or "
"a donation to a charity."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ilimitado`: El empleado está realizando pagos recurrentes hacia "
"algo sin punto final, como contribuciones a un fondo de jubilación o una "
"donación a una organización benéfica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`from`: Using the calendar selector, select the date the salary "
"adjustment goes into effect."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`desde`: Usando el selector de calendario, selecciona la fecha en "
"que el ajuste salarial entra en vigor."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:120
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Duration` field is set to :guilabel:`Limited`, "
"an :guilabel:`until (amount) paid` field appears. Enter the monetary amount "
"that must be reached to end the salary adjustment."
msgstr ""
"Si el campo :guilabel:`Duración` se establece en :guilabel:`Limitado`, "
"aparece el campo :guilabel:`hasta (importe) pagado`. Introduce el importe "
"monetario que se debe alcanzar para finalizar el ajuste salarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:124
msgid ":guilabel:`Note`: Enter a short description of the salary adjustment."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nota`: Introduce una breve descripción del ajuste salarial."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:126
msgid "The salary adjustment form with all fields filled out."
msgstr "El formulario de ajuste salarial con todos los campos completados."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:129
msgid ""
"If creating salary adjustments for multiple employees on a single salary "
"adjustment form, after the form is filled out, click the :guilabel:`Create "
"Individual Attachments` button. This creates separate salary adjustments for "
"each of the employees listed in the :guilabel:`Employees` field."
msgstr ""
"Si creas ajustes salariales para múltiples empleados en un único formulario "
"de ajuste salarial, después de completar el formulario, haz clic en el "
"botón :guilabel:`Crear adjuntos individuales`. Esto crea ajustes salariales "
"separados para cada uno de los empleados listados en el "
"campo :guilabel:`Empleados`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:133
msgid ""
"After the individual salary adjustments have been created for multiple "
"employees, the screen loads a list view of the newly created individual "
"salary adjustments. All the salary adjustments have a status "
"of :guilabel:`Running`, since they are currently active."
msgstr ""
"Tras crear los ajustes salariales individuales para varios empleados, la "
"pantalla carga una vista de lista de los ajustes salariales individuales "
"recién creados. Todos los ajustes salariales tienen el estado :guilabel:`En "
"curso`, ya que están activos actualmente."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:138
msgid "Manage salary adjustments"
msgstr "Gestionar ajustes salariales"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:140
msgid ""
"Salary adjustments that have a set amount due in total are automatically "
"closed once the *Until* amount entered on the :ref:`salary adjustment form "
"<payroll/salary_attachments/create>` has been paid in full. For all other "
"salary adjustments, it is necessary to manually close the adjustment to stop "
"taking money out of future paychecks."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes salariales que tienen un importe total pendiente establecido se "
"cierran automáticamente una vez que el importe *Hasta* introducido en el "
":ref:`formulario de ajuste salarial <payroll/salary_attachments/create>` se "
"ha pagado en su totalidad. Para el resto de ajustes salariales, es necesario "
"cerrar el ajuste manualmente para dejar de deducir dinero de las futuras "
"nóminas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:145
msgid ""
"If a salary adjustment has been fulfilled or the employee no longer wishes "
"to contribute voluntary funds, the record must be manually updated. To "
"change the status, open the *Salary Adjustment* dashboard by opening "
"the :ref:`Salary Adjustment dashboard <payroll/salary_attachments/"
"dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"Si se ha liquidado un ajuste salarial o el empleado ya no desea aportar "
"fondos voluntarios, debes actualizar el registro manualmente. Para cambiar "
"el estado, abre el tablero de *Ajustes salariales* accediendo al "
":ref:`tablero de ajustes salariales <payroll/salary_attachments/dashboard>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:149
msgid ""
"Click on the record to update, and the detailed *Salary Adjustment* form "
"loads. On the individual record, click the :guilabel:`Mark as Completed` "
"button in the corner, and the status changes to :guilabel:`Closed`."
msgstr ""
"Haz clic en el registro que quieras actualizar y se cargará el formulario "
"detallado de *Ajuste salarial*. En el registro individual, pulsa el botón "
":guilabel:`Marcar como completado` de la esquina y el estado cambiará a "
":guilabel:`Cerrado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:154
msgid ""
"The following is an example of when a payroll manager may need to manually "
"change a salary adjustment from :guilabel:`Running` to :guilabel:`Closed`."
msgstr ""
"El siguiente es un ejemplo de cuándo un responsable de nómina puede "
"necesitar cambiar manualmente un ajuste salarial de :guilabel:`En ejecución` "
"a :guilabel:`Cerrado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:157
msgid ""
"Rose Smith has a salary adjustment for a lawsuit settlement, where she is "
"required to pay $3,000.00. A salary adjustment is created that takes $250.00 "
"a month out of Rose's paycheck to go towards this settlement payment."
msgstr ""
"Rose Smith tiene un ajuste salarial por un acuerdo judicial por el que debe "
"pagar 3000,00 $. Se crea un ajuste salarial que descuenta 250,00 $ al mes de "
"la nómina de Rose para destinarlos al pago de este acuerdo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_attachments.rst:161
msgid ""
"After six months, Rose has paid $1,500.00 from her salary. She receives a "
"tax refund and uses the money to pay off the remainder of the lawsuit "
"settlement. After sending the relevant documentation to the payroll manager, "
"showing the settlement has been paid in full, the payroll manager manually "
"changes the status of her salary adjustment to :guilabel:`Closed`."
msgstr ""
"Tras seis meses, Rose ha pagado 1500,00 $ de su salario. Recibe una "
"devolución de impuestos y utiliza el dinero para liquidar el resto del "
"acuerdo judicial. Tras enviar la documentación pertinente al responsable de "
"nóminas demostrando que el acuerdo se ha pagado en su totalidad, este cambia "
"manualmente el estado de su ajuste salarial a :guilabel:`Cerrado`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo, every :ref:`salary structure <payroll/salaries/structures>` has a "
"set of salary *rules* used to compute the various amounts considered in the "
"pay. These rules are configured by the localization and affect the "
"computation of the salaries."
msgstr ""
"En Odoo, cada :ref:`estructura salarial <payroll/salaries/structures>` "
"cuenta con un conjunto de *reglas* salariales que se utilizan para calcular "
"los distintos importes contemplados en la nómina. Estas reglas están "
"configuradas por la localización y afectan al cálculo de los salarios."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:10
msgid ""
"Modification or creation of rules should **only** be done when necessary."
msgstr ""
"La modificación o creación de reglas **solo** debe hacerse cuando sea "
"necesario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:12
msgid ""
"To view all the rules, go to :menuselection:`Payroll app --> Configuration --"
"> Rules`. Click on a structure, such as :guilabel:`Regular Pay`, to view all "
"the rules."
msgstr ""
"Para ver todas las reglas, ve a :menuselection:`Aplicación Nómina --> "
"Configuración --> Reglas`. Haz clic en una estructura (como :guilabel:`Pago "
"Regular`) para ver todas las reglas."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:16
msgid "Add a new rule"
msgstr "Añadir una nueva regla"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:18
msgid ""
"To make a new rule, click :guilabel:`New` and a blank *Salary Rules* form "
"loads. Enter the following information in the top half of the form:"
msgstr ""
"Para crear una regla nueva, haz clic en :guilabel:`Nuevo` y se abrirá un "
"formulario de *Reglas salariales* en blanco. Introduce la siguiente "
"información en la mitad superior del formulario:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rule Name`: Enter a name for the rule. This is the name displayed "
"in the payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nombre de la regla`: Introduce un nombre para la regla. Este es "
"el nombre que se muestra en la nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:22
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Code`: Enter a code to be used for the new rule. This is case "
"sensitive and is used as the *rule ID*. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Código`: Introduce un código para la nueva regla. Distingue entre "
"mayúsculas y minúsculas y se utiliza como *ID de regla*. Este campo es "
"**obligatorio**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:24
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Using the drop-down menu, select the category the rule "
"applies to, or enter a new category. The category is used to group rules and "
"access their total sum."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Categoría`: Utilizando el menú desplegable, selecciona la "
"categoría a la que se aplica la regla o introduce una nueva categoría. La "
"categoría se utiliza para agrupar reglas y acceder a su suma total."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Structure`: Using the drop-down menu, select the salary "
"structure the rule applies to, or enter a new one. This field is "
"**required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Estructura salarial`: Utilizando el menú desplegable, selecciona "
"la estructura salarial a la que se aplica la regla o introduce una nueva. "
"Este campo es **obligatorio**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sequence`: Enter a number indicating *when* the rule is "
"calculated, in the sequence of all other rules. Rules are processed one "
"after another based on their sequence number. Rules with a lower sequence "
"number are calculated first, and their results can be used by rules with a "
"higher sequence number. This field is **required**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Secuencia`: Introduce un número que indique *cuándo* se calcula "
"la regla en la secuencia de todas las demás reglas. Las reglas se procesan "
"una tras otra según su número de secuencia. Las reglas con un número de "
"secuencia más bajo se calculan primero y sus resultados pueden ser "
"utilizados por reglas con un número de secuencia más alto. Este campo es "
"**obligatorio**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:32
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Appears on Payslip`: Enable this checkbox to have the rule "
"visible on the employee payslip PDF."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Aparece en el recibo de nómina`: Marca esta casilla para que la "
"regla sea visible en el PDF del recibo de nómina del empleado."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Contributes to Employer Cost`: Enable this checkbox to include "
"the rule when computing the *employer cost* of a payslip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Contribuye al coste del empleador`: Marca esta casilla para "
"incluir la regla al calcular el *coste del empleador* de un recibo de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:38
msgid "General tab"
msgstr "Pestaña general"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:40
msgid ""
"Fill out the following sections of the *General* tab. These configurations "
"determine *when* and *how* the rule is calculated."
msgstr ""
"Rellena las siguientes secciones de la pestaña *General*. Estas "
"configuraciones determinan *cuándo* y *cómo* se calcula la regla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:44
msgid "Conditions"
msgstr "Condiciones"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Condition Based on`: Using the drop-down menu, select if the rule "
"is calculated and displayed as a line in the payslip form view. Choose from "
"one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Condición basada en`: Utilizando el menú desplegable, selecciona "
"si la regla se calcula y se muestra como una línea en la vista de formulario "
"de la nómina. Elige una de las siguientes opciones:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Always True`: The rule is always calculated. No other "
"configurations are needed for this section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Siempre verdadero`: La regla siempre se calcula. No se necesitan "
"otras configuraciones para esta sección."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salary Input`: This introduces a dynamic benefit to the "
"structure. This appears as a field in the *Payroll* tab of the *Employee* "
"form, the *Inputs* tab of the payslip, or both. The value of this field is "
"added to the amount of the rule. If selected, the following additional "
"fields appear and must be configured:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Entrada salarial`: Introduce un beneficio dinámico a la "
"estructura. Aparece como un campo en la pestaña *Nómina* del formulario "
"*Empleado*, en la pestaña *Entradas* de la nómina, o en ambos. El valor de "
"este campo se añade al importe de la regla. Si se selecciona, aparecen los "
"siguientes campos adicionales que deben configurarse:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Input on`: Specify where this field should appear and which "
"object it should belong to, the :guilabel:`Employee`, "
"the :guilabel:`Payslip`, or both. If both are selected, the value on the "
"payslip automatically defaults to the value from the employee record, but it "
"can be overwritten directly on the payslip for a specific payroll run."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Entrada en`: Especifica dónde debe aparecer este campo y a qué "
"objeto debe pertenecer, el :guilabel:`Empleado`, la :guilabel:`Nómina`, o "
"ambos. Si se seleccionan ambos, el valor en la nómina toma automáticamente "
"como predeterminado el valor del registro del empleado, pero puede "
"sobrescribirse directamente en la nómina para una ejecución de nómina "
"específica."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Section`: This groups several inputs into one expandable section "
"on the form view. Only one option is available by "
"default: :guilabel:`Inputs`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sección`: agrupa varias entradas en una sección desplegable en la "
"vista de formulario. Por defecto, solo está disponible una opción: "
":guilabel:`Entradas`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:62
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unit`: Click the corresponding radio button to determine how the "
"benefit is displayed. The available options are:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Unidad`: Haz clic en el botón de opción correspondiente para "
"determinar cómo se muestra el beneficio. Las opciones disponibles son:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:65
msgid ":guilabel:`Monetary`: A number with currency."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Monetario`: Un número con moneda."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity`: A number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Cantidad`: Un número."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:67
msgid ":guilabel:`Percentage`: A number with a % sign."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Porcentaje`: Un número con el signo %."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:68
msgid ":guilabel:`Checkbox`: Indicates boolean values."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Casilla de verificación`: Indica valores booleanos."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Input Description`: Enter a short explanation of when the input "
"is applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Descripción de entrada`: Introduce una breve explicación de "
"cuándo es aplicable la entrada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:71
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Value`: Enter the default value, either a monetary "
"amount, quantity, or percentage. This is determined by what is selected for "
"the :guilabel:`Unit`. If necessary, add a :guilabel:`Suffix` in the field to "
"the right of this value, such as `per km`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valor predeterminado`: Introduce el valor predeterminado, ya sea "
"un importe monetario, cantidad o porcentaje. Esto viene determinado por lo "
"que se selecciona en :guilabel:`Unidad`. Si es necesario, añade "
"un :guilabel:`Sufijo` en el campo a la derecha de este valor, como `por km`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:76
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Checkbox` is selected for the :guilabel:`Unit`, this field "
"changes to :guilabel:`Selected by Default`. Click the checkbox to have the "
"rule active by default."
msgstr ""
"Si se selecciona :guilabel:`Casilla de verificación` en :guilabel:`Unidad`, "
"este campo cambia a :guilabel:`Seleccionado por defecto`. Marca la casilla "
"para que la regla esté activa por defecto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Depends On`: Select another rule that has a salary input, and use "
"its value to determine whether this rule should be hidden."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Depende de`: Selecciona otra regla que tenga una entrada de "
"salario y usa su valor para determinar si esta regla debe ocultarse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other Input`: Select this to check if a payslip line exists with "
"the same *type*. When selected, a :guilabel:`Condition Other Input` field "
"appears. Using the drop-down menu, select the type of input the rule is "
"based on, such as :guilabel:`Deduction`, :guilabel:`Reimbursement`, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Otra entrada`: Selecciona esto para comprobar si existe una línea "
"de nómina con el mismo *tipo*. Al seleccionarlo, aparece un "
"campo :guilabel:`Condición otra entrada`. Usando el menú desplegable, "
"selecciona el tipo de entrada en el que se basa la regla, "
"como :guilabel:`Deducción`, :guilabel:`Reembolso`, etc."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Python Expression`: Select this to have the rule calculated using "
"a Python script. The script is evaluated using the local dictionary. The "
"right side lists the :guilabel:`Available variables` and "
"the :guilabel:`Output`:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Expresión Python`: Selecciona esto para que la regla se calcule "
"usando un script Python. El script se evalúa usando el diccionario local. El "
"lado derecho lista las :guilabel:`Variables disponibles` y "
"la :guilabel:`Salida`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:90
