msgstr ""
":guilabel:`worked_days`: Un diccionario que contiene los días trabajados "
"calculados, donde cada clave es un código de tipo de entrada de trabajo, y "
"cada valor es un objeto `worked_days`. Este objeto contiene muchas "
"variables, siendo las más importantes:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:110
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:187
msgid ""
":guilabel:`number_of_days`: The number of days registered in the payslip "
"duration with this work entry type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`number_of_days`: El número de días registrados en la duración de "
"la nómina con este tipo de entrada de trabajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`number_of_hours`: The number of hours registered in the payslip "
"duration with this work entry type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`number_of_hours`: El número de horas registradas en la duración "
"de la nómina con este tipo de entrada de trabajo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`is_paid`: Whether or not this work entry type is added as an "
"unpaid work entry on this payslip structure."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`is_paid`: Si este tipo de entrada de trabajo se añade o no como "
"una entrada de trabajo no remunerada en esta estructura de nómina."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:117
msgid ""
":guilabel:`inputs`: A dictionary containing the computed inputs where *key* "
"is the other input type code and *value* is the sum of the payslip input "
"lines with the same code."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`inputs`: Un diccionario que contiene las entradas calculadas "
"donde *key* es el código del otro tipo de entrada y *value* es la suma de "
"las líneas de entrada de nómina con el mismo código."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:120
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:197
msgid ":guilabel:`Output`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Output`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`result`: The boolean is *True* if the rule should be calculated, "
"or *False* if otherwise."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`result`: El booleano es *True* si la regla debe calcularse, o "
"*False* en caso contrario."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: Select this option to apply the rule *only* if it "
"matches the configured :guilabel:`Applicability Domain`. Configure "
"the :guilabel:`Applicability Domain` that appears beneath this option when "
"selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: Selecciona esta opción para aplicar la regla "
"*únicamente* si coincide con el :guilabel:`Applicability Domain` "
"configurado. Configura el :guilabel:`Applicability Domain` que aparece "
"debajo de esta opción cuando está seleccionada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:130
msgid "Computation"
msgstr "Cálculo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:132
msgid ""
"This section determines the final value of the rule, which consists of the "
"base amount, the quantity, and the rate. The total of the rule is `total = "
"amount * quantity * (rate/100)`."
msgstr ""
"Esta sección determina el valor final de la regla, que consiste en el "
"importe base, la cantidad y la tasa. El total de la regla es `total = amount "
"* quantity * (rate/100)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:136
msgid ""
"This field does **not** appear if the :guilabel:`Condition Based on` field "
"is set to :guilabel:`Salary Input`."
msgstr ""
"Este campo **no** aparece si el campo :guilabel:`Condition Based on` está "
"configurado como :guilabel:`Salary Input`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:139
msgid ""
"Using the drop-down menu, select one of the following options for "
"the :guilabel:`Amount Type` field:"
msgstr ""
"Usando el menú desplegable, selecciona una de las siguientes opciones para "
"el campo :guilabel:`Amount Type`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Percentage (%)`: Defines the values for the total calculation. "
"When selected, configure the following fields:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Percentage (%)`: Define los valores para el cálculo total. Cuando "
"está seleccionado, configura los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Percentage based on`: A Python expression is evaluated using the "
"`localdict`, and its value is assigned to the rule amount."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Percentage based on`: Se evalúa una expresión Python usando el "
"`localdict`, y su valor se asigna al importe de la regla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:146
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:152
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Quantity`: A Python expression is evaluated using the "
"`localdict`, and its value is assigned to the rule quantity."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Quantity`: Se evalúa una expresión Python usando el `localdict`, "
"y su valor se asigna a la cantidad de la regla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:148
msgid ":guilabel:`Percentage (%)`: A decimal number assigned to the rule rate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Percentage (%)`: Un número decimal asignado a la tasa de la regla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:150
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Amount`: The amount and quantity is defined, with a rate of "
"100%."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Amount`: El importe y la cantidad se definen, con una tasa "
"del 100%."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:154
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Amount`: Enter a decimal number which is assigned to the "
"rule amount."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Amount`: Introduce un número decimal que se asigna al "
"importe de la regla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Other Input`: Select this to fetch the rule amount from the "
"payslip input lines that have the same *other input type* with rate of "
"`100%` and quantity of `1.0`. When selected, an :guilabel:`Amount Other "
"Input` field appears beneath it. Using the drop-down menu, select the *type* "
"of input it is, such as :guilabel:`Deduction`, :guilabel:`Tips`, "
"or :guilabel:`Expenses`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Other Input`: Selecciona esto para obtener el importe de la regla "
"de las líneas de entrada de nómina que tienen el mismo *tipo de otra "
"entrada* con una tasa del `100%` y una cantidad de `1.0`. Cuando está "
"seleccionado, aparece un campo :guilabel:`Amount Other Input` debajo. Usando "
"el menú desplegable, selecciona el *tipo* de entrada que es, "
"como :guilabel:`Deduction`, :guilabel:`Tips`, o :guilabel:`Gastos`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:161
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Python Code`: This is the more complex version of "
"the :guilabel:`Percentage (%)` option, where a whole Python script is "
"written then evaluated using the `localdict`. This includes a list "
"of :guilabel:`Available variables` and an :guilabel:`Output` list."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Python Code`: Esta es la versión más compleja de la "
"opción :guilabel:`Percentage (%)`, donde se escribe un script Python "
"completo y luego se evalúa usando el `localdict`. Esto incluye una lista "
"de :guilabel:`Available variables` y una lista de :guilabel:`Output`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:167
msgid ":guilabel:`payslip`: hr.payslip object"
msgstr ":guilabel:`payslip`: objeto hr.payslip"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/salary_rules.rst:168
