msgstr ""
"Dado que solo se muestran las solicitudes de ausencias que necesitan ser "
"aprobadas, las únicas opciones de :icon:`fa-folder` :guilabel:`Estado` "
"son :guilabel:`Todos`, :guilabel:`Por aprobar` y :guilabel:`Segunda "
"aprobación`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:41
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/time_off/management.rst:138
msgid ""
"The various departments the user is a member of, and manages employees "
